<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Saafi corrections après conseiller</book>
  <para style="h">Camba</para>
  <para style="toc3">Cam</para>
  <para style="toc2">Camba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Camba, teerndi koc ŋ Tawreet</para>
  <para style="mt">Camba</para>
  <para style="mt2">Teerndi koc ŋ Tawreet</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Teerndii na woyse "Camba", wa teerndi koc ngaŋ teereeci yatuus ciŋ <char style="tl">Tawreetiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>, te teereeciŋ <char style="tl">Tawreeti</char>, caɗ teereeci koc ŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci. Teerndi teeku "Camba", wa na naandsuke in ci uup maañ ŋ Adina.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngaŋ jangiŋ Camba, ambtiɗoh ciŋ Kooh na ɓooɓi etohiɗ marku. Ambtiɗohi koc nga, a tuma na Noohin na in ci na pese ŋ adinaani jen ; degga nga, a nammba ambtiɗoh na Ibrahiima na ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe. Ŋ ambtiɗoheem Kooh gapohha ne a hey barke'ɗe cuuɓ ciŋ kehƴi jen taamboh nga ɓa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Teerndiŋ Camba kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Naandsukiŋ feraŋ Adinaani <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 1-2">1–2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Cambaŋ bakaaɗ na kakaan <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 3">3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Findi gomal ci taambtiɗoh ini kooɗoh Aadama po ŋ Noohin <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 4-6">4–6</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Naandsukiŋ gaaliŋ Noohin <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 7-8">7–8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Findi gomal ci taambtiɗoh ŋ Noohin po ŋ Ibrahiima <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 9-11">9–11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kipes kiŋ Ibrahiima <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 11-25">11–25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kipes kiŋ Isaahha, kuɓkiŋ Ibrahiima <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 21-35">21–35</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kipes kiŋ Yaŋhooɓa, kuɓkiŋ Isaahha <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 25-50">25–50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kuɓuuciŋ Yaŋhooɓa nikiɗ cuuɓiŋ Israayel ŋ <char style="w">Misra</char> <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 37-50">37–50</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Feraŋ Adina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Ŋ camba, Kooh fer eel ci na kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Kehƴi nikee hulang, wa nikka ɓarang. E ñuus muuree masma, te <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> seree ŋ ɗafuk wa. <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Kooh woosa ne : « Wa wiisaat ! » Wa wiissa. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />A hotta ne siñaari baahiɗ, a nistohha siñaari na ñuusi. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />A teekka siñaari "noh", a teekka ñuusi "wek". Niin raakka, ɓaaɓ raakka, wa nikka mbeha ɗeɓ.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Wa weem coot, Kooh woosa ne : « Raɗsuk raakaat ŋ harmban masuɓ ci, ne wa nistoh masuɓ na masuɓ. » <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />A haɓiɗta raɗsuki. A nistohha masmi ŋ ooɓ raɗsuki na masma ŋ ɗafka. Te wa nikohha ɗaa. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />A teekka raɗsuki "eel ci". Niin raakka, ɓaaɓ raakka, wa nikka mbeha kanakɗoh.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Ŋ finho ineem, Kooh woosa ne : « Masmi ŋ ooɓ eel ci nangɗukohaat ɗisik yino po keheƴ suyiɗ pul. » Te wa nikohha ɗaa. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />A teekka ɓaki suyɗi "keheƴ", a teekka masmi nangɗukohɗi "cookom". A hotta ne wa baahiɗ.<verse eid="GEN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Ngaŋ woo keem, Kooh woyissa ne : « Kehƴi riifaat na in ci na paare : paangiici ɓay tisoh, na kidig ci na ñamse, kidig nu nik na rimiŋ wa na tisohiŋ wa ŋ ɗooƴi, ŋ findi mandohaaɗiŋ wa, ŋ kehƴi. » Te wa nikohha ɗaa. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Kehƴi paarra paangi ɓayiɗ tisoh findi mandohaaɗ ciŋ ca, kidig ci na rime findi mandohaaɗ ciŋ ca, waa nu nik na tisohiŋ wa. A hotta ne wa baahiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Niin raakka, ɓaaɓ raakka, wa nikka mbeha kaahayɗoh.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Wa mbeheem coot, Kooh woosa ne : « Ngaŋ raɗsukiŋ eel ci, wa raakaat in ci raak siñaar, ne ca nistoh noh na wek, ca teeɓoh jamano na mbeh na kiis. <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />Ŋ raɗsukiŋ eel ci, ca nikaat siñaar ne ca siñaariɗ kehƴi. » Te wa nikohha ɗaa. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Kooh haɓiɗta siñaar kanak yakak, wi yakki ne wa adgoh noh, wi ƴini ne wa adgoh wek. A haɓiɗta yit hor ci. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />A seriɗta ca ŋ raɗsukiŋ eel ci ne ca siñaariɗ kehƴi, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />ne ca adgoh noh na wek, ca nistoh siñaar na ñuus. A hotta ne wa baahiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Niin raakka, ɓaaɓ raakka, wa nikka mbeha nikiisɗoh.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Ŋ woo keem, Kooh woyissa ne : « Ngaŋ masuɓ ci, cuurund na inaama wiiriis aastiɗohaat, sel pundaat ŋ eel ci, ŋ ɗafuk kehƴi. » <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Ŋ ineem, a ferra ɗoopaat ci yakak ci ŋ cookmi, na inaamaaci na huƴe, ca weƴee jen ŋ ɗooƴ masuɓ ci. A ferra ca ŋ findi mandohaaɗ ciŋ ca. A ferra yit in ci raak paɓ jen, findi mandohaaɗ ciŋ ca. A hotta ne wa baahiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />A barke'iɗta ca, an : « Nikaat ɓasloh, rimaatɗohaat, riifɗaat masmiŋ cookmi, te yit, sel ci rimaatɗoh ŋ kehƴi. » <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Niin raakka, ɓaaɓ raakka, wa nikka mbeha yatuusɗoh.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Wa weem coot, Kooh woosa ne : « Kehƴi pulɗaat inaama findi mandohaaɗ ciŋ ca, ɗoopaat ci raakan heɗ, na ci raakanɗi heɗ, na inaama ƴin findi mandohaaɗ ciŋ ca. » Te wa nikohha ɗaa. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />A ferra ɗoopaat ci raakanɗi heɗ findi mandohaaɗ ciŋ ca, a ferra ci raakan heɗ findi mandohaaɗ ciŋ ca, a ferra inaamaaci ƴin ci ŋ kehƴi jen findi mandohaaɗ ciŋ ca. A hotta ne wa baahiɗ.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Ngaŋ woo keem, a woyissa ne : « Ɓoo haɓɗaat ɓo' ŋ ñaamaariŋ ɓoo, findi mandohaaɗiŋ ɓoo, ne ɓa adgoh cuurund ciŋ cookmi, na sel ciŋ eel ci, na ɗoopaat ci, ne ɓa adgoh kehƴi jen, na in ci na yoonde ŋ kehƴi. » <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Kooh ferra ɓo' ŋ ñaamaariŋ ɗe. Ngaŋ ñaamaariŋ Kooh, a ferra ɓa, ƴaar na ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />A barke'iɗta ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓaslaat, rimaatɗohaat, riifɗaat kehƴi, minaat kehƴi jen, adgohaat cuurund ciŋ cookmi, na sel ciŋ eel ci, na in ci na yoonde ŋ kehƴi jen. »<verse eid="GEN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Kooh dokkissa, woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓayaat, ŋ on ɗu paangi nu nik ne weɗi ŋ kehƴi jen, na kidig nu amboh rim na tisohiŋ wa ɗah. Ca nik pesohaaciŋ ɗu. » <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Kooh woosa ne : « Ɗoopaat ciŋ kehƴi, sel ci na punde, in ci na yoonde ŋ kehƴi, in ci na iike jen, ŋ on ca ne, ca pesoh paangi iiri. » Te wa nikohha ɗaa. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Kooh hotta in ci a ƴut haɓiɗ jen, ca baahha lool. Niin raakka, ɓaaɓ raakka, wa nikka mbeha yasna-yino'ɗoh.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Eel ci na kehƴi, na in ci ñimniɗ ci tumu nga, reehoh feru ɗaa.<verse eid="GEN 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Ŋ mbeha yasna-kanakɗoh, Kooh iɗsiɗukka, raak ɗe mitɗiɗ pangkaŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Weɗ tah po Kooh barke'iɗta mbehi yasna-kanakɗoh, a hooliɗtaa wuu ce, laam a iɗsiɗuk nga, wi a ƴut fer in ci jen. <verse eid="GEN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Naandsukiŋ feriŋ eel ci na kehƴi weɗi weem.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 2:4">Feruukiŋ ɓo'</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Wa Nikiɗi Kooh feree kehƴi na eel ci, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />ali kidig raakeeɗi paaɗ ŋ bilaf fi, te ali paangi puleeɗi ndoom, laam raak Nikiɗi Kooh toɓɗi ŋ kehƴi, te ɓo' raakeeɗi ne a guur merhey mi. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Hondohɗi masuɓ puleeɗa ŋ kehƴi te wa iiri'ɗeeɗa kehƴi jen.<verse eid="GEN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Ŋ jamanoonaam, Nikiɗi Kooh mahha ɓo' na merhey miŋ kehƴi, a fuuɗissa ngaŋ kiñin kaŋ ɗe iik kipes, jaarra a nikka pesoh. <verse eid="GEN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Raak, Nikiɗi Kooh haɓɗeen nguuk, ŋ pulohaaɗ-noh, ngaŋ Eden, a ɓekka ɓoya a mahee nga. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />A paariɗta kidig nu nik ŋ merhey ma, ca moɗta ŋ has, ca neɓpa ñamu, te ngaŋ leernaŋ nguuka, a paariɗta kidgaŋ kipes ki na kidgaŋ inhisoh baahiɗ na baahaaɗi.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Cul puleeɗa ŋ Eden, wa iiri'ɗeeɗa nguuka, wa pulohee ndeem, wa salla sal nikiis. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Sala ɗeɓ teeksee Pison, wa wileen ŋ kur kaŋ Hawiilaa jen, ɗiska urus raake ; <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />ursaŋ kur keem, wa nikee koceet, ndeem raakee makndi eeñɗohaani na woyse <char style="tl">badoolah</char> na pemeeni na woyse <char style="w"><char style="tl">sooham</char></char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">sooham</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa atoh peme ruumind ; ngaŋ farañse wa miniɗ nik ne weɗ "</char><char style="it">cornaline</char>", "<char style="it">onyx</char>" ruumind wala "<char style="it">béryl</char>"</note>. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Sala kanakɗoha teeksee Gihon, wa wilee wil kur kaŋ Kuus jen. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Sala kaahayɗoha teeksee Tigar, wa nupɗee ŋ pulohaaɗ-nohaŋ Assuur. Sala nikiisɗoha nikka Ewfaraat.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Ŋ ineem, Nikiɗi Kooh ɓayya ɓoya, a tummba ɗe guuroh na niiɗohaŋ nguukaŋ Eden. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />A huflukka ɗe ne : « Fu miniɗ ñam rim ciŋ kidig ciŋ nguuki jen. <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />Waaye kidgiŋ inhisoh baahiɗ na baahaaɗi, fu heyɗi ñame nga, laam mbaɗna fu ñaman nga ɗah, fu hey kaane fut ! »<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Wa weem coot, Nikiɗi Kooh woosa ne : « Ɗaay kiik ce baahɗi ngaŋ ɓo'. Ŋ hey ɗe haɓɗiɗe ɓaatɗohoh yi min kerhiɗoh na ɗe. » <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Ŋ ineem, raak Nikiɗi Kooh maheen na merhey ɗoopaat ci jen, na sel ci pundoh ci jen, a kommba ɓoya ca, ne a kerah findi yeem teekan ca ; yaa nu nik hey ɓeeɗkasse findi ƴaara na hee ɗe teeke. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Wa a kom ɓoya ca, ɓoya feriɗta ca tiik jen, ɗoopaat ciŋ kahan ci, sel ci pundoh ci, na ɗoopaat ciŋ nduufi. Waaye a yi, a hotiɗɗi haf ce ɓaatɗohoh yi min kerhiɗoh na ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Ŋ ineem, Nikiɗi Kooh pani'iɗta ɓoya, a neehha neeh nooɗiɗ. A nihissa ƴoh yino ngaŋ lah-fisaaraŋ ɗe, a rannga ɗiska na neh. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Nikiɗi Kooh ɓayya ƴoha a nihsoh ŋ ɓoya weem, a mahha ɓitiɓ naa, a kommba ɓoya ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Wa ɓoya hot ɗe, a ƴeella, a woosa ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">« Waasii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">yii a ƴohiŋ ƴoh ciŋ ngo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">na nehiŋ nehiŋ ngo !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">Ɓoyii teeksan ɓo' ɓitiɓ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">laam a kooɗohu ŋ ɓo' ƴaar. »<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Wa taamboh ɗaa po, ƴaar hey saɓsukohe na yaay na baab, a ŋoɗ ŋ ɓitiice, ɓa nik faan yino. <verse eid="GEN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Te wa nikka ne ɓeɗ ɓi kanak ceem, ƴaara na ɓitiice, ɓa nikee faan ɓarang te ɓa supkeeɗi nga.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Bakaaɗi koc na findi Kooh tumoh naa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Waam, e iiñ uupee ñaañ ŋ ɗoopaat ciŋ nduufi Nikiɗi Kooh fere ; iiña woosa ɓitɓa ne : « Andi wa keeh ne, e Kooh woo ne, ɗu joyɗi ñam ali rim kidig, ŋ kidig ci ŋ ɗooƴ nguuki ? » <verse eid="GEN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Ɓitɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo miniɗ ñam rim ciŋ kidig ci ŋ nguuki. <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />Waaye ini kaɗ ŋ rim ciŋ kidgi ŋ leerniŋ nguuki, Kooh woo ne ɓoo kanaat ca ñam, ɓoo kanaat ca sah reɓ wala ɓoo hey kaane fut. » <verse eid="GEN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Iiña loffa ɗe ne : « Muk, ɗu heyɗi kaane. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Kooh inah inah ne, ɗu ñama ɗah, liiɓohaaciŋ ɗu hey rangsuke, ɗu hey inhisohe baahiɗ na baahaaɗi findiice. »<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Ɓitɓa marakka rim caŋ kidga, a hotta ne ca moɗiɗ ŋ has, ca mandiɗ na ini neɓ, te ca maɗaah ñamu ne ca rangis liiɓoha. A ɓeennda nga, a ñammba, a nammba eɗ ƴaar ce raak ɗe nga, yeem ñammba. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska liiɓohaacaŋ ɓa rangsukka, weɗ ɓa inhiskoh kotii ne ɓa tas ɓarang ; ɓa ɓayya ɓi saaf mbaɗet, ɓa tokɗohha ca, ɓa kenukka ca.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Wa noha soos po puuɗsa ef-efɗeeɗa, ɓoya na ɓitiice kerahha Nikiɗi Kooh wileeɗa ŋ nguuka, ɓa ɗembeeɗa ɗe ŋ kidig ca. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Nikiɗi Kooh ɓeeɗukka ɓo', a woosa ɗe ne : « Fu ŋ nde ? » <verse eid="GEN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />A loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ kerah ɗa kerah ŋ ɗooƴ nguuki, ŋ tiitta, weɗi ŋ ɗasɗukoh ɗa laam ŋ tas ɓarang. » <verse eid="GEN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Nikiɗi Kooh woosa ɗe ne : « Moo, ya ɓa woo ɗa ne fu tas ɓarang ? Fu ñam ŋ kidgi ŋ sangohee ɗa e ? » <verse eid="GEN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Ɓoya woosa ɗe ne : « E ɓitɓi fu ambsoh ho na ɗe, a yi eɗ to ŋ rim ciŋ kidgi, ŋ ñammba. » <verse eid="GEN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Nikiɗi Kooh woosa ɓitɓa ne : « Wee ɓek ɗa ŋ ineem ? » Ɓitɓa woosa ɗe ne : « E iiñi ñaañoh ho po ŋ ñammbaa. »<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Nikiɗi Kooh woosa iiña ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">« Ŋ ini fu tum weem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">ŋ alkiɗ ɗa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">ngaŋ ɗoopaat ciŋ kahan ci</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">na ciŋ bilaf fi jen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">fu na hee hey faske</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">te fu genan melemsuk</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">ŋ muniŋ merhey mi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">ngaŋ kipes kiŋ ɗa jen.<verse eid="GEN 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Ŋ hey ɓeke sangtiɗoh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">ŋ harmban fu na ɓitɓi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">na harmban ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">na ɓiŋ ɗe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">Ɓi rimkohan nga ɗe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">hey pooke hafiŋ ɗa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">te fu ɗoɓan ɓa ŋ patang kot. »<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />A nammba woo ɓitɓa ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">« Ŋ hey tume po,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">fu nik rook ɗah, fu laay miskiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">te fu ɓaslan ngaŋ miskiɗ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">Fu hey ɗiiɗke ŋ ƴaar fu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">waaye a yi yilfan ɗa. »<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />A hannda woo ƴaara ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">« Fu kerhiɗ woo kiŋ ɓitiifu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">po fu ñamiɗ ŋ kidgi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">ŋ sangohee ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">fu tahiɗ po merhey mi alkuuɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">ŋ kipes kiŋ ɗa jen fu hey yaaɓe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">ne fu han raak pesoha ŋ kehƴi.<verse eid="GEN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Wa hey paare ñapir</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:18">na paangi raakiɗ rup</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:18">te fu na hee hey guure kotii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:18">ne fu ñam.<verse eid="GEN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Fu pesohan opiŋ ɗa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">po mbaɗna fu dokkan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">ŋ kehƴi fu puloh.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">Laam fu haɓɗohu merhey</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">te fu dokkan ŋ merhey mi. »<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Ŋ ineem ƴaara teekka ɓitiice Aawa (pesohi). Laam a yi yaayiŋ ɓooɓi na pese jen. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Nikiɗi Kooh haɓɗiɗta Aadama na ɓitiice kulɓa und, a ɓekiɗta ɓa ca. <verse eid="GEN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />A woosa ne : « Ŋ ɗiski wa nik ndii, ɓo' inhisohiɗ baahiɗ na baahaaɗi findi ɓoo ; a joyɗi ɓeen kotii ŋ rim ciŋ kidgi na onohe kipes, a joyɗi ca ñam po kipes kiŋ ɗe kee nika po faw. » <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Nikiɗi Kooh puliɗta ɗe ŋ nguuka ŋ Eden ne a guur merhey mi a mahohu.<verse eid="GEN 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Wa a aañ ɓo', a ɗaakka ŋ pulohaaɗ-nohaŋ nguuka, niiɗoh ci na woyse <char style="w"><char style="tl">seruben</char></char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">seruben</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ceɗ farañse na woye "<char style="tl">chérubin</char>". Ca feruuɗ findi malaakaaci, ca na pangke wuu Kooh. Ca raak paɓ, na ñaamaar ɓo' ambsukohiɗ na ñaamaar ɗoopaat.</char></note> na ndang yongkaah wi na mbiliirke ɓak nu ɓak ne ɓa sangoh waasa kaɗ ŋ kidga na onohe kipes.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Ɓi ɗeɓ rimuk ŋ Aadama na Aawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Ŋ finho ineem Aadama hunnda na ɓitiice Aawa, yeem ammba rook po a ɓasilla, a teekka kuɓka Kayin. A yi Aawa, a woosa ne : « Ŋ ɓaatɗohiŋ Nikiɗi ŋ raakiɗ ɓo' ƴaar. » <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />A raakissa kuɓu ƴaar wiiriis teeku Abel, taambɗoh Kayin. Abel nikka niiɗoh, Kayin nikka guuroh.<verse eid="GEN 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Wa kaɗoh kaɗoh po Kayin ɓayya ŋ in ca a guure, a puliɗta <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkaah</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">seeƴuk </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ɗeɓgaan, ɓooɓa seeƴkeen wuu Kooh, waaye, wa ɗalohiɗ na seeƴki woti-woti. Laam, ɓa seeƴkee wuu Nikiɗi Kooh, wa nikee wuu in wiiriis haa te ali in nikeeɗi ŋ harmban ɓa na Kooh.</char></note> wuu Nikiɗi. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Abel nammba ɓay ŋ saaw caŋ gat caŋ ɗe, a puliɗta seeƴkaah ngaŋ sepet caŋ mbaal ca uupee fayum. Ŋ ineem Nikiɗi neɓuusa ŋ Abel, a teyɗukka ina a eɗoh, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />waaye a neɓuuɗi ŋ Kayin na ina a eɗoh. Ineem ɓekka Kayin aay-keeñ miskiɗ, a ñuusɗukka. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Nikiɗi meekissa ɗe ne : « Fu ayruk ye po fikiiriŋ ɗa mannda an ? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Tumohaaɗiŋ ɗa baah ɗah, fu hey teyɗukɗasse ; fu tumɗi baahiɗ ɗah, bakaaɗi weɗi wii raɗukka ŋ nguɓu tuuƴ fu na sekee ɗa, ne wa yilif ɗa, te ya fu joya min. »<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Waaye, Kayin woosa taambɗoh ce ne ɓa kaɗ yohon ca. Wa ɓa nik ŋ yohon ca, Kayin soonnga Abel, a appa ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Ɗekka po Nikiɗi meekissa ɗe ne : « Kayin, a nde taambɗoh fu Abel ? » A loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ inahɗi kat, ñam na niiɗee ɗe haa. » <verse eid="GEN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Nikiɗi woosa ɗe ne : « Fu haɓiɗ ye an ? Ŋ kerhiɗ ñif miŋ taambɗoh fu looƴkohha kehƴi po nga so ne wa wirndukɗu. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Fu alkuuɗ po merhey mi faɗiɗ ɗa, laam ya fu aniɗa ñif miŋ taambɗoh fu fu aam. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Fu guuris merhey mi ɗah, wa eɗissanɗi ɗa in. Fu na hee hey wiltiɗohe ŋ kehƴi, fu genanɗi ɗisik yino. »<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kayin woosa Nikiɗi ne : « Ini fu deg go ɓitootiɗ lool po ŋ antalɗaa. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Woti fu aañiɗ to ŋ merhey mi an e ? Ŋ hotiɗ ne ŋ hey ɗa use, mi na hee hey wiltiɗohe ŋ kehƴi, ŋ genanɗi ɗisik yino po ɓo' nu hot to ɗah, a ap po. » <verse eid="GEN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Nikiɗi woosa Kayin ne : « Kon, ɓo' nu ap ɗa ɗah, fu hey wirndukɗasse waas yasna-kanak. » A waakiɗta Kayin inhisoha, ne ɓo' nu hot ɗe ɗah, a apuu ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Wa taambohha ɗaa, Kayin kaɗta gena kur ka na woyse Nood, ŋ pulohaaɗ-nohaŋ Eden, a ussa Nikiɗi.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi puloh ŋ Kayin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Kayin hunnda na ɓitiice, yeem ammba rook po a ɓasilla, a teekka kuɓka Henok. Kayin yippa kur-taah, a teekkaa ngaŋ kuɓkiŋ ɗe Henok. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Henok nikka baabiŋ Irad, Irad nikka baabiŋ Mehuya'el, Mehuya'el nikka baabiŋ Metusa'el, Metusa'el nikka baabiŋ Lemek.<verse eid="GEN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />A yi Lemek, a ɓayya ɓitiɓ kanak, yi koc na woyse Aada, yi kanakɗoh, Silla. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Aada a yi rim Yabal, baab-caaciŋ ɓi na gene ŋ <char style="w">ɗiip</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɗiip </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ɗiip ci ɓa genohee ɗeɓgaan ca nikee ndut haɓɗohu piis wala und.</char></note> ci, niiɗe gat ci. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Taambɗoh ce ƴaar, ya teekse Yuubal, a yi baab-caaciŋ halmoh ci na mbiiɓoh ci. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Silla, ɓitɓiŋ ɗe yinoora, rimmba Tubal-Kayin, sisɓi na tiɓe moos na tiwiñ. Tubal-Kayin raakeen taambɗoh ɓitiɓ teeku Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lemek woosa ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɗe ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">« Ee, ɗu ɓi ɓitiɓ ciŋ ngo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Aada na Silla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Sikɗukaat woo kiŋ ngo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Heeh, sikɗukaat to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">ɗu ɓi ɓitiɓ ciŋ Lemek.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Ƴaar gaañiɗ to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">ŋ appa ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Komaaki ɓuurra so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">ŋ boommba ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Te nik ne e Kayin na hee wirndukɗasse</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">waas yasna-kanak ne a apu ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">cam ! Lemek na hee wirndukɗasse</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">waas ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak na yasna-kanak (77) ! »<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Aadama hunisseen na ɓitiice, a ambissa rook, a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, Aawa teekka ɗe Set<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tiikiŋ "Set" mand na "eɗ" wala "on" ŋ peɗeem heber. </char></note>, laam a woyee ne : « Kooh oniɗ to kuɓu wiiriis, yi na hee namsiɗe Abel, yi Kayin ap. »<verse eid="GEN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Set nammba raak kuɓu, a teekka ɗe Enos. Ŋ jamanoocaam, weɗ ɓa camboh ɓeeɗkoh Kooh ŋ tiikiŋ Nikiɗi.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Findi gomal ci taambtiɗoh ŋ Aadama po ŋ Noohin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Inii weɗ naandsuku ŋ Aadama na ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 5:1">Wa Kooh na fere ɓo', a fer ɓa ŋ mandohaaɗiŋ ɗe haf ce. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />A yi Kooh a ferra ɓa ƴaar na ɓitiɓ a barke'iɗta ɓa, a teekka ɓa ɓo' ŋ noha mbaɗi.<verse eid="GEN 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Wa Aadama pes kiis teemet na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (130), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar ya ɓay mandohaaɗaŋ ɗe na ñaamaaraŋ ɗe, a teekka ɗe Set. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Set, Aadama pesiɗ kiis teemet-yasna-kaahay (800) te a raakisseen ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />A kaan wa a raak kiis teemet-yasna-nikiis na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (930).<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Wa Set pes kiis teemet na kiis yatuus (105), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Enos. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Enos, Set pesiɗ kiis teemet-yasna-kaahay na kiis yasna-kanak (807). A raakisseen ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />A kaan wa a raak kiis teemet-yasna-nikiis na kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis kanak (912).<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Wa Enos pes kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-nikiis (90), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Kenan. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Kenan, Enos pesiɗ kiis teemet-yasna-kaahay na kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis yatuus (815). A raakisseen ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />A kaan wa a raak kiis teemet-yasna-nikiis na kiis yatuus (905).<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Wa Kenan pes kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak (70), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Mahalal'el. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Mahalal'el, Kenan pesiɗ kiis teemet-yasna-kaahay na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (840). A raakisseen ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />A kaan wa a raak kiis teemet-yasna-nikiis na kiis ndaŋkiyaah (910).<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Wa Mahalal'el pes kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino na kiis yatuus (65), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Yered. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Yered, Mahalal'el pesiɗ kiis teemet-yasna-kaahay na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (830). A raakisseen ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />A kaan wa a raak kiis teemet-yasna-kaahay na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-nikiis na kiis yatuus (895).<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Wa Yered pes kiis teemet na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino na kiis kanak (162), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Henok. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Henok, Yered pesiɗ kiis teemet-yasna-kaahay (800). A raakisseen ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />A kaan wa a raak kiis teemet-yasna-nikiis na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino na kiis kanak (962).<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Wa Henok pes kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino na kiis yatuus (65), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Matusalem. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Henok hunee na Kooh. Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Matusalem, a pessa ŋ ineem kiis teemet-kaahay (300). A raakisseen ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Ina a pes jen wa kiis teemet-kaahay na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino na kiis yatuus (365). <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Henok hunee na Kooh po a hotissuuɗi laam Kooh rapiɗ ɗe rapiɗ ŋ serooce.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Wa Matusalem pes kiis teemet na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kaahay na kiis yasna-kanak (187), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Lemek. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Lemek, Matusalem pesiɗ kiis teemet-yasna-kanak na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kaahay na kiis kanak (782). A raakisseen ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />A kaan wa a raak kiis teemet-yasna-nikiis na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino na kiis yasna-nikiis (969).<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Wa Lemek pes kiis teemet na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kaahay na kiis kanak (182), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />A teekka ɗe Noohin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tiikiŋ "Noohin" reɓ mand na "eɗfiɗ" ŋ peɗeem heber.</char></note> te a woosa ne : « Ŋ alki Nikiɗi aluk kehƴi wii, yii a yi na hee eɗfiɗe coonaaniŋ ɓoo ŋ pangki. » <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Noohin, Lemek pesiɗ kiis teemet-yatuus na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-nikiis na kiis yatuus (595). A nameen raak ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />A kaan wa a raak kiis teemet-yasna-kanak na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak na kiis yasna-kanak (777). <verse eid="GEN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Wa Noohin pes kiis teemet-yatuus (500), a raakeen kuɓu kaahay, Sem na Haam na Yaafet.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Inwaasoona ambee Kooh ŋ ɓooɓa a fere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Wa ɓo' ci camb ñimin ŋ adinaani, te ɓa raakka ɓi komaaki cafaƴ, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />safaal ca hotta ne cafaƴ caŋ ɓo' ca moɗiɗ, ɓa ɓayya ɓitiɓ ngaŋ ɓi neɓ ɓa nga ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Ŋ ineem, Nikiɗi woosa ne : « Ŋ heyɗi faɗisse ɓo' a maañ na iiki ŋ tum nga ɗe, laam a huf dong. Hutiiniŋ kipes kiŋ ɗe hey nike kiis teemet na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kanak (120). »<verse eid="GEN 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Ŋ jamanoocaam, wa raakeen ɓi puŋkal ŋ kehƴi, te ɓa raakisseen. Ɓeem ɓeɗ nikee jalmbaaca ɗeɓgaan te tiik ciŋ ɓa kerhuuɗ. Ɓa rimkohee ngaŋ safaal ca na cafaƴ ca. <verse eid="GEN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Nikiɗi hotta ne ɓooɓa nikee ŋ kehƴi uupee nga uup añaand, te keeñ caŋ ɓa genee ɓa yurhiɗ ngaŋ in moɗaaɗi. <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />A raakka aay-keeñ nga, inwaaso ammba ɗe ŋ feri a fer ɓo' ŋ kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />A woosa ŋ haf ce ne : « Ŋ hey ɗumbe ɓooɓi ŋ fer, ŋ hooliɗ ɓa ŋ kehƴi, ŋ faɗanɗi sah ɗoopaat ci, yakak na ƴin, po sel ci ; laam inwaaso ambiɗ to ŋ feri ŋ fer ca. » <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Waaye Nikiɗi baahoheen Noohin.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gaalaŋ Noohin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Inii weɗ naandsuku ŋ Noohin. Noohin a nikee ɓo' yurhiɗ ngaŋ ɓooɓaŋ jamanoonaŋ ɗe, te a hunee na Kooh. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Noohin raakeen kuɓu ƴaar kaahay, Sem, Haam, na Yaafet. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Ɓooɓa genee ŋ kehƴi nikee yahrukohiɗ, te wa muuƴeeɗi Kooh, te ɗisik nu ɗisik raakeen tumohaaɗ moɗaaɗi. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Kooh marakka, a hotta ne kehƴi yahrukohiɗ laam, e pesiɗ ci hotkang jen nikee tumoh in moɗaaɗi.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Ineem tahha po Kooh woosa Noohin ne : « Ŋ ambiɗ ne ŋ hey ɗumbe ɓooɓi jen sagu riifɗi ɓa riifiɗ Adina na tumohaaɗ moɗaaɗi. Ŋ hey ɓa ɗumbe na kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Waaka kidig ndengiɗ, fu haɓɗiɗ haf fu in mand na wahnde yakak, wa min teembeer findi gaal. Wa raakaat ɓi tuuƴ, fu reefa <char style="tl">godirong</char> ŋ ɗooƴi na finhoori. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Fu na hee wa haɓɗohe an : Hutiiniŋ wa nikaat <char style="w">saangal</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">saangal </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: weɗ <char style="tl">meetar</char>.</char></note> teemet na saangal ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (150), angiini nik saangal ndaŋkiyaah-kanak na saangal yatuus (25) te njooliini nik saangal ndaŋkiyaah na saangal yatuus (15). <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Fu heya waakɗe kunoha, harmban wa na gaali nikaat suung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">suung </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: weɗi ini amboh lecem ciŋ ndukun ci po ŋ suungi ; wa camban <char style="tl">meetar</char>.</char></note> yino. Fu heya haɓɗiɗe yahndeer ŋ hambuusiŋ wa, gaali raak nikoha kaahay, ŋ yoorɗi, ŋ leerni na ɗafki.<verse eid="GEN 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Ini kaɗ nga so, ŋ hey bembe kehƴi na masuɓ ne ŋ ap in nu na iike nga ɗah ; in nu nik ngaŋ kehƴi ɗah, a hey kaane. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Waaye ŋ hey ambtiɗohe na ɗa. Fu hey aase ŋ ɗooƴ gaali na ɓitiifu na kuɓuuciŋ ɗa kaahay ci na ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Fu hey name ɓek ŋ gaali heet ɗoopaat nu nik ngaŋ kehƴi ɗah, naar yino na riɓ yino ne ca min muc na ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Heet ciŋ ɗoopaat ci hey haye kanak kanak, sel ci na ɗoopaat ciŋ kehƴi, yakak na ƴin jen hey haye, ne ca min muc. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Fu nak, ɓayndoha kañam nu nik, fu ɓek nga, fu raak pesoha, fu na ca. » <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Noohin haɓɗohha in ceem jen ɗaa, findi Kooh nakohee ɗe wa.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Masma ɗumbee kehƴi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Wa ineem raak, Nikiɗi woosa Noohin ne : « Aasa ŋ ɗooƴ gaali, fu na ɓi kahan fu laam, ŋ hot ɗa dong yurhiɗ ngaŋ ɓooɓiŋ jamanooniŋ ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Ɓayndoha ŋ ɗoopaat ci hooliɗ ci<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ɗoopaat hooliɗ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a yi ɗoopti min <char style="w">seeƴkohu</char> te a minnda ñamu ngaŋ Heber ci.</char></note>, riɓ yasna-kanak na naar yasna-kanak, na ci hoolaaɗiici, riɓ yino na naar yino, <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />na sel ci, riɓ yasna-kanak na naar yasna-kanak ; ne cuuɓ ciŋ ca min ris ŋ kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Laam, ndii na neeh yasna-kanak, ŋ hey toɓe toɓ yakak, ini ree neeh ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40). Ŋ ɗumb in ci ŋ fer na iike ŋ kehƴi jen. » <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Noohin tumohhaa ɗaa, findi Nikiɗi nakohee ɗe wa.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Wa Noohin raak kiis teemet-yasna-yino (600), weɗ masuɓ riifɗoh kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />A aaseen ŋ ɗooƴ gaala, a yi na ɓitiice na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe kaahay ci na ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɓa, ne ɓa muc ŋ masma. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Ɗoopaat ci hooliɗ ci na ci hoolaaɗiici, sel ci na in ci ƴin ƴin ci na iike ŋ kehƴi jen, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />ca raakeen Noohin ŋ gaala kanak kanak, naar na riɓ, findi Kooh woyohee wa.<verse eid="GEN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Wa neeh ca yasna-kanak ca coot, masma cammba naaf kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Weɗ kiis ka Noohin raakoh kiis teemet-yasna-yino (600), wa caɓna kanakɗoha raak neeh ndaŋkiyaah na neeh yasna-kanak (17). Mbaɗi, masma laayohngaana nikee ŋ ɗooƴ kehƴi, pookkaa ŋ ɗisik laayiɗ, wa baliɗta. Eel ci rangsukka, ca nameeɗa juur masuɓ ŋ kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />A toɓeeɗa noha na weka, ini ree neeh ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40). <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Mbaɗi, raak Noohin ŋ ɗooƴ gaala, na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci Sem, Haam na Yaafet, na ɓitiice na ɓitiɓ ciŋ kuɓuuciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Ɓa nikka ŋ ɗooƴ gaala na cuuɓ ciŋ ɗoopaat ci jen ; ciŋ bilaf fi na ciŋ kahan ci, in ci ƴin ƴin ci na iike ŋ kehƴi na sel ci. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />In ci na iike jen raakka Noohin ŋ gaala kanak kanak, <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />naar na riɓ, findi Kooh woyohee wa. Ƴutta, Nikiɗi rannga buntaanaŋ gaala.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Toɓa yuurkeeɗa noha na weka ini ree neeh ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40). Masma uupeeɗa nga rap po, wa meeɓpa gaala. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Wa ɓaatkeeɗa po, gaala teembeerra ŋ jola. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Wa uupeeɗa nga ɓaatuk po, wa onnda tangooca uupee ɗafuk jen. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Masma mirndohha kaɗ po, wa onnda tangooca ini ree <char style="w">saangal</char> yasna-kanak. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />In nu nik ne a iikeen ŋ kehƴi suyɗi ɗah, a kaaniɗ nga ; sel ca, ɗoopaat caŋ kahan ca na caŋ bilaf fa na in ca ƴin ƴin ca iikee ŋ kehƴi jen, kaaniɗ na ɓooɓa. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />In nu nik ne a heɗ kiñin ŋ kehƴi suyɗi ɗah, a kaaniɗ. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />In ca iikee ŋ kehƴi jen ceɗ Nikiɗi ambsoh, a ɗumbiɗta ca ; ɓo', ɗoopaat, in ca ƴin ƴin ca na sel ca. A faɗee Noohin dong na ɓa nikee na ɗe ŋ ɗooƴ gaala. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Wa ineem raak, masma rissa oniɗ kehƴi ini ree neeh teemet na neeh ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (150).<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Ŋiisaŋ masma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Ina masma na raake neeh teemet na neeh ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (150) ŋ kehƴi jen, Kooh ɗaakkoheen Noohin nof, a yi na ɗoopaat ca nikee na ɗe ŋ gaala. Weɗ a puuɗsoh ŋ kehƴi, masma haawsukeeɗa. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Wa pulohee ŋ ɗooƴ kehƴi na wa juurkohee ŋ eel ci, ca tufukka ; toɓa seekka. <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />Masma cooteeɗa ƴin ƴin ; ŋ finho neeh teemet na neeh ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus ceem (150), wa haawsukka kotii. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Mbaɗi, caɓna yasna-kanakɗoh raakee neeh ndaŋkiyaah na neeh yasna-kanak (17) ; gaala gaƴca ŋ tangooca ŋ Ararat. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Masma uupeeɗa nga haawsuk po ngaŋ mbeha koc ŋ caɓna ndaŋkiyaahɗoh, tangooca hotkeeɗa.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Wa degga neeh ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40), Noohin rangissa palaŋteera a haɓɗiɗee gaala. <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />A tuuƴca ngaak-suur ŋ hara, yeem kaɗeeɗa hayeeɗa, po findi masma ŋiisoh. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Noohin nammba tuuƴ hoɗ ne a inah andi masma ŋiisiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Waaye a raakɗi ɗiski a yongan laam kehƴi riifeen na masuɓ, a dokukka. Noohin puliɗta yaah a ammba ɗe, a ɓekka ɗe ŋ ɗooƴ gaala. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />A sekissa neeh yasna-kanak, a tuuƴissa hoɗa. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Na niina, a hayya na saaf oliiw as ŋ nguɓiŋ ɗe. Noohin inahha kotii ne masma haawsukiɗ ŋ kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />A ɓaatta sek neeh yasna-kanak a tuuƴissa hoɗa, yeem taalndiɗta, a dokkisɗi nga ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Kiis ka Noohin raakoh kiis teemet-yasna-yino na kiis yino (601), ŋ caɓna koc nga, ŋ mbeha adug nga, raak masma reehiɗ ŋ kehƴi. Noohin kunissa gaala, a marakka, a hotta ne kehƴi suyiɗ.<verse eid="GEN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Wa caɓna kanakɗoh raak neeh ndaŋkiyaah-kanak na neeh yasna-kanak (27), raak kehƴi suyiɗ kong, <verse eid="GEN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />weɗ Kooh woyoh Noohin ne : <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />« Pula gaali, fu na ɓitiifu na kuɓuuciŋ ɗa na ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɓa ; <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />fu puliɗ cuuɓ ciŋ ɗoopaat ci nik na ɗa, ciŋ kahan ci na ciŋ bilaf fi, sel ci na in ci ƴin ƴin ci jen ; ca pasarkohaat, ca nikaat ɓasloh, ca rimaatɗohaat laayiɗ ŋ kehƴi. » <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Noohin pulla gaala, na ɓitiice, na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci, na ɓitiɓ caŋ ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Ɗoopaat ca jen, na sel ca na in ca ƴin ƴin ca ; ca puleeɗa gaala cuuɓ cuuɓ.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Ƴutta, Noohin haɓiɗta <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkiɗoha</char> haf ce ŋ Nikiɗi, a ɓayya ŋ ɗoopaat ca hooliɗ ca<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ɗoopaat hooliɗ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a yi ɗoopti min seeƴkohu te a minnda ñamu ngaŋ Heber ci.</char></note> na ŋ sel ca hooliɗ ca, a <char style="w" lemma="hoomiɗ">hoomiɗta</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hoomiɗ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: doh inaa hoosuuɗ po a nik wet, ne fu seeƴuk wuu Kooh.</char></note> ca nga.<verse eid="GEN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Wa eeñɗeem ree ŋ Nikiɗi, a neɓuusa nga, a woosa ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne : « Ŋ heyɗi alkisse kehƴi muk sagu ɓo'. Wa keeh ne ŋ kikomaakiikaŋ ɓa, weɗ keeñ ciŋ ɓa na cambohee ɓa hiir ŋ in moɗaaɗi ; ŋ heyɗi ɗumbɗisse in ci na pese ŋ kehƴi muk ŋ findi ŋ tumoha an. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Feeh kehƴi wii nga ɗah, in cii kurkohanɗi nga : sok na nguɗ, doh na soos, yuk na reh, noh na wek. »<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">Ñaangi-ñaangi weɗ ini teeɓoh ambtiɗohiŋ Kooh na Noohin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Ŋ ineem, Kooh barke'iɗta Noohin na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɓa ne : « Nikaat ɓasil, rimaatɗohaat po ɗu riifiɗ kehƴi jen. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Ɗiski wa nik ndii ɗoopaat ciŋ kehƴi na sel ci na in ci ƴin ƴin ci ŋ kehƴi na cuurund ci, ca hey ɗu neƴƴohe laam, ŋ hey ca dege ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Findi kidig ci, in ci na pese te ca yoonde, ŋ eɗiɗ ɗu ca jen, ca kañam nga ɗu kotii. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Waaye ɗu heyɗi ñame sepet na kipes kiŋ wa, weɗ ne, na ñif miŋ wa. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Ñif miŋ ɗu, weɗ nam nik kipes kiŋ ɗu ; weɗ tah ɗoopaat mbaa ɓo' nu aam ñif ɓo' ɗah, ŋ hey ɗa wa taambe ; yaa nu aam ñif miŋ morom fu ɗah, ŋ hey ɗa wa meekse. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Ɓo' nu aam ñif ɓo' ɗah, wiŋ ɗa hey aamse ; laam Kooh fer ɓo' ŋ ñaamaariŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Nikaat ɓasloh, rimaatɗohaat po ɗu riifiɗ kehƴi. »<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Kooh woyissa Noohin na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ne : <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />« Mi yii ambtiɗoh na ɗu na ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗu, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />na in ci na pese na ɗu jen, findi sel ci na ɗoopaat ciŋ kahan ci na ciŋ bilaf fi, ceɗ ci pul na ɗu ŋ gaali na in ci na hee pese ŋ kehƴi jen. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Ambtiɗohiŋ ngo na ɗu, wa na hee nikohe an : Ŋ heyɗi boomisse kipes na masuɓ laayiɗ te masuɓ laayiɗ ɗumbissanɗi kehƴi. »<verse eid="GEN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />A hannda deg nga ne : « Inii weɗ na hee teeɓohe ambtiɗohiŋ ngo na ɗu, ɗu na in ci na pese na ɗu, gomal nu gomal. <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Ŋ tumiɗ ñaangi-ñaangiiniŋ ngo ŋ eel ci weɗ ini na hee teeɓohe ambtiɗohiŋ ngo na ɓi kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Ŋ nangɗoh eel ci ŋ ɗafki te ñaangi-ñaangiini pul ɗah, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />ŋ hey naandsuke harmban ndo na ɗu na cuuɓ ciŋ ɗoopaat ci jen. Masuɓ laayiɗ ɗumbissanɗi heɗ kiñin ci. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Ŋ hot ñaangi-ñaangiini puliɗ ɗah, ŋ naandsuk ambtiɗohi ŋ ambtiɗoh po faw na in ci na pese ŋ kehƴi jen. » <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Kooh woyissa Noohin ne : « Ini teeɓoh ambtiɗohiŋ ngo na ɓi kehƴi, weɗi weem. »<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Noohin na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Kuɓuuciŋ Noohin ɓa puloh ŋ gaala nikee Sem na Haam yi baabiŋ Kanaan, na Yaafet. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Ɓeɗ ɓi kaahay cii, ɓeɗ caacuuciŋ ɓooɓiŋ kehƴi jen.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Noohin nikka guuroh, a yi koc guur reseñ. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Wa raakka mbeh, a annda ŋ biiñaŋ wa po a laarra, a wolsukka po a hoolla ŋ ɗooƴ <char style="w" lemma="ɗiip">ɗiipaŋ</char> ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Haam, baabiŋ Kanaan, hotta ɗe tas-ɓarang ; a woosa taambɗoh caŋ ɗe kanak ca nikee ŋ hara wa. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Ŋ ineem, Sem na Yaafet ɓayya uuf, ɓa deggaa ŋ yuug caŋ ɓa, ɓa tiindeeɗa paa finho po ɓa reesa, ɓa ulla ɗe wa. Ɓa yurhiɗkoheeɗi na baab ɓa laam ɓa waaɗeeɗi ɗe hot tas-ɓarang.<verse eid="GEN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Wa Noohin laarsuk, a inahha ini kuɓkiŋ ɗe ƴini tum, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />a woosa ne : « Kanaan nikaat <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaami</char> uup heefu ŋ ñaam ciŋ ɓaah ciŋ ɗe. » <verse eid="GEN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />A ɓaatta nga ne : « Nikiɗi Koohiŋ Sem, a yakɗaah ! Kanaan nikaat ñaamiŋ Sem ! <verse eid="GEN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Kooh ɓaataat saangniŋ Yaafet te a gen na Sem ŋ jam ŋ genohaacaŋ yeem. Kanaan namaat nik ñaamiŋ Yaafet. »<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Ŋ finho toɓa yakka Noohin pesisiɗ kiis teemet-kaahay na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (350). <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />A kaan wa a raak kiis teemet-yasna-nikiis na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (950).<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Cuuɓ ci puloh ŋ kuɓuuciŋ Noohin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Inii weɗ naandsuku ŋ kuɓuuciŋ Noohin : Sem, Haam na Yaafet na ɓi rimkoh nga ɓa. Ŋ finho masma ɗumbee kehƴi, ɓa raakeen ɓi kuɓu ƴaar.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Ɓi rimkoh ŋ Yaafet nikee : Goomeer, Maagoog, Maaday, Yaawaan, Tubaal, Mesek na Tiiraas.<verse eid="GEN 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Askenas na Riifat na Toogarma, ɓa puloh ŋ Goomeer.<verse eid="GEN 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Eliisa, Tarsis, Kitiim na Doodaanim pulohha ŋ Yaawaan. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Ɓi puloh nga ɓa, ɓeɗ genee huntiɗkohiɗ na cookmi, ɓa ɓaatkeeɗa. Ɓaa nu ɓaaheen peɗeem ɗah, ɓaahha kur ; ɓa gennda cuuɓ cuuɓ.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Ɓi rimkoh ŋ Haam nikee : Kuus, Misrayim, Puut na Kanaan.<verse eid="GEN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Sebaa, Hawiilaa, Sabtaah, Ra'amaa na Sabtekaa puloh ŋ Kuus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 10:7">Sabaa na Deedaan nammba puloh ŋ Ra'amaa.<verse eid="GEN 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kuus a yi nam rim Nimrood, ƴaara koc nik jalmba kerhuuɗ ŋ kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />A nikee kaalsukoh yakak ŋ fiki Nikiɗi, po ɓa meeɗ woo ne : « Kaalsukoh yakak ŋ fiki Nikiɗi findi Nimrood. » <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Kur-taah ca koc ŋ nguuraŋ ɗe ceɗ Baabel, Erek, Akkad na Kalne ngaŋ Sinyaar. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Nimrood puloh kur keem, a kaɗta Assuur a yippa kur-taah cii : Niniw, Rehobotiir, Kaalah <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />na Resen, kur-taaha yakka ŋ harmban Niniw na Kaalah.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13-14" />Luud, Anaam, Lehaab, Naftuh, Patarus, Kasluh na Kaftoor puloh ŋ Misrayim. Ɓi puloh ŋ Kasluh, ɓeɗ rim Filistiici.<verse eid="GEN 10:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanaan saawkoh Sidoon, a degga Het nga. <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />Het a yi caaciŋ Yebuus ci, Amoor ci, Girgaas ci, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />Hiw ci, Arkaaci, Sin ci, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Arwaad ci, Semaar ci na Hamaat ci.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 10:18">Ŋ mirndaani ɓi puloh ŋ Kanaan pasarkohha cuuɓ-cuuɓ. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Ɓeɗ genee ini amboh Sidoon na ɓak Gerar po ŋ Gasaa ; na Sodom, Gomor, Atma na Seboyim, kaɗeeɗa po Leesa.<verse eid="GEN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Ɓeem ɓeɗ ɓi puloh ŋ Haam. Ɓaa nu ɓaaheen peɗeem ɗah, ɓaahha kur ; ɓa gennda cuuɓ-cuuɓ.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Sem yi yakak Yaafet nameen raak ɓi kuɓu ƴaar, a yi caaciŋ Eber na ɓi puloh nga ɗe jen.<verse eid="GEN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Ɓi rimkoh ŋ Sem nikee : Elaam, Assuur, Arpaksad, Luud na Aram.<verse eid="GEN 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Uus, Huul, Geter na Maas pulohha ŋ Aram.<verse eid="GEN 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Arpaksad nikka baabiŋ Selah, Selah nikka baabiŋ Eber.<verse eid="GEN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Eber raakka kuɓu ƴaar kanak, yinoora teeksee Peleg laam a raaku ŋ jamanoona kehƴi paysohu. Taambɗoh ce teeksee Yaktaan.<verse eid="GEN 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Ɓii ɓeɗ puloh ŋ Yaktaan : Almodaad, Seelef, Hasarmaawet, Yeera, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadoraam, Usaal, Diklah, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obaal, Abima'eel, Sabaa, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofir, Hawiilaa na Yoobaab ; ɓii jen ɓa puloh ŋ Yaktaan. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Ɓa genee ŋ harmban Messa na tangoocaŋ Sefaar, ŋ pulohaaɗ-noh.<verse eid="GEN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Ɓeem ɓeɗ ɓi puloh ŋ Sem. Ɓaa nu ɓaaheen peɗeem ɗah, ɓaahha kur ; ɓa gennda cuuɓ-cuuɓ.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Cuuɓ ceem ceɗ puloh ŋ kuɓuuciŋ Noohin, findi ɓa ɓaahoh na findi ɓa genoh. Ɓi kur ci pasarkoh ŋ Adina jen puloh nga ɓa, ŋ finho ɗumbuukaŋ kehƴi na masuɓ.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Taɓahuukaŋ Baabel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Bala ɓa pasarkohan ɗah, ɓooɓiŋ kehƴi jen jombee peɗeem yino <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />po ŋ jamanoona ɓa kurkoh pulohaaɗ-noh. Ɓa kaɗoh kaɗoh po ɓa reesa ŋ oon angiɗ ŋ kur ka na woyse Sinyaar, ɓa yippa nga. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Ɓa woosa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Ɓoo muulaat, ɓoo ut ca. » Ɓa ɓayee muul findi atoh taɓahoha na <char style="tl">godirong</char> findi simong. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Ɓa woyissa ne : « Ɓoo haɓɗaat kur-taah, ɓoo taɓah nga taɓah jimimim po wa maangee ŋ eel ca, wa hey tahe po ɓoo raak tiik te ɓoo heyɗi pasarkohe ŋ kehƴi. »<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Weɗ Nikiɗi ruhsoh ne a marak kur ka na taɓaha ɓooɓi ŋ kehƴi tufkiɗe. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />A woosa ŋ haf ce ne : « Findi ɓa camboh an, ɓa nikka cuuɓ yino, ɓa ɓaahha peɗeem, ali in wooñissanɗi ɓa ŋ in nu ɓa waaɗ tum ɗah. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Mbaa ɗah, ɓoo ruhsaat, ɓoo ɗalohiɗ woo ciŋ ɓa po ɓaa nu nga ɗah, kerhuu peɗmi ɓinooɓi na woye. » <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Nikiɗi pasarohha ɓa ŋ kehƴi jen ; kur ka ɓa taɓahee toppa ndaam. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Weɗ tah ɓa teekkaa Baabel laam, ŋ ndaam weɗ Nikiɗi ɗalohiɗ peɗeem ci<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tiikiŋ "Baabel" reɓ mand na "ɗaloh" ŋ peɗeem heber.</char></note>, a pasarohha ɓooɓi ngaŋ kehƴi jen.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi rimkoh ŋ Sem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Inii weɗ naandsuku ŋ Sem na ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe. Wa Sem pes kiis teemet (100), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Arpaksad, raak toɓa yakka cootiɗ po wa tummba kiis kanak. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Arpaksad, Sem pesiɗ kiis teemet-yatuus (500). A nameen raak ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Wa Arpaksad pes kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay na kiis yatuus (35), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Selah. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Selah, Arpaksad pesiɗ kiis teemet-nikiis na kiis kaahay (403). A nameen raak ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Wa Selah pes kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Eber. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Eber, Selah pesiɗ kiis teemet-nikiis na kiis kaahay (403). A nameen raak ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Wa Eber pes kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay na kiis nikiis (34), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Peleg. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Peleg, Eber pesiɗ kiis teemet-nikiis na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (430). A nameen raak ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Wa Peleg pes kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Reyu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Reyu, Peleg pesiɗ kiis teemet-kanak na kiis yasna-nikiis (209). A nameen raak ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Wa Reyu pes kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay na kiis kanak (32), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Serug. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Serug, Reyu pesiɗ kiis teemet-kanak na kiis yasna-kanak (207). A nameen raak ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Wa Serug pes kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Nahor. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Nahor, Serug pesiɗ kiis teemet-kanak (200). A nameen raak ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Wa Nahor pes kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kanak na kiis yasna-nikiis (29), a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Tera. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Tera, Nahor pesiɗ kiis teemet na kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis yasna-nikiis (119). A nameen raak ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiɓ.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Tera raakeen kuɓu ƴaar kaahay, <char style="w">Ibram</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ibram </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: weɗ nikee tiikiŋ Ibrahiima. E Kooh teek ɗe Ibrahiima ngaŋ saar 17, aaya 5.</char></note>, Nahor na Haaraan, wa a raak kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak (70).<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi kahan Tera, baab ɓi Ibrahiima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Inii weɗ naandsuku ŋ Tera na ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe ; Tera a yi baabiŋ Ibram na Nahor na Haaraan yi rim Loot. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Haaraan yeem a kaanoh kur ɓa, ŋ kur-taaha na woyse Uur ŋ Babilon, raak baab ɓa peseeɗa. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Ɓiti Ibram teeksee <char style="w">Saraay</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Saraay </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Kooh teek ɗe Saarata ngaŋ saar 17, aaya 15.</char></note>, yiŋ Nahor nikka Milka, kuɓkiŋ Haaraan. Haaraan a yi namee nik baab ɓi Iska. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Waaye, Saraay mineeɗi raak kuɓu, a jaasiree jaasir.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Wa raakka mbeh, Tera kurkohha Uur ŋ Babilon a toorkeeɗa Kanaan. A ɓayndohha kuɓkiŋ ɗe Ibram, na setiŋ ɗe Loot kuɓkiŋ Haaraan. A nammba ɓayndoh payum ce Saraay ɓiti Ibram. Ɓa kaɗoh kaɗoh po ŋ waas, ŋ kur-taaha na woyse Haaraan, ɓa yippa nga. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tera kaanohha ndaam raak ɗe pesiɗ kiis teemet-kanak na kiis yatuus (205).<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Kooh tuuƴiɗ Ibrahiima Kanaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Ɓi kahan Tera, ɓeɗ gen ŋ Haaraan po wa raakka mbeh, Nikiɗi woosa <char style="w">Ibram</char> ne : « Faɗa kur ki fu genoh, fu faɗ ɓaah ciŋ ɗa, fu nam faɗ ɓi kahan baabiŋ ɗa ; fu yurah ŋ kur ka maa hee ɗa teeɓe. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Ŋ hey ɗa barke'ɗe, ŋ pulɗoh cuuɓ angiɗ nga ɗa, ŋ yakiɗ tiikiŋ ɗa te fu nik camboha barke. <verse eid="GEN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Ɓooɓi waaɗɗan ɗa moɗiɗ, ŋ barke'iɗ ɓa, te ɓo' nu waaɗiɗ ɗa moɗaaɗi ɗah, ŋ aluk ɗe. Cuuɓ ciŋ kehƴi jen raakohan barke saguufu. »<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Ŋ finho inaam, Ibram kaɗta findi Nikiɗi woyoh ɗe wa. Loot, kuɓkaŋ taambɗoh ce, hunee na ɗe. Wa Ibram na kurke ŋ Haaraan waam tel ɗe raakiɗ kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak na kiis yatuus (75). <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />A ɓayndohha ɓitiice <char style="w">Saraay</char>, na Loot, yi kuɓu nga ɗe, na in ca ɓa raakoh ŋ Haaraan jen na <char style="w">ñaam</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ñaam </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ jamanoonaam, ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ meeɗeen raak ñaam. Ɓa meeɗ ɓa meeɗ rom, wala ɓa kooɗoh ɓa ŋ hiñoh. Raakeen ɓi tumangee haf ɓa ñaam, ne ɓa raak pesoha. Raakeen ɓum nga, ɓa raakeen kombot po ɓa minɗaa wirind ɗah, ɓa tumu ñaam. Te ñaam nu raakeen kuɓu ɗah, kuɓka na nike ñaam findiice. Ñaam nu nga ɗah raakeen heɗ, te heɗ ciŋ ɓa mineen ɓa njirñiɗkoh ŋ panguk nu nik, wala tum ɓa ini neɓ ɓa wala ap ɓa sah. Ñaam mineen kaɗ po a nik kilifa wala ɓo' yakak ŋ kahan heɗ ce wala ŋ ɗooƴ ɓooɓi sah. Waaye raakiɗ ɓi nga nak, ɓa mineen raak haf ɓa, ne heɗ ciŋ ɓa teyɗuka ɗah.</char></note> caŋ ɓa. Ɓa pulla, ɓa kaɗeeɗa po ɓa reesa Kanaan.<figure style="fig" alt="Abraham from Ur to Canaan" file="GPS_AbrahamToCanaan-b&amp;w.png" size="span" loc="GEN 11:31–12:6" ref="Cam 11:31–12:6" /><verse eid="GEN 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Wa Ibram ree, raak ɓi Kanaan geniɗ ŋ kur ka, a taammbaa ŋ leerna po kidga yakka ŋ Moore ngaŋ Sisem. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Ŋ ndaam Nikiɗi teeɓukka ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Kur kii jen ŋ hey wa eɗe ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa. » Ibram haɓiɗta <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkiɗoha</char> haf ce ŋ Nikiɗi, laam a yi teeɓuk ɗe nga. <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Wa a ƴuta haɓiɗ, a kurukka, a yurahha tangooca lak Betel pulohaaɗ-noh ; a yippa <char style="w" lemma="ɗiip">ɗiipaŋ</char> ɗe ŋ harmban Betel na Ay. Betel lakkaa muyohaaɗ-noh, Ay pulohaaɗ-noh. Ŋ ndaam a haɓiɗta seeƴkoha, a gidimmba Nikiɗi na ñaamuk. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Wa a puloh nga, a yongsukeeɗa ƴin ƴin ŋ ɓak Negef.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saarata ŋ kahan buuraŋ Misra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Waam, aɗ raakeen ŋ kur ka, Ibram kaɗta <char style="w">Misra</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Misra </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: weɗ kur ki ɓooɓi na woye "<char style="tl">Egypte</char>" woti-woti.</char></note> ne a nikohaah nga laam aɗa miskeen.<verse eid="GEN 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Wa a kaɗ po a heeɗa aase Misra, a woosa ɓitiice Saraay ne : « Sikɗuk ko, ŋ inhiɗ ne fu moɗiɗ lool, <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />ɓi Misra hot ɗa ɗah, ɓa hey woye ne fu ɓitiiso te ɓa hey yo ape fu tas. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Ngalla ɓoo ree ɗah, fu na woye ne ɓoo taambɗoh taambɗoh ; ineem hey tahe po ɓa taambkoh ho saguufu, te fu hey tahe po, ŋ pes. »<verse eid="GEN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Wa Ibram ree kur ka, ɓi Misra hotta ne ɓitiice moɗiɗ lool. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Huntoh caŋ Firawnaana, buuraŋ Misra nammba ɗe hot, ɓa laasukka ɗe ŋ fikiice, a yi Saraay a ɓayuusa kahan Firawnaana. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />A tahha po Ibram taambkohuusa moɗoɗ, Firawnaana onnda ɗe ɓi gat : pe', mbaal, inoh, mbaam, naar na riɓ na ngeelemb, na ɓi ñaam, ƴaar na ɓitiɓ.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Waaye Nikiɗi ruhsiɗta naamo miskiɗ ŋ Firawnaana na ɓi kahan ce sagu Saraay ɓiti Ibram. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Weɗi Firawnaana ɓeeɗkoh Ibram woosa ɗe ne : « Ini fu haɓiɗ to wii nak ! Wa ye tah po fu wooɗi so ne a ɓitiifu ? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Wa ye tah fu woosa ne ɗu taambɗoh ? Wa tahha po ŋ ɓayya ɗe ɓitiɓ. Ɗiski wa nik ndii, ɓitiifu a yi, ɓayaa ɗe te fu coot. » <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Firawnaana nakka huntoh caŋ ɗe ne ɓa pulɗaat Ibram na ɓitiice, na ina a raak jen ŋ kur ka<figure style="fig" alt="Abraham to Egypt and back" file="GPS_AbrahamToEgypt-b&amp;w.png" size="span" loc="GEN 11:10–13:2" ref="Cam 11:10–13:2" />.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Saɓsukohaŋ Ibrahiima na Loot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Wa <char style="w">Ibram</char> na pulɗasse <char style="w">Misra</char> na ɓitiice, na raak-raakaŋ ɗe jen, a gurdeeɗa Negef, Loot nikangee na ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Ibram raakeen lool, a amboheen ɓi gat yakoh na yakoh, na haalis na urus laayoh na laayoh. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />A pulohha Negef, a yongsukeeɗa ƴin-ƴin po Betel ŋ ɗiska a kocee ndut ŋ harmban Betel na Ay. <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />A ɓeeɗkohha Kooh ŋ tiikiŋ Nikiɗi ŋ <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkohaana</char> a ɗeɓee haɓiɗ ŋ ndaam.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Loot, yi hunee na ɗe, nameen raak ɓi gat pe', mbaal na inoh, na <char style="w">ɗiip</char> ca ɓooɓaŋ ɗe nikohe. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Ɓa haɓisseeɗi ŋ kur ka, laam raak-raakaŋ ɓa laayeen po ɓa minisseeɗi gen ŋ ɗisik yino ; <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />te yit, Peris ca na Kanaan ca namee gen nga. Ayrukoh raakka ŋ harmban niiɗoh caŋ Ibram na ɓaŋ Loot. <verse eid="GEN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Weɗi Ibram woyoh Loot ne : « Ngalla, ayrukoh kanaat raak ŋ harmban mi na ɗa, na harmban niiɗoh ciŋ ɓoo, laam e ɓoo ɓaah. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Kon mbaa ɗah, ɓoo saɓsukohaat, marka inii jen ŋ kur ki, fu kooɗ ŋ yaah-sing ɗah, ŋ kooɗ ŋ yaah-ñaahum ; fu kooɗ ŋ yaah-ñaahum ɗah, ŋ kooɗ ŋ yaah-sing. »<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Wa Loot marak kehƴa wil kalaŋ Yurdan, a hotta ne wa iiri po Sowar, weem raak Nikiɗi ɗumbɗi Sodom na Gomor ndoom, wa mandee na nguukaŋ Eden, findi kehƴiŋ Misra. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Loot waɗukka kehƴaŋ Yurdan, a yongsukka ŋ pulohaaɗ-noh ; ɓa saɓsukohoh ɗaa. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Ibram gennda ŋ Kanaan, Loot kaɗta ndutta ŋ sero kur caŋ Yurdan, a yippa ɗiip caŋ ɗe ŋ ɓak Sodom. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Ɓi Sodom nikee aƴaarkiɗ, bakaaɗoh yakak ŋ fiki Nikiɗi.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kooh teeɓiɗ Ibrahiima kur ka a gapee ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Wa Ibram paysukoh na Loot, Nikiɗi woosa ɗe ne : « Marka baahiɗ ŋ fikiifu, na finhoofu na yaah-sing, na yaah-ñaahum, <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />laam kur ki fu na hote wii jen, ŋ hey ɗa wa one po faw, fu na ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Ŋ hey ɓaate ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa po ɓa mand na merhey miŋ kehƴi, ɓo' minanɗi ɓa kind, findi ɓo' minohɗi kind merhey miŋ kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Kurka, fu taambiɗ kur ki jen ŋ hutiiniŋ wa na angiiniŋ wa, laam maa hee ɗa wa one. »<verse eid="GEN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Ƴutta, Ibram ɗoffa ndutaŋ ɗe, a kaɗta, a yippa ŋ kidig ca yakak caŋ Mamre ŋ ɓak Hebron, ŋ ndaam a haɓiɗta seeƴkoha wuu Nikiɗi.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Ambuuka na naafuukaŋ Loot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Wa nikee wa Amrafel nikoh buuraŋ Sinyaar, Aryok nikka yaŋ Elasaar, Kedorlamer yaŋ Elaam na Tidyal yaŋ Goyim ; <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />ɓa hunnda na ɓooɓaŋ ɓa, ɓa hiñoheeɗa na Bera buuraŋ Sodom na Birsa yaŋ Gomor, Sinyab yaŋ Atma, Semeber yaŋ Seboyim na yaŋ Bela, weɗi Sowar. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Ɓeɗ ɓi yatuus cii, ɓeɗ ambsukohee ŋ oonaŋ Sidim weɗi Cookmiŋ-Meɗaami woti-woti. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Raak wa tumeen kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12) ca fu inah ne, e Kedorlamer a yi adgiɗee ɓa, waaye ŋ kiis ka taamb nga ɓa sannga inaam.<verse eid="GEN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Wa tummba kiis kotii, tahha po, Kedorlamer na buur ca hunee na ɗe heeɗa nga ɓa. Ɓa kocca laɓ Refay ca ngaŋ Asterot-Karnayim, Sus ca ngaŋ Ham, Em ca ngaŋ jooraŋ Kirsatayim, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />Hoor ca ngaŋ tangoocaŋ ɓa teeku Seyiir. Ɓa ngekeeɗa ɓa, po ŋ El-Paran ŋ sero kehƴa hulanga. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Ɓa pulohha nga, ɓa gurdohha En-Mispat, weɗi Kades ; ɓa degga kur kaŋ Amalek ca jen yaah. Ƴutta ɓa nammba keen Amoor ca genee Hasason-Tamaar.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Wa ɓa juuɓee Sodom na Gomor na Atma na Seboyim na Bela, wi Sowar, buur caŋ kur cii puliɗta jalmbaacaŋ ɓa ; ɓa kaɗta hiñoha ŋ oonaŋ Sidim <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />na Kedorlamer buuraŋ Elaam, Tidyal yaŋ Goyim, Amrafel yaŋ Sinyaar na Aryok yaŋ Elasaar ; buur yatuus cohha na buur nikiis. Yatuus ca minuusa, ɓa saandoheeɗa.<verse eid="GEN 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Wa buur caŋ Sodom na Gomor saandohee, raak woong <char style="tl">koltaar</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">koltaar</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: weɗ <char style="tl">godirong</char> yeelet.</char></note> laayeen ŋ oonaŋ Sidim, ɓum keennda nga ca. Ɓi raawɗi kaan kaɗta ɗemmba ŋ tangooca. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Ɓi ngekee ɓa guridda, ɓayya in ca Sodom na Gomor ambohee jen findi raak-raak na pesoha, ɓa cootta na ca. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Loot yi kuɓu ŋ <char style="w">Ibram</char> nameen ɓayndohu na ina a raakee jen, laam raak ɗe ŋ Sodom.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Yino ŋ ɓi fusee kaɗta, woosa Ibram wa, yi ɓaah ngaŋ Heber ci ; raak ɗe yip ngaŋ kidig ca yakak caŋ Mamre, yi ɓaah ngaŋ Amoor ci. Mamre raakeen taambɗoh kanak, Eskol na Aner. Ɓeɗ ɓi kaahay ceem ɓa langee na Ibram.<verse eid="GEN 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Wa Ibram kerah ne Loot, kuɓkaŋ taambɗoh ce ambuuɗ, a cohɗohha ɓa min hiñoh ŋ ƴaaɓa rimohu kahan ce ; ɓa nikee teemet-kaahay na ndaŋkiyaah na yasna-kaahay (318). Ɓa, na ɓi langee na ɓa, taambiɗta buur ca po ŋ Daan. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Ibram paysohha ƴaaɓaŋ ɗe, ɓa keennda ɓa na weka, ɓa laɓpa ɓa, ɓa ngekeeɗa ɓa po ŋ Hobah, ŋ finho Damas. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />A naaffa in ca ɓa raak jen, a naafndohha Loot na raak-raakaŋ ɗe na ɓitiɓ ca na ɓa ambsee <char style="w">ñaam</char> jen.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cohaŋ Ibrahiima na Melkisedek na buuraŋ Sodom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Wa Ibram laɓ Kedorlamer na langtoh caŋ ɗe po a gurdeeɗa, buuraŋ Sodom pulla kaɗta coha na ɗe ŋ oonaŋ Sawe, wa na woyse Oonaŋ-Buur. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Melkisedek, buuraŋ Salem, nammba hay na mbuuru na biiñ, a yi <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗohi</char> na seeƴkiɗohe wuu Kooh yi ŋ ɗafka ɗafka. <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />A kiimiɗta Ibram barke an : « Kooh yi ŋ ɗafka ɗafka, yi fer eel ci na kehƴi, barke'ɗaat Ibram ; <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Kooh yi ŋ ɗafka ɗafka, yi amboh ɗa po fu minnda ɓa fu hiñohee na ɓa, a yakɗaah yakɗu. » Ibram eɗta ɗe ŋ in ca a naafee, ndaŋkiyaah nu nik ɗah, winooraŋ wa.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Wa ɓa coh ŋ oonaŋ Sawe, buuraŋ Sodom nammba woo Ibram ne : « Eɗ to ɓooɓi te fu ɓay raak-raaki. » <verse eid="GEN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Ibram loffa ɗe ne : « Mi yii meeɓ yaah ŋ giñ Nikiɗi, Kooh yi ŋ ɗafka ɗafka, yi fer eel ci na kehƴi ne : <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />in hend na caas mbaa liiɓ ñafaɗ, ŋ heyɗi wa ɓaye ŋ ini fu raak, po fu minanɗi woo ne, e ñam tah Ibram raak. <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Ŋ waaɗɗi ali in nga, nikɗi in ci ƴaaɓi raaw ñam ɗah, na ɓakiŋ langtoh ciŋ ngo, Aner na Eskol na Mamre, ɓi fu inah ne, ɓa raakiɗ waɗ nga. »<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Kooh ambtiɗohiɗ na Ibrahiima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Ŋ finho coha na buur ca, in hayɗohha <char style="w">Ibram</char> findi heeƴ. A Nikiɗi woyee na ɗe an : « Ka neƴƴoh ali in Ibram, laam e ñam na hee ɗa ɗipe, te aafiŋ ɗa hey yake lool. » <verse eid="GEN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Ibram loffa ne : « An fu na hee so ye one Heɗ ɓoo Nikiɗi ? Te ŋ raakɗi kuɓu po Eliyeser yiŋ Damas yii, a yi laman raak-raak kiŋ ngo ! <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Fu onɗi so kuɓu po jaambri rimkoh ŋ kahan ndo a yi na hee so lame ! » <verse eid="GEN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Nikiɗi loffa ɗe ne : « Muk, a yi lamohiŋ ɗa haa, waaye a kuɓki fu rimoot ŋ ñif miŋ ɗa, a yi na hee ɗa lame. » <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Nikiɗi puliɗta ɗe ŋ hara, a woosa ɗe ne : « Taaknuka, fu kind hor ci ne fu miniɗa ɗah. Fu hotiɗ findi ca laayoh e ? Ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa hendan ɗaa. » <verse eid="GEN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Ibram kossa, weɗ tah Nikiɗi ammba ɗe ɓo' yurhiɗ.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />A woyissa ɗe ne : « E ñam Nikiɗi yi pulɗoh ɗa Uur ŋ Babilon, ne ŋ on ɗa kur kii, fu raakoota. » <verse eid="GEN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />A loffa ɗe ne : « Heɗ ɓoo Nikiɗi ŋ min inhoh na ne kur kii e ñam raakana ? » <verse eid="GEN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Nikiɗi woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓayiɗ to inoh yu' na pe' yu' na mbaal naar, yaa nu nga ɗah raakaat kiis kaahay, na hoɗ na banuut ƴin. »<verse eid="GEN 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Ibram ɓayya ɗoopaat ceem. A appa ca, yaa nu nga ɗah, a nguɗta ɗe ŋ leerni po tassa sel ca. A yurhiɗohha nguɗ nu nga ɗah na wa ɓaat nga. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Suur ca yipkeeɗa ŋ fiɗaaf caŋ ca. Ibram aannja ca.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Wa noha na muye, Ibram pani'uusa, pani nooɗiɗ. Neƴƴoh miskiɗ huniɗ na ñuus tuɗ aassa ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Weɗi Kooh woyoh ɗe ne : « Inhaa ne set ciŋ ɗa hey nike jaambur ŋ kur ka ɓa raakɗi, ɓa tumu <char style="w">ñaam</char> nga, ɓa torhiɗu kiis teemet-nikiis (400). <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Waaye ŋ hey atte'e ɓi kur ka ɓa tumohu ñaam, po ɓa puloh nga na raak-raak laayiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗa nak, fu hey raake kipes hutiɗ, neɓiɗ, fu kuruk nga moɗoɗ, fu uumbu ŋ jam. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />E set ciŋ ɗa, ŋ finho kiis teemet-nikiis ceem (400), na hee dokkisse ŋ ndii ; laam aƴaarkiŋ Amoor ci uupɗi yaah ndoom. »<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Wa noha muy, wa ñuussa tuɗ, ɗekka po njahha ɗuukeeɗa hunnda na kocom kaɓiɗ, ca taammba ŋ harmban nguɗ caŋ sepet ca. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Mbaɗi, Nikiɗi ambtiɗohha na Ibram. A woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓooɓi pulohan nga ɗa, ɓeɗ maa hee eɗe kur kii ; ina nguɗoh ŋ kalaŋ <char style="w">Misra</char> po ŋ Ewfaraat, kala yakka. <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />Wa nikka kur kiŋ Ken ci na Kenis ci na Kadmon ci <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />na Hit ci na Peris ci na Refay ci <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />na Amoor ci na Kanaan ci na Girgaas ci na Yebuus ci. »<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Raakuukaŋ Ismaayla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />
    <char style="w">Saraay</char> yi ɓiti <char style="w">Ibram</char>, a raakɗeeɗi ɗe kuɓu, waaye a raakeen <char style="w">ñaam</char> teeku Haajara pulohee <char style="w">Misra</char>. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Saraay ɓooffa po a woosa Ibram ne : « Fu hotiɗ ne Nikiɗi hondohiɗ to raak kuɓu, huna na Haajara. Wa miniɗ nik a raak kuɓu, yi nikan yiŋ ngo. » Wa a woo Ibram ineem, a teyɗukka. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Saraay, ɓiti Ibram, ɓayya ñaamiŋ ɗe pulohee Misra, Haajara, eɗta ƴaar ce Ibram ɗe, a tummba ɗe ɓitiɓ. Weem, raak Ibram tumiɗ kiis ndaŋkiyaah ŋ Kanaan.<verse eid="GEN 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Wa a hun na ɗe, a ammba rook. A inahha ne a ɓarang haa, a yappa ɓoyaŋ ɗe Saraay. <verse eid="GEN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />A yi Saraay a woosa Ibram ne : « In ci jen ya fu ɓek ca ; e ñam deg Haajara ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗa, waaye ina a amboh rook poyi, a kerhiɗisɗi so. Nikiɗi teeɓohaat yi nik ŋ keeh ŋ harmban mi na ɗa. » <verse eid="GEN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Ibram loffa ɗe ne : « Haajara deey, a ris ñaamiŋ ɗa poyi, in na neɓ ɗa ɗah, fu miniɗ ɗe wa tum. » A camboh ɗe iifiɗ ɗaa, a tumeeɗa ɗe in miskiɗ po a saandohha.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />A kaɗoh kaɗoh po a nikka ŋ sero laaha ŋ waas Suur, ŋ keheƴ hulang ; malaakaaniŋ Nikiɗi raakka ɗe nga, <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />a woosa ɗe ne : « Haajara, ñaamiŋ Saraay, fu kurkoh nde ? Fu na kaɗe nde ? » A loffa ɗe ne : « Mi na nupe ɓoyiŋ ngo Saraay. » <verse eid="GEN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Malaakaaniŋ Nikiɗi woosa ɗe ne : « Wiirka ŋ ɓoyiŋ ɗa, Saraay, fu ree ɗah, ruhsiɗa haf fu ŋ fikiice. » <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />A woyissa ɗe ne : « Ŋ hey tume ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa laay po ɓo' minuu ɓa kind. » <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />A ɓaatiɗta ɗe nga ne : « Ɗiski fu nik ndii, fu ɓarang haa ; fu hey raake kuɓu ƴaar, teekaa ɗe Ismaayla (Kooh kerhiɗ) laam Nikiɗi kerhiɗ miskiɗiŋ ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Kuɓkiŋ ɗa pesan na haf ce findi mbaam sif raakaaɗi heɗ, a heyɗi kerhiɗohe na ɓooɓa, ɓooɓa kerhiɗohanɗi na ɗe. A genan saɓsukohiɗ na ɓaah ciŋ ɗe. » <verse eid="GEN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Haajara teekka Nikiɗi woyee na ɗe "Ata-El-Roy" (Kooh yi na hote), laam a woo ne : « Moo ŋ hotiɗ Yi na hotee so e ? » <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Ineem tahha po laaheem teekuusa "Lahay-Roy" (Pesɗi na hotee so) ; wa ɗaa ŋ harmban Kades na Bered.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Ŋ finho ineem, Haajara raakka kuɓu, Ibram teekka ɗe Ismaayla. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Ibram raakeen kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kaahay na kiis yasna-yino (86), wa Haajara raakiɗ ɗe Ismaayla.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">Nguɗuk weɗ ini teeɓoh ambtiɗohiŋ Kooh na Ibrahiima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Wa Ibram raak kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-nikiis na yasna-nikiis (99), wa raakka mbeh, Nikiɗi teeɓukka ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : « E mi Koohi Min, pesa findi ŋ waaɗoh, fu nik yurhiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Ŋ hey ambtiɗohe na ɗa te ŋ hey ɗa tume ɓasil. » <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Wa a kerah woo keem, Ibram ƴekka po pukiŋ ɗe reesa kehƴi, Kooh taalndiɗta woyeeɗa na ɗe, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />a woosa ɗe ne : « Ambtiɗohiŋ ngo na ɗa, wa na hee tufkohe an : Fu hey nike baabiŋ ɓi cuuɓi cuuɓ, <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />te fu teekissuuɗi Ibram (baab yakɗuuɗ) waaye Ibrahiima (baabiŋ ɓi laayiɗ), laam ŋ hey ɗa tume caaciŋ ɓi cuuɓ laayiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Ŋ hey ɗa tume ɓasil, ɓi cuuɓi cuuɓ hey pulohe nga ɗa, ɓi buur sah hey rimkohe nga ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Ŋ hey ambtiɗohe na ɗa, fu na ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa, gomal nu nik, wa hey nike po faw. Ŋ ineem ŋ hey nike Koohiŋ ɗa na ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Te kur ki fu nikoh jaambur wii, wa nikka Kanaan, ŋ hey ɗa wa one jen, fu na ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa, ɗu raakoota po faw ; te ñam na hee nike Koohiŋ ɓa. »<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Ŋ finho ineem, Kooh woyissa Ibrahiima ne : « E fu na hee taambkohe ɓakiŋ ɗa ŋ ambtiɗohiŋ ngo na ɗa, fu na ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa, gomal nu nik. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Taambkohohaat ambtiɗohiŋ ngo na ɗu, fu na ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa, an : Ƴaar nu nik nga ɗu ɗah, joyiɗ nguɗuk, <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />nguɗkeem weɗi na hee teeɓohe ambtiɗohiŋ ngo na ɗu. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Komaaki ƴaar nu raak neeh yasna-kaahay ɗah, a joyiɗ nguɗuk ; na, gomal nu a min ɓaahoh ɗah, yi rimohu ŋ kahan fu po yi romohu ŋ jaambra ɓaahɗi ŋ cuuɓiŋ ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Ɓa jen ɓa joyiɗ nguɗuk, a nik <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaami</char> rimkoh ŋ kahan fu mbaa yi fu rom na koporiŋ ɗa. Te nguɗki na hee nike ŋ faan ciŋ ɗu, weɗ ini na hee teeɓohe ambtiɗohiŋ ngo na ɗu po faw. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Ƴaar nu nguɗukɗi, te nik ne a sang sang ɗah, a hey pulɗasse ŋ cuuɓiŋ ɗe laam raakan ɗe nguɗiɗ ambtiɗohi ŋ tufkiɗ. »<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Ŋ ineem Kooh woosa Ibrahiima ne : « Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ɓitiifu, a teekissuuɗi Saraay ; waaye tiikiŋ ɗe wa Saarata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tiik cii, "Saraay" na "Saarata" caɗ ɓaah tokis. Ca tokis "kuɓki ɓitɓiŋ buuri".</char></note> kotii. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Ŋ hey ɗe barke'ɗe, ŋ on ɗa kuɓu ƴaar na ɗe, ŋ hey ɗe barke'ɗe, po a nikan caaciŋ ɓi cuuɓi cuuɓ ; ɓi buur sah hey pulohe nga ɗe. » <verse eid="GEN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Ibrahiima ƴekissa po pukaŋ ɗe reesa kehƴi ; a ƴennda, a woosa ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne : « Moo ƴaar na kiis teemet (100) minisiɗ raak kuɓu e ? Te Saarata yii, na kiis ciŋ ɗe ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-nikiis (90) cii, hey raake kuɓu e ? » <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />A woosa ne : « A' ! Te fu amb ŋ Ismaayla rek ! »<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Kooh woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ woo ne hee, Saarata hey raake kuɓu ƴaar yi fu na hee teeke Isaahha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tiikiŋ "Isaahha" weɗ tokis "aa ƴene".</char></note>, ŋ hey ambtiɗohe na ɗe po faw, a yi na ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Ini kaɗ ŋ Ismaayla, ŋ kerhiɗ woo kiŋ ɗa, ŋ hey ɗe barke'ɗe, ŋ tum ɗe ɓasil, e kilifa ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12) puloh nga ɗe te a fer cuuɓ angiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Waaye ambtiɗohiŋ ngo na ɗa nak, ŋ hey wa tufkiɗe na Isaahha, kuɓki Saarata na hee raake maas. » <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Wa Kooh ƴut woo na Ibrahiima, a faɗta ɗe ndaam, a cootta ŋ ɗafka.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Weɗi Ibrahiima ɓayoh kuɓkiŋ ɗe Ismaayla na ƴaaɓa rimohu kahna na ɓa a romoot na koporaŋ ɗe, ƴaar ca nikee ŋ kahan ce jen, a nguɗta ɓa ŋ noha mbaɗi ; findi Kooh woyoh ɗe wa. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Wa Ibrahiima na nguɗke raak ɗe raakiɗ kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-nikiis na yasna-nikiis (99). <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Kuɓkiŋ ɗe Ismaayla nameen raak kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kaahay (13) wa a na nguɗke. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Ŋ noha mbaɗi, Ibrahiima na kuɓkiŋ ɗe Ismaayla nguɗukka. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Ƴaar caŋ kahan ce jen nammba nguɗuk na ɗe mbaɗi, ɓa rimohu nga, na ɓa a rome.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Kooh hanheerkiɗ Ibrahiima, a gappa ɗe raakuukaŋ Isaahha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Wa nikee ŋ noh damiɗ, Nikiɗi teeɓukka Ibrahiima ŋ kidig ca yakak caŋ Mamre, raak ɗe ɓoofiɗ ŋ nguɓu <char style="w" lemma="ɗiip">ɗiipaŋ</char> ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />A jaɗtuk jaɗtuk, a hotta ɓo' kaahay ŋ fikiice, Ibrahiima kurukka ŋ ɗiska a ɓoofe, a arra kaɗ coha na ɓa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:2">Wa a ree, a ƴekiɗta ɓa, <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />a woosa ne : « Kilifaani, kana so taamboh an, mi yii kiim ɗa wa, wela ŋ kahni, <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />ɓa on ɗu masuɓ ɗu naawis kot ciŋ ɗu, ɗu iɗsiɗuk ŋ saangni, <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />ŋ ɓayiɗ ɗu mbuuru ƴissuut ɗu ɓaatuk hatil, ɗu han coot ; taambiŋ ɗu ŋ ɓoyi joy ɗu taambkoh nikuu ɓarang ɓarang. » Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ee, tuma findi fu woyoh. » <verse eid="GEN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Ibrahiima nuppa, a aassa ŋ ɗooƴ ɗiipa, a woosa Saarata ne : « Ara ɓay andaar mun kaahay ŋ wi uup baah, fu siiɓa, fu haɓiɗ mbuuru. » <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Ibrahiima nupissa ŋ gat ca, a ɓayya ɗoon faymiɗ, a eɗta ɗe ƴaar ŋ <char style="w">ñaam</char> caŋ ɗe, a arra ɗe haɓiɗ.<verse eid="GEN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Wa sepet ca non, Ibrahiima deƴiɗta ɓa ca na miis gundiɗ na miis kal ; ɓa ñameeɗa ŋ saangna, a tufukka ne a taambkoh ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Ɓa meekissa Ibrahiima ne : « A nde ɓitiifu Saarata ? » A woosa ɓa ne : « A yii ŋ ɗooƴ ɗiipi. » <verse eid="GEN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Yino nga ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Mi na woyee ɗu ini nik : Ŋ hey dokkisse ndii maas, ŋ raakan Saarata ɓitiifu raakiɗ kuɓu ƴaar. » Weem raak Saarata ŋ nguɓu ɗiipa, ŋ finho ɓoyi, a kerheeɗa ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Weem raak Ibrahiima yaɓko'iɗ te Saarata namiɗ ɓitif ŋ raak kuɓu. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Saarata ƴennda ŋ ɗooƴ ce, a woosa ne : « Moo mi yi ɓitfiɗii ŋ minisiɗ yeg neɓɗeem e ? Te ŋ hot heɗ tuuƴ co<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">heɗ tuuƴ co </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ peɗeem heber, wa fiisu "Heɗ to".</char></note> yaɓko'iɗ. » <verse eid="GEN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Nikiɗi woosa Ibrahiima ne : « Wa ye tah Saarata ƴennda, an : “ Ŋ ɓitfi ŋ ɓitif wii, ŋ minisiɗ raak kuɓu e ? ” <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Andi raakiɗ ini wooñ Nikiɗi ? E mi woo ɗa wa, ŋ hey dokkisse ndii maas, ŋ raakan Saarata raakiɗ kuɓu ƴaar. » <verse eid="GEN 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Wi Saarata kerah woo keem, a tiitta, a taasukka an : « Ŋ ƴenɗi. » Nikiɗi woosa ɗe ne : « Aha'kay ! Fu ƴeniɗ. »<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibrahiima kiimiɗ ne Kooh marak ŋ yurhiɗ caŋ Sodom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Ŋ finho ineem, hanheeca kaahay ca kurukka ne ɓa coot. Ibrahiima ɓennda ɓa po ɓa hoteeɗa Sodom ŋ oona. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Nikiɗi woosa ŋ haf ce ne : « Andi ŋ hey ɗasɗohe Ibrahiima ini maa hee tume ? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Laam, a hey fere cuuɓ angiɗ, raakiɗ hatil, te ŋ hey barke'ɗe cuuɓ ciŋ kehƴi jen, saguuce. <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />A yi ŋ kooɗ ne, a teeɓ kuɓuuciŋ ɗe na ɓi rimkohan nga ɗe, ɓa pesohee keeh na yurah, findi Nikiɗi waaɗoha ; ndaa, ŋ min ɗe haɓɗiɗ in ci ŋ gap ɗe. » <verse eid="GEN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Nikiɗi woyissa ɗe ne : « In ca Sodom na Gomor na yambse, yakiɗ lool, bakaaɗ caŋ ɓa uupiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Ŋ hey ruhse po nga ŋ marak andi ɓaa tumohe findi ŋ kerhoh ; ŋ hey inhe, andi wa raakoh ɗaa, wala wa raakohɗi ɗaa. »<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Ŋ ineem ƴaaɓa kanak ca yurhiɗta ɓak Sodom, waaye Ibrahiima tassa na Nikiɗi.<verse eid="GEN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Ibrahiima reɓpa, a tummba ne : « Heɗ ɓoo, hanaa fu heyɗi apndohe yurhiɗ na yurhaaɗi ? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Nik ne yurhiɗ ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (50) raakiɗ ŋ kur ka ɗah, fu hey ɓa apndohe e ? Andi fu heyɗi ɗaase ɓi kur ka sagu ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (50) ceem ? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Fu tumohanɗi muk in mand ɗaa, fu apndohanɗi yurhiɗ na yurhaaɗi, tah po yurhiɗ kaan sagu yurhaaɗi e ? Fu yi atte'ohiŋ kehƴi jen, fu tumanɗi yurhiɗ e ? »<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Nikiɗi loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ raak yurhiɗ ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (50) ŋ ɗooƴ Sodom ɗah, ɓa hey tahe po, ŋ ɗaas ɓi kur ka jen. »<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Ibrahiima woyissa ne : « Ɗaas so de' Heɗ ɓoo, mi yii kaañ po ŋ woyee na ɗa, te ŋ merhey dong ; <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />nik ne ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (50) ɓi yurhiɗ ceem ɓa tasiɗ ɓo' yatuus ɗah, yatuus ceem hey tahe po fu ɗumb kur ka e ? »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Nikiɗi loffa ne : « Ŋ raak ɓo' ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis na yatuus (45) yurhiɗ nga ɗah, ŋ heyɗi wa ɗumbe. »<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Ibrahiima woosa ne : « Moo ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40) raak nga ɗah ? »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Nikiɗi loffa ne : « Ŋ tumanɗi ali in, sagu ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40) ceem. »<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Ibrahiima tummba ne : « Heɗ ɓoo kanaat ayruk de', ŋ woyis woyis, moo ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30) raak nga ɗah ? »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Nikiɗi loffa ne : « Ŋ tumanɗi ali in, ne ŋ raak ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30) nga ɗah. »<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Ibrahiima woosa ne : « Po ŋ kaannja woo na Heɗ ɓoo ; moo ndaŋkiyaah-kanak (20) raak nga ɗah ? »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Nikiɗi loffa ne : « Ŋ tumanɗi ali in, sagu ndaŋkiyaah-kanak (20) ceem. »<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Ibrahiima woosa ne : « Heɗ ɓoo kanaat ayruk de', ɗal wii ɗah, ŋ woyissanɗi ; moo ndaŋkiyaah raak nga ɗah ? »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Nikiɗi teyya ne : « Ŋ tumanɗi ali in, ne ŋ raak ndaŋkiyaah nga ɗah. » <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Wa Nikiɗi ƴut woo na Ibrahiima, a cootta. Ibrahiima dokukka kahan ce.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Ɓi Sodom teeɓohiɗ aƴaarkaŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Waaye malaakaaca kanak ca kaɗee Sodom, ɓa ree nga na niina. Ɓa raak Loot ɓoofiɗ ŋ teembohaara, ŋ aasohaanaŋ miira wil kur ka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓooɓaŋ jamanoonaam ɗingangeen kur caŋ ɓa yakak ca na atoh ne sangiɗ minuu aas. Yahndeeraŋ ɗinga nikee teembohaaraŋ kilifaaca.</char></note>. Wa a hot ɓa, a kaɗta coha na ɓa, a ƴekiɗta ɓa po pukiŋ ɗe reesa kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Kilifaaci, ne wa neɓ ɗu ɗah, welaat ŋ kahan ɓoyi joy ɗu taambkoh, ɗu naawis kot ciŋ ɗu, ɗu neeh po kim na ɓaaɓa ɗah, ɗu han taalndiɗ waasiŋ ɗu. » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Tee fu faɗ ɓoo neeh ŋ hari rek. » <verse eid="GEN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Waaye Loot kiimmba ɓa po ɓa teyɗukka, ɓa wella kahan ce, a nakohiɗta ɓa haɓɗiɗu kañam neɓiɗ na mbuuru, ɓa ñammba.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Ɓa raawɗi faanuk ndoom, ɓi kur ka, ƴaar caŋ Sodom, ŋ ƴina po yakka, ali ɓo' tasɗi, ɓa willa kahna, <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />ɓa ɓeeɗukka Loot, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓa nde ƴaaɓi hay kahan fu na niini, pulɗaat ɓa ndii, ɓoo faanuk ɓa. » <verse eid="GEN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Loot pulla nga ɓa ŋ nguɓu kahna, a rannga buntaana, <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />a woosa ɓa ne : « Ƴaaɓiŋ ngo, ŋ kiim ɗu wa kiim, kanaat tum ini moɗaaɗiineem waay ! <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Sikɗukaat, ŋ raakiɗ kuɓu kanak cafƴiɗ, ɓi inahɗi ƴaar, ɗu waaɗ ɗah, ŋ puliɗ ɓa ndii ŋ hari, ɗu haɓiɗ ɓa ini neɓ ɗu, waaye ƴaaɓi kanak cii, kanaat ɓa reɓ, laam, ɓa hanheeciŋ ngo. » <verse eid="GEN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Ɓa woosa ne : « Kurka ndii waay. » Ɓa ɓaatta nga ne : « Ƴaari nikohaah nikohaah ndii dong, a waaɗ ɓoo teeɓ waas ; ɓoo hey ɗa tume ini uup moɗaaɗi wiŋ ɓa. »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:9">Weɗ ɓa yeñoh Loot yeñ miskiɗ ne ɓa yahroh buntaana, <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />waaye ƴaaɓa hanheeca eɗndukka Loot na yaah, ɓa ɓekka ɗe ŋ ɗooƴ kahna, ɓa ranngaa, <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />ɓa mbiraañiɗta has caŋ ƴaaɓa nikee ŋ nguɓu kahna, ŋ ya uup ƴissuut po ŋ ya uup yak, ne ɓa hotissuu buntaana.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kooh ɗumbiɗ Sodom na Gomor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Wa ineem coot, hanheeca kanak ca woosa Loot ne : « Andi fu raakiɗ ɓaah ndii findi payum, kuɓu ƴaar mbaa ɓitiɓ ? Pulɗa ɓaah ciŋ ɗa ndii jen, <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />laam, ɓoo hey ɗumbe kur kii. Nikiɗi yegiɗ moɗaaɗiici na woyse nga te ca uupootiɗ ; a yi woos ɓoo ne ɓoo ɗumba. » <verse eid="GEN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Ineem tahha Loot pul, a woosa fiir ca hee toke kuɓuucaŋ ɗe ɓitiɓ ca ne : « Araat ɗu pul ŋ kur kii laam, Nikiɗi na hee wa ɗumbe. » Waaye ɓa liiɓpa ne a na apsukee ɓa.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Wa wiisaaɗiina ree, malaakaaca tufukka Loot an : « Ara coot na ɓitiifu na kuɓuuciŋ ɗa ɓitiɓ ci kanak ci, fu kaanuu ŋ naamooni na hee ŋ kur kii sagu aƴaarkiŋ ɓa. » <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Loot nikka nga, a yiihsiɗkeeɗa, hanheeca kanak ca ammba ɗe na ɓitiice na kuɓuucaŋ ɗe kanak ca ŋ yaah, ɓa puliɗta ɓa po ɓa ussa kur ka sagu miski a miskee Nikiɗi.<verse eid="GEN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Wa ɓa puliɗ ɓa ŋ bilaf fa, yinoora woosa Loot ne : « Saandoha, ka heeluk, ka tufuk ŋ hatandii, kaɗa ŋ tangooceen, fu min muc. » <verse eid="GEN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Loot woosa ɗe ne : « Bara ! Heɗ ɓoo, <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />fu keeñkohiɗ to, fu tumɗiɗ to in yakak po ŋ muciɗ, waaye, ŋ nar kaɗ po tangooceen ɗah, naamooni hey yo rahse, ŋ kaan. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Fu hotiɗ kur keen e ? Wa reɓiɗ po ŋ joyiɗ min ree nga. On ndo ŋ saandoh nga, ne ŋ min muc, laam wa kur ƴissuut. » <verse eid="GEN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Malaakaani woosa ɗe ne : « Ee, po woti ŋ ris ɗa tufkoh ; kaɗa, ŋ heyɗi ɗumbe kur ki fu na wee weem, <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />waaye artuka fu kaɗ laam, feeh fu reeɗi ɗah, ŋ minɗi tum ali in. » Ineem tahha po kur kaam teekuusa Sowar (in ƴissuut).<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Wa Loot ree Sowar, tel noha puliɗ. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Weɗi Nikiɗi toɓoh yongkaah na <char style="tl"><char style="w">suufar</char></char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">suufar</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: waɗ ini na koste <char style="tl">almet</char> (ŋ farañse "<char style="tl">soufre</char>").</char></note> ŋ ɗafuk Sodom na Gomor. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />A ɗummba kur ceem jen na ɓooɓa genee nga ca, na oona jen na kidig ca nikee nga. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Ɓiti Loot heelkeeɗa, a ɓoƴsuusa ɗus meɗa.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Wa Ibrahiima kuruk na ɓaaɓa teel, a kaɗta ŋ ɗiska a saɓsukohee na Nikiɗi ; <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />a marakka ŋ ɓak Sodom na Gomor na ina wil ooneem jen, a hotta ɗuuku haa ɗuuku koraaɓ puloheeɗa ŋ kehƴa rapeeɗa.<verse eid="GEN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Wa Kooh na ɗumbe Sodom a ɗaakkoheen Ibrahiima nof po tahha a muciɗta Loot ŋ naamoona a sooƴɗoh kur ca Loot genohe.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Faseehiŋ Amon ci na Mowab ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Wa ineem coot, Loot kaañisɗi nik ŋ Sowar, a toorukka ŋ tangooca, a yi na kuɓuucaŋ ɗe ɓitiɓ ca kanak ca, ɓa gennda ŋ hur atoh. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Wa raakka mbeh, yi nikee saawa woosa taambɗoh ce ne : « Ɗiski wa nik ndii baabiŋ ɓoo a yi yaɓko'eeɗa, te ƴaar raakɗi ndii, ɓi fu inah ne ɓa miniɗ ɓoo tok findi wa na tumohse. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Mbaa haya ɓoo aniɗ baabiŋ ɓoo biiñ, ɓoo hun na ɗe, ɓoo min ɗe raakiɗ ɓi pulohan nga ɗe po tiikiŋ ɗe ƴimuu. »<verse eid="GEN 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Ŋ weka mbaɗi ɓa aniɗta baab ɓa biiñ, saawa aassa faanukka na ɗe, te Loot yegɗi faankaŋ yeem na kurkaŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Wa Kooh wiis saawa woosa taambɗoh ce ne : « Niinma, ŋ huniɗ na baab, mbaa ɗah, ɓoo anɗissaat ɗe biiñ woti, fu nam kaɗ fu faanuk na ɗe, ɓoo min ɗe raakiɗ ɓi pulohan nga ɗe. » <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Ɓa anɗissa baabiŋ ɓa biiñ ŋ wekaam, taambɗoha nammba kaɗ faanukka na ɗe ; Loot namɗi yeg faankaŋ yeem na kurkaŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Kuɓuucaŋ Loot tumoh na baab ɓa ɗaa, ɓa taambohha nga, ɓa ammba rook. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Wa saawa raak kuɓu, a nikka ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Mowab (puloh ŋ baab), a yi caaciŋ Mowab ci woti-woti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="w">Musaa</char> fiis tiiki "woti-woti" ɗah, a fiis ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ woti-wotiinaŋ jamanoonaŋ ɗe. Wa nam nik ɗaa ŋ aaya 38.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Taambɗoha nammba raak kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Ben-Ammi (kuɓkiŋ ɓaah ho), a yi caaciŋ Amon ci woti-woti.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Ibrahiima, Saarata na Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Ŋ jamanoonaam, Ibrahiima pulohha ndeem, a kaɗta Negef, a yippa ŋ harmban Kades na Suur, a kurkissa nga, a kaɗta Gerar. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Ŋ nikohaahaŋ ɗe ŋ Gerar, Ibrahiima woyeen ne, a yi na ɓitiice Saarata, ɓa taambɗoh taambɗoh. Abimelek, buuraŋ kur ka, woossa ɓooɓaŋ ɗe ne ɓa ɓayiɗ ɗe Saarata ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Ŋ wek, Kooh teeɓukka Abimelek ŋ heeƴ, a woosa ɗe ne : « Fu mand na kaaniɗ, laam ɓitɓi fu ɓay, a ɓitiɓ jaambur. »<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Raak Abimelek raawɗi hun na Saarata, a woosa Kooh ne : « Heɗ ɓoo, hanaa fu heyɗi ɗumbe ɓooɓiŋ kur kii ŋ ini ɓa inahɗi ? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Laam Ibrahiima a yi woyee so ne ɓa taambɗoh taambɗoh, te yi ɓitɓi nameen ndo woo ne ɓa taambɗoh. Wi ŋ haɓɗee ineem, ŋ tuma na liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ na yaah hooliɗ. »<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Kooh woyissa ɗe ŋ ɗooƴ heeƴi ne : « Ee, mi sah, ŋ inhiɗ ne ini fu tum fu tiiɗaa, weɗ tah ŋ hondohha ɗa tooñ njo, ŋ faɗɗi ɗa ne fu hun na ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Ŋ ɗiski wa nik ndii wika ƴaari ɓitiice, laam a woosuuɗ, te a hey ɗa kiimɗe, fu muc ŋ kakaan kii ; fu tumɗaa ɗah, inha ne fu hey kaane, fu na ɓooɓiŋ ɗa jen. »<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Wa Abimelek kuruk na ɓaaɓa teel, a ɓeeɗukka dag caŋ ɗe jen, a naandsukka ɓa ini raak, ɓa neƴƴohha lool. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />A ɓeeɗukka Ibrahiima, a meekissa ɗe ne : « Fu haɓiɗ ɓoo ye wii ? Ŋ tum ɗa ye po wa tahha ɗa ɓek ɓoo bakaaɗi yakkii, mi na ɓooɓiŋ ngo ? Fu tumiɗ ini ɓo' joyɗi tum. » <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />A ɓaatta nga ne : « Mi yii meekis ɗa, wa ye ɓek ɗa ŋ inii ? » <verse eid="GEN 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Ibrahiima woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ liiɓee rek ne, ɓooɓiŋ kur kii ɓa nupɗi Kooh delem ne ɓa hey yo ape sagu ɓitiiso. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Te wa nam nik keeh ne a taambɗoh ho, laam, e ɓoo ɓaah baab waaye ɓoo ɓaahɗi yaay, ŋ tokka ɗe, a nikka ɓitiiso. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Ina Kooh pulɗoh ho ŋ kahan baab ɓoo po wi, ŋ wileeɗa, ŋ woyee Saarata ne : “ Fu waaɗta so amboh ɗah, ɗisik nu ɓoo min kaɗ ɗah, fu na woye ne ɓoo taambɗoh taambɗoh. ” »<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Wa ɓa ƴut ŋ woo caŋ ɓa, Abimelek ɓayya ɓi pe', mbaal na ɓi inoh na <char style="w">ñaam</char>, ƴaar na ɓitiɓ, a eɗta Ibrahiima, a nammba ɗe wik ɓitiice Saarata. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />A woosa ɗe ne : « Kur kiŋ ngo weɗɗi, gena ŋ ɗiski neɓ ɗa. » <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />A woosa Saarata ne : « Fu hot nga, mi yii eɗ taambɗoh fu <char style="w">ƴel haalis</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ƴel haalis </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ jamanoonaŋ Ibrahiima, na <char style="w">Musaa</char>, na ɓi woosuuɗ wiiriis, hanjar raakeeɗi, ca ƴel haalis ceɗ ɓooɓa meeɗ romoh, ca meeɗ meeɗ ɓeesu. Ƴel haalis yino, weɗ pangkoh bumit na wirndasse ŋ neeh yatuus kaɗta neeh ndaŋkiyaah.</char></note> junni, wa hey teeɓohe ŋ fiki gentoh ciŋ ɗa ne, fu hooliɗ ŋ inii ; ɓooɓi jen inah ne, fu tumɗi in moɗaaɗi. »<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Wa Abimelek wik ɗe Saarata, Ibrahiima kiimmba Kooh, Kooh ngisohiɗta Abimelek na ɓitiice na ñaam ca ɓitiɓ ca po ɓa minissa raak kuɓu. <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />Weem raak Nikiɗi rangeen fikiicaŋ ɓitiɓ caŋ kahan Abimelek jen po ɓa minisseeɗi raak kuɓu, sagu Saarata ɓiti Ibrahiima.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Raakuukaŋ Isaahha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Saarata, a yi genoh na Ibrahiima po, Nikiɗi ambohha ɗe findi a woyohee wa. A tumiɗta ɗe ina a gapee ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Saarata ammba rook, a raakiɗta Ibrahiima kuɓu ƴaar, ngaŋ kiyaɓkookaŋ ɗe, findi Kooh gapohee wa, wa nohaŋ wa ree. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Ibrahiima teekka kuɓka Saarata raakee na ɗe, Isaahha. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />A nguɗta ɗe ŋ neeha yasna-kaahayɗoh, findi Kooh woyohee ɗe wa. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Ibrahiima raakeen kiis teemet (100) wa Isaahha raaku. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Saarata woosa ne : « Kooh soosɗiɗ keeñiŋ ngo po ŋ miniɗ ƴen, te ɓo' nu kerah raakuukiŋ Isaahha yii ɗah, a hey yo ƴenohe. » <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Saarata degga nga ne : « Eey ɓo' woyeen Ibrahiima ne noh hey haye, Saarata ɓapɗe ɓi kuɓu ɗah ! Waaye deey ŋ raakɗiɗ ɗe kuɓu ƴaar ngaŋ kiyaɓkookiŋ ɗe wii. »<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Wa Isaahha yak po Saarata ombɗeeɗa ɗe, Ibrahiima ɓeeɗkohha ceeke yakak. <verse eid="GEN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Saarata hotta Ismaayla ƴeneeɗa, a yi kuɓki Ibrahiima raakee na Haajara yi puloh <char style="w">Misra</char> ; <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />wa tahha po a woosa Ibrahiima ne : « Aaña <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaami</char> na kuɓkiŋ ɗe laam, kuɓkiŋ ñaamii joyɗi lam na kuɓkiŋ ngo, Isaahha. » <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Woo keem ngaŋ Ismaayla misikka Ibrahiima lool laam, a namee nik kuɓuuce. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Waaye Kooh woosa ɗe ne : « Ineem kanaat ɗa misik sagu kuɓkii na ñaamiŋ ɗa, tuma ini Saarata woo ɗa laam, fu raakohan ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa ŋ Isaahha ; <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />hondohɗi kuɓkiŋ ñaamiŋ ɗa, ŋ hey name fer cuuɓ angiɗ nga ɗe, laam, a nam puloh nga ɗa. »<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pulɗuukaŋ Ismaayla na yaay ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Ŋ Kooh-wiisiina, na ɓaaɓa teel, Ibrahiima ɓayya mbuuru na mbohos und tumiɗ masuɓ, a eɗta Haajara ca, a likiɗta ɗe ca ŋ yuug, a nammba ɗe eɗ kuɓkiŋ ɗe. Ƴutta, a puliɗta ɗe. Yeem kaɗeeɗa po a reesa bilaf faŋ Beerseba, a muuƴca.<verse eid="GEN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Wa masmaŋ mbohosa reeh, Haajara faɗta kuɓka ŋ tas kidig ƴin, <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />a tiinnda ini ree <char style="w">saangal</char> teemet (100), a ɓooffa, a woosa ŋ haf ce ne : « Ŋ minɗi marak muk, ŋ kakaan kiŋ kuɓkiŋ ngo. » A cangtiɗukka a fuɗeeɗa ŋ ɗafka. <verse eid="GEN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Waaye Kooh kerhiɗ hoosooraŋ kuɓka. Ŋ ɗafuk eel ci malaakaaniŋ Kooh ɓeeɗukka Haajara, a woosa ɗe ne : « Haajara, wa ye na ɗa ? Kana neƴƴoh ali in laam Kooh kerhiɗ kuɓki ŋ ɗiski a nik ndeem. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Kurka fu meeɓ ɗe, ambaa ɗe yaah kanak laam, ŋ hey fere cuuɓ angiɗ nga ɗe. » <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Kooh teeɓpa Haajara woong, a soɗta mbohosa nga, a aniɗta kuɓka. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20-21" />Kooh taambkoheeɗa komaaknda, a yakeeɗa ŋ bilaf faŋ Paran, a nikka weesoh ɓis. Yaay ɓa waakiɗta ɗe ɓitiɓ ŋ Misra.<verse eid="GEN 21:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ambtiɗohaŋ Ibrahiima na Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Ŋ jamanoonaam, Abimelek hunnda na Pikol, ƴaara adgohee hiñohoh caŋ ɗe, a raakka Ibrahiima, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ inhiɗ ne Kooh huniɗ na ɗa ŋ in nu fu haɓiɗ ɗah. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Ŋ ɗiski wa nik ndii, giña ŋ Kooh ne fu heyɗi so njuye, mi na kuɓuuciŋ ngo po ŋ set ciŋ ngo na haye ; ne findi ŋ moɗɗohee na ɗa, fu moɗɗohan na so ɗaa na ɓooɓiŋ kur ki fu parɗoh wii. » <verse eid="GEN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Ibrahiima woosa ne : « Ŋ giñiɗa. » <verse eid="GEN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />A nammba woo na Abimelek ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ naaca ƴaaɓaŋ Abimelek naafee nga ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimelek loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ inahɗi ɓoyi tum ineem te fu woyeeɗi so wa, ŋ hana kerah woti. » <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Ibrahiima ɓayya ɓi pe', mbaal na inoh, a eɗta Abimelek ca ; ŋ ineem, ɓa kanak, ɓa tufkiɗta ambtiɗohaŋ ɓa.<verse eid="GEN 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Wa ɓa tufkiɗa, Ibrahiima ɓakiɗta mbaal yasna-kanak. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abimelek meekissa ɗe ne : « Moo mbaal ci yasna-kanak ci fu ɓakiɗ nak ? » <verse eid="GEN 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />A loffa ɗe ne : « Teya mbaal ci yasna-kanak cii ŋ tiikiŋ ngo, weɗ teeɓoh ne, e mi ac naacii. » <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Weɗi tah ɗiska teekuusa Beerseba (naaciŋ giñi), laam, ɓa kanak jen ɓa giñoh ndaam. <verse eid="GEN 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Ɓa tufkiɗoh ambtiɗohaŋ ɓa ɗaa ŋ Beerseba. Ƴutta, Abimelek hunnda na Pikol, ƴaara adgohee hiñohoh caŋ ɗe, ɓa guridda ŋ kur kaŋ Filistiica. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Ibrahiima jimmba tas kaɗeeɗ ŋ Beerseba, a ñaamukka Nikiɗi, Koohi moos nik te a yi nikan po faw. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Ibrahiima gennda in maañiɗ ŋ kur kaŋ Filistiica.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Ibrahiima teyɗukɗiɗ Kooh ne a seeƴkoh Isaahha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Wa in ceem coot, wa raakka mbeh, Kooh markiskeeɗa Ibrahiima, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ibrahiima ! » Yeem loffa ɗe ne : « Ee, mi yii kerah ɗa. » <verse eid="GEN 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Kooh taalndiɗta ne : « Ɓaya kuɓkiŋ ɗa yinoori Isaahha, yi fu waaɗ ŋ keeñiŋ ɗa, fu kaɗ ŋ tangoora maa hee ɗa teeɓe ŋ kur kaŋ Moriya<figure style="fig" alt="Abraham to Moriya" file="GPS_Genesis22_AbrahamToMoria.png" size="span" loc="GEN 22:1–19" ref="Cam 22:1-19" />, fu <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkoh</char> ɗe ŋ ndaam, a nik <char style="w" lemma="hoomiɗ">hoomɗaah</char> wuu so. » <verse eid="GEN 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Ibrahiima kurukka na ɓaaɓa teel, a ɓessa sokoñ seeƴkoha, a siffa mbaamaŋ ɗe, a hunnda na <char style="w">ñaam</char> kanak ŋ ñaam caŋ ɗe, na kuɓkiŋ ɗe Isaahha ; ɓa kaɗeeɗa ɗiska Kooh woyee ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Ŋ neeha kaahayɗoh, Ibrahiima ƴokka ɗiska Kooh woyee ɗe in usiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />A woosa ñaam caŋ ɗe ne : « Tasaat ndii na mbaami, mi na njaanji, ɓoo kaɗ ñaamka Kooh ndeen, ɓoo hay. » <verse eid="GEN 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Ibrahiima ɓayya sokoñ ca seeƴkohaaca, a raannda Isaahha ca, a ɓayootta yongkaaha na japla. Ɓa hunnda kanak, ɓa kaɗeeɗa.<verse eid="GEN 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Ɓa kaɗoh kaɗoh po, Isaahha woosa baabiŋ ɗe ne : « Baab ! » A tahassa ɗe ne : « Ee, mi yii kerah ɗa. » Kuɓka meekissa ɗe ne : « Sokoñ ci ceɗi cii, yongkaahi weɗi wii, moo a nde mbaali joy seeƴkohu ? » <verse eid="GEN 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Ibrahiima loffa ɗe ne : « E Kooh ŋ haf ce na hee eɗohe mbaali joy seeƴkohu. » Ɓa taalndiɗta kanak, ɓa kaɗeeɗa.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Wa ɓa ree ɗiska Kooh woyee ɗe, Ibrahiima haɓiɗta seeƴkoha, a degga sokoñ ca nga, a tokka kuɓkiŋ ɗe Isaahha, a degga ɗe ŋ sokoñ ca. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Ibrahiima meeɓpa japla ne a hoos kuɓkiŋ ɗe, <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />waaye malaakaaniŋ Nikiɗi ɓeeɗukka ɗe ŋ eel ci, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ibrahiima ! Ibrahiima ! » A tahassa ɗe ne : « Ee, mi yii kerah ɗa. » <verse eid="GEN 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Malaakaani woosa ɗe ne : « Kana reɓ kuɓki, kanaa ɗe tum in. Ŋ inhiɗ kotii ne, fu nupiɗ Kooh laam, fu sangiɗɗi so kuɓkiŋ ɗa yinoori. » <verse eid="GEN 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Ibrahiima jaɗtukka, a hotta mbaal naar na wiic ca longiɗ ŋ kidig ƴin ; a ɓayya ɗe, a hoomiɗta ɗe ŋ ɗiska Isaahha joyee seeƴkohu. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Ibrahiima teekka ɗiska "Nikiɗi eɗohiɗ ini etohu." Weɗi tah waam po woti ɓa na woye ne : « Ŋ tangooraŋ Nikiɗi, a hey eɗohe ini etohu. »<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Ŋ eel ci, malaakaaniŋ Nikiɗi ɓeeɗkissa Ibrahiima, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />a woosa ɗe ini Nikiɗi woo wii : « Ŋ giñiɗ nga so mi yii ne, ŋ tumi fu tum ineem, fu sangiɗɗi so kuɓkiŋ ɗa yinoori, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />ŋ hey ɗa barke'ɗe baahiɗ, ŋ on ɗa ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa laay po ɓa hend na hor ciŋ eel ci, po ɓo' minuu ɓa kind findi merhey miŋ yaah-cookmi. Te ɓeɗ na hee mine ɓi sang ɓa jen ; <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />cuuɓ ciŋ kehƴi jen hey raake barke sagu ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa, laam fu kerhiɗiɗ to. » <verse eid="GEN 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Ibrahiima dokukka ŋ ɗiska a faɗe ñaam caŋ ɗe, ɓa hunnda jen ɓa haadeeɗa Beerseba laam, a risee gen nga.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi rimkoh ŋ Nahor taambɗoh Ibrahiima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />E Ibrahiima nikoh ŋ Beerseba po, a woyuusa an : « Nahor taambɗoh fu namiɗ raak ɓi kuɓu ƴaar na ɓitiice Milka. » <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Ɓa saawkoh Uus, Bus taammba nga, Kemuwel yi baab ɓi Aram, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Kesed, Haaso, Pildas, Yidlaf na Betuwel. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Betuwel a yi rim Rebeka ; ɓii ɓeɗ kuɓu ƴaar ci yasna-kaahay ci Milka raak na Nahor, taambɗoh Ibrahiima. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Nahor nameen raak kilook ŋ ñaam caŋ ɗe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kilook ŋ ñaam caŋ ɗa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a yi ñaam tumuuɗ ɓitiɓ. Wa etoheeɗi a eɗse cakiim (ini ɓitiɓ na koce eɗu ne a kiimsee ɗah).</char></note> na woyse Rewuma, a raakka na ɗe Tebaa, Gaham, Tahas na Ma'akaa.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Findi Ibrahiima romoh kehƴa a uumboh Saarata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Saarata pesiɗ kiis teemet na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kanak na yasna-kanak (127) a hannda kuruk nga. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />A kaanoh ŋ Kiriyat-Arba, weɗ Hebron, ŋ kur kaŋ Kanaan. Ibrahiima miskiɗukka kakaan kaŋ Saarata ; a fuɗta ɗe lool. <verse eid="GEN 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Ƴutta, Ibrahiima faɗta fiɗaafa ŋ ɗiska wa nik, a kaɗta hotoha na cuuɓaŋ Hit ca.<verse eid="GEN 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />Wa Ibrahiima ree, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ jaambur nga ɗu, ŋ nikohaah nikohaah ŋ ndii, mi yii kiim ɗu ne ɗu on ndo ŋ waak ruy-ruyi mi na hee uumbohe fiɗaafiŋ ɓitiiso. » <verse eid="GEN 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Hit ca loffa Ibrahiima ne : <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />« Sikɗuka ini ɓoo na wee ɗa ; Kooh tumiɗ ɗa kilifa yakak ŋ ɗooƴ ɓoo, kon mbaa ɗah, kooɗa wi neɓ ɗa ŋ ruy-ruy ciŋ ɓoo, fu uumb ɓitiifu nga ; nama inah ne ali ɓo' heyɗi ɗa sangohe ɗiski fu joy uumb ɓitiifu. »<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Wa Ibrahiima kerah woo keem, a kurukka, a hiirra ŋ fiki Hit ca genee ŋ kur ka. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />Ƴutta, a hannda ɓa woo ne : « Nik ne ɗu teyɗukiɗ ne ŋ uumb ɓitiiso ndii ɗah, kiimaat Efron, kuɓkiŋ Sohar, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />a faɗiɗ to huraŋ atoh faŋ ɗe nik ŋ Makpela, weɗaa ŋ sereendaŋ yohon ce ; kiimaat ɗe a toon ndo wa ŋ candoomiŋ wa po wa nik ruy-ruyi ŋ raakoot ŋ fikiiɗu. »<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Wa Ibrahiima na wee, raak Efron ɓoofiɗ ŋ harmban ɓaah caŋ ɗe Hit ca. Ŋ fiki Hit ca cohee ŋ ɗiska jen, ŋ <char style="w" lemma="aasoha kur">aasohaanaŋ kur ka</char>, Efron loffa Ibrahiima ŋ ɗafka ne : <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />« On ndo ŋ woo ɗa kilifaani, ɓaya ɓay yohna na huraŋ atoh fa ; ŋ fiki ɓooɓiŋ ngo, ŋ on ɗa wa, fu tuma ruy-ruyiŋ ɓitiifu. » <verse eid="GEN 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Ŋ woo keem, Ibrahiima hiirissa ŋ fiki ɓooɓaŋ kur ka. <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />Ƴutta, a woosa Efron ŋ ɗafka ne : « Ɓoo kanaata nookoh, faɗa ŋ eɗ ɗa candoomiŋ yohni ; teya haalsi po ŋ min uumb ɓitiiso. »<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efron woosa ɗe ne : <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />« Kilifaani, yohni na care <char style="w">ƴel haalis</char> teemet-nikiis (400), ineem ye ŋ harmban mi na ɗa ? Kon fu miniɗ uumb ɓitiifu nga. » <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Ibrahiima kerahha woo ka, a eɗohha candooma Efron woo ŋ fiki Hit ca, wa nikka ƴel teemet-nikiis (400) ŋ haalis, ɓeesuuɗ ŋ findi toonoh caam meeɗ tumoh. <verse eid="GEN 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Ibrahiima raakoh yohon Efron ɗaa, wa nikee ŋ Makpela, ŋ pulohaaɗ-nohaŋ Mamre. Yohna, po ɗiska wa top, na kidig ca nikee ŋ ɗooƴa na huraŋ atoh fa ; <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />ca nikka raakuuɗaŋ Ibrahiima ŋ fiki Hit ca cohee ŋ <char style="w" lemma="aasoha kur">aasohaanaŋ kur ka</char> jen.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Wa a puloh nga, Ibrahiima ɓekka fiɗaafaŋ ɓitiice Saarata ŋ ɗooƴ huraŋ atoh fa nik ŋ yohna ŋ Makpela ŋ pulohaaɗ-nohaŋ Mamre, weɗ Hebron, ŋ kur kaŋ Kanaan, wa nikka ruy-ruyaŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Hit ca teyɗukka ne, e Ibrahiima raak huraŋ atoh fa na yohna ; tahha po a tummba ɗiska ruy-ruy caŋ ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Kilookaŋ Isaahha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Ibrahiima yaɓko'een lool, te Nikiɗi barke'ɗeen ɗe ŋ in nu nik ɗah. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Wa raakka mbeh, Ibrahiima woosa <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaama</char> yakka ŋ ñaam caŋ ɗe, ya meeɗ taambkoh raak-raakaŋ ɗe jen ne : « Ooɓa yaahiŋ ɗa ŋ rambiŋ ngo, <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />fu giñiɗ to ŋ Nikiɗi, Kooh yi Heɗ ɗafki na kehƴi, ne fu heyɗi waakɗe kuɓkiŋ ngo ɓitiɓ ŋ cafaƴ ciŋ Kanaan, kur ki ŋ genoh wii, <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />waaye fu na hee kaɗe po ŋ kur ɓoo, ŋ ɓooɓaŋ ngo, fu waakiɗ kuɓkiŋ ngo Isaahha ɓitiɓ nga. »<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Ñaama loffa ɗe ne : « Wa miniɗ nik ne ɓitɓeem teyɗukanɗi hay na so ŋ kur kii, andi maa hee hey ɓayndohe kuɓkiŋ ɗa po ŋ kur ka fu puloh ? » <verse eid="GEN 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Ibrahiima woosa ɗe ne : « Muk, kana moos ɓay kuɓkiŋ ngo ŋ ndaam. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Laam Nikiɗi, Kooh yiŋ ɗafki, yi pulɗoh ho kahan baab na kur ɓoo, woyiɗ na so, a giñiɗta so ne a hey one ɓi rimkohan nga so kur kii jen ; a yi na hee woose malaakaaniŋ ɗe, yeem yooɓɗiɗ ɗa waasiŋ ɗa po, fu ɓayohiɗ kuɓkiŋ ngo ɓitiɓ ŋ ndaam. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Nik ne ɓitɓeem teyɗukanɗi hay na ɗa ɗah, giñi fu na hee giñe wii, wa hey ɗa ruhse, waaye findi wa min mand ɗah, kana ɓay kuɓkiŋ ngo ndaam. » <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Ñaama ooɓpa yaahaŋ ɗe ŋ rambaŋ Ibrahiima kilifaanaŋ ɗe, a giñiɗta ɗe ineem.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Wa a ƴut, ñaama ɓayya ngeelemb ndaŋkiyaah ŋ caŋ kilifaanaŋ ɗe na ina uup baah ŋ raak-raakaŋ kilifaanaŋ ɗe, a yurahha kur ka Nahor genohe, ŋ ɓak Mesopotami.<verse eid="GEN 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />A na huntoh caŋ ɗe, ɓa kaɗoh kaɗoh po ɓa reesa ŋ woong ne fu aasee ŋ kur ka ɗah, a ƴekiɗta ngeelemb ca ; wa nikee ŋ noh niiniɗ, wahtuuni ɓitiɓ ca na pulohe ne ɓa kaɗ neya. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />A woosa ne : « Mi yii kiim ɗa Nikiɗi, Koohiŋ kilifaaniŋ ngo Ibrahiima, teyɗukiɗ to waasiŋ ngo wii, fu baahoha kilifaaniŋ ngo Ibrahiima. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Ñam yii tufukka ŋ woongiŋ masmi, te cafaƴ ciŋ kur ki hey haye neye. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Ŋ waaɗ ne cafƴi mi na hee kiime masuɓ, a naar meemeeniŋ ɗe a on ndo ŋ an, a nam woo ne, a hey yo anɗiɗe ngeelemb ci ; yeem a yi nikaat yi fu ambiɗ ñaamiŋ ɗa Isaahha. Ineem hey yo inhiɗe ne fu teeɓohiɗ baah kiŋ ɗa ŋ kilifaaniŋ ngo. »<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />A reehiɗɗi kiim ndoom, cafaƴ pulla na meeme ŋ yuugaŋ ɗe ; a nikka Rebeka, kuɓu Betuwel ; Betuwel yi baab ɓi kuɓki, a Milka yaayiŋ ɗe, Nahor yi taambɗoh Ibrahiima, nikka baabiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />A nikee komaaki cafaƴ moɗiɗ, inhaaɗi ƴaar. A aassa ŋ woonga, a neyya meemeena po a pulla. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Weɗ ñaamaŋ Ibrahiima aroh kaɗ coha na ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : « Kaambsuka, fu on ndo ŋ an ƴissuut ne wa neɓ ɗa ɗah. » <verse eid="GEN 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Rebeka loffa ɗe ne : « Ee, ana kilifaani. » A arra kaambsuk, a naariɗta ɗe meemeena, a aneeɗa.<verse eid="GEN 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Wa Rebeka ƴut, a woosa ɗe ne : « Faɗa ŋ nam aniɗ ngeelemb ci po ca hiƴ. » <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />A artukka, a yiiffa ina tasee ŋ hongla na anɗohse ; a dokkissa ŋ woonga. A yi neyoh neyoh po a aniɗta ngeelemb ca jen. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Ƴaara ɗekka teɗ, markeeɗa ɗe ne a inah, andi Nikiɗi teyɗukɗiɗ ɗe waasiŋ ɗe wala.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Wa a aniɗ ngeelemb ca po a ƴutta, ƴaara ɓayya tokkaah ŋ kiñin tiɓuuɗ na garam yasna-yino ngaŋ urus, na kiñi kanak urus ɓekaah ŋ yaah, waa nu nga ɗah, tiɓohu ini uup garam teemet (100). <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />A meekissa ɗe ne : « Woo so, fu kuɓu ɓa ? Ɓoo raakiɗ ɗiski ɓoo min neeh ngaŋ kahan baab ɗu e ? » <verse eid="GEN 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Rebeka loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ kuɓu Betuwel, ŋ setiŋ Milka na Nahor. <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Ee, kahan baab ɓoo raakiɗ mbaang ne ngeelemb ci raak ɗiski ca na hee neehe na ñamaah laayiɗ, te wa raakiɗ ɗiski ɗu joy min neeh. » <verse eid="GEN 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Ƴaara ƴekka po pukaŋ ɗe reesa kehƴi ne a ñaamuk Nikiɗi. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />A woosa ne : « Corka Nikiɗi, Koohiŋ kilifaaniŋ ngo Ibrahiima ; fu teeɓohiɗ baah kiŋ ɗa nga ɗe te fu moosɗi ɗe faɗoh ! Ini kaɗ nga so, fu yurhiɗiɗ to po ŋ ɓaah ciŋ kilifaaniŋ ngo. »<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Wa kuɓka cafƴa puloh ndaam, a arra kaɗ, a naandsukka ɓi kahan yaay ɓa ina raak jen. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Rebeka raakeen taambɗoh ƴaar na woyse Laban, Laban kaɗta raaka ƴaara ŋ sero woonga. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Weem, raak ɗe hoteen tokkaahaŋ kiñin ka na kiñiica taambɗoh ce ɓekɗasse, a nameen kerah wi Rebeka na naandsuke ina ƴaara woyee na ɗe. A raakka ƴaara na ngeelemb caŋ ɗe ŋ sero woonga. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />A woosa ɗe ne : « Fu yi Nikiɗi barke'iɗ, fu ɓoof ye ŋ bilaf fii ? Haya ɓoo kaɗ kahna, ŋ haɓɗiɗiɗ ɗu daloha na ɗiski ngeelemb ci nikan. »<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Wa ƴaara ree kahna, ɓa nihissa unung caŋ ngeelemb ca, ca ɓekuusa ŋ ɗisik baahiɗ, ca onuusa mbaang na ñamaah. Ƴaara na ɓa hunee na ɗe, onuusa masuɓ, ɓa naawissa kot. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Ɓa nammba deƴƴu kañam, waaye, ƴaara woosa ne : « Bala ŋ ñaman ɗah, ŋ woo kot ci ŋ tiind. » Laban woosa ɗe ne : « Ee, woya. »<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />A woosa ne : « Mi deey, ŋ ñaamiŋ Ibrahiima. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Nikiɗi barke'ɗiɗ kilifaaniŋ ngo lool, a tumiɗ ɗe ɓo' raakiɗ. A oniɗ ɗe ɓi pe', mbaal, na inoh, urus na haalis na ɓi ñaam ƴaar na ɓitiɓ na ngeelemb na mbaam. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Ɓitiice Saarata, a kaɗeen po a ɓitiffa, a hannda raak na ɗe kuɓu. Kuɓkeem, a yi Ibrahiima kilifaaniŋ ngo eɗ raak-raak kiŋ ɗe jen. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Kilifaaniŋ ngo giñɗukohha so ne : “ Fu heyɗi waakɗe kuɓkiŋ ngo ƴaari ɓitiɓ ŋ cafaƴ ciŋ Kanaan, kur ki ŋ genoh wii ; <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />waaye, fu na hee kaɗe po ŋ ɓooɓaŋ ngo ŋ kahan baab, fu ɓayiɗ ɗe ɓitiɓ nga. ” <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Ŋ woosa kilifaaniŋ ngo ne : “ Nik ne ɓitɓeem teyɗukanɗi hay na so ɗah ? ” <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />A loffa so ne : “ Nikiɗi, yi ŋ moos taamboh ŋ ini a waaɗ, hey woose malaakaaniŋ ɗe, a yooɓɗiɗ ɗa waasiŋ ɗa. Fu hey ɓayɗe kuɓkiŋ ngo ɓitiɓ ŋ cuuɓiŋ ngo, ŋ kahan baab ɓoo. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Ali ɓa teyɗukɗi, giñi fu na hee giñe, wa hey ɗa ruhse nik ne fu kaɗiɗ po ŋ ndaam ɗah. ”<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />Woti, wi ŋ hay po ŋ reesa ŋ woongi, ŋ kiimmba an : “ Nikiɗi, Koohiŋ kilifaaniŋ ngo Ibrahiima, nik ne fu hey yooɓɗe waasiŋ ngo ɗah, <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />ñam yii ŋ sero woongi. Ŋ waaɗ ne cafƴi na hee neye, ŋ kiim ɗe masuɓ ƴissuut ŋ meemeeniŋ ɗe, <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />a on ndo ŋ an, a nam woo ne, a hey yo anɗiɗe ngeelemb ci ; yeem a yi nikaat yi fu ambiɗ kuɓkiŋ kilifaaniŋ ngo. ”<verse eid="GEN 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Ŋ ƴutɗi woo ŋ haf fo ndoom, Rebeka pulla na meemeeni ŋ yuugiŋ ɗe. A ruhussa ŋ woongi, a neyya masuɓ. Ŋ woosa ɗe ne : “ On ndo ŋ an. ” <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />A arra kaambsuk, a naariɗta so meemeeni. A woosa so ne : “ Ana, fu ƴut ɗah, ŋ aniɗ ngeelemb ci. ” Ŋ annda, a aniɗta ngeelemb ci. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Weɗ ŋ meeksoh ɗe ne : “ Fu kuɓu ɓa ? ” A woosa so ne : “ Ŋ kuɓu Betuwel, yiŋ Milka na Nahor. ” Ŋ ɓekiɗta ɗe tokkaahi ŋ kiñin kiŋ ɗe na kiñiici ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Ƴutta, ŋ ƴekka ŋ kehƴi ne ŋ ñaamuk Nikiɗi Koohiŋ kilifaaniŋ ngo Ibrahiima, a yi amboh ho po ŋ miniɗ ɓayiɗ kuɓkiŋ ɗe Isaahha ɓitiɓ, setiŋ taambɗoh ce Nahor.<verse eid="GEN 24:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Mbaa ɗiski wa nik ndii, e ɗu na hee so woye andi ɗu ris amb kilifaaniŋ ngo ne ɗu teeɓoh baah kiŋ ɗu nga ɗe ; wa nikɗi ɗah, ŋ inah findi ŋ tuman. »<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Laban na Betuwel loffa ɗe ne : « Inii deey, wa puloh ŋ Nikiɗi ; ɓoo raakɗi woyaah nga. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Rebeka a yeem ŋ fikiifu, ɓayaa ɗe, a nik ɓiti kuɓkiŋ kilifaaniŋ ɗa findi Nikiɗi waaɗoh. »<verse eid="GEN 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Wa ñaamiŋ Ibrahiima kerah woo ceem, a ƴekiɗta Nikiɗi po pukiŋ ɗe reesa kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Ƴutta, a puliɗta ɓi in tiɓuuɗ ŋ haalis na urus, na ɓi ndima, a eɗta Rebeka. A nammba ɓay alal keeh-keeh, a onnda yaaya na Laban, taambɗoh kuɓka cafƴa.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Ɓa hannda ñam kotii, ɓa annda, a yi na huntoh caŋ ɗe ; ɓa neehha nga po na ɓaaɓa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:54">Wa ɓa kuruk, ñaamaŋ Ibrahiima woosa ne : « Onaat to ŋ haad ŋ kilifaaniŋ ngo. » <verse eid="GEN 24:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Taambɗoh Rebeka na yaayiŋ ɗe woosa ɗe ne : « Ona ɓoo, kuɓki cafƴi nik na ɓoo ƴissuut, ini ree neeh ndaŋkiyaah dong ; ƴut ɗah, fu kaɗ na ɗe. » <verse eid="GEN 24:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />A loffa ɓa ne : « Kanaat to ɗaak, laam Nikiɗi yooɓɗiɗiɗ to waasiŋ ngo po ƴutiɗ ; onaat to ŋ gurid ŋ kilifaaniŋ ngo. » <verse eid="GEN 24:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Po woti. Mbaa ɗah, ɓoo ɓeeɗkaat cafƴi a woo ini a liiɓ nga. » <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Ɓa ɓeeɗukka Rebeka, ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « Andi fu waaɗiɗ kaɗ na ƴaarii woti ? » A woosa ɓa ne : « Ee. » <verse eid="GEN 24:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Ɓa ambsohha ɗe na ɓoya meeɗ ɗe ɓapiɗ na ñaamaŋ Ibrahiima na ɓa hunee na ɗe, ɓa askohha na ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Ɓa kiimiɗta ɗe an : « Kooh barke'ɗaat ɗa, gooyiŋ ɓoo, a tum ɗa ɓasil, te ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa degaat ɓi sang ɓa yaah. » <verse eid="GEN 24:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Rebeka hunnda na ñaam caŋ ɗe ɓitiɓ ca, ɓa rappa ngeelemb ca, ɓa kaɗeeɗa na ñaamaŋ Ibrahiima.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Waam, raak Isaahha pulohiɗ Lahay-Roy, a gennda Negef.<verse eid="GEN 24:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Wa raakka niin, a tiindsukeeɗa ŋ nduuf-nduufa ; a jaɗtuk jaɗtuk, a ƴokka ɓi ngeelemb hayeeɗa. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Ŋ ɗafuk ngeelmba a rape, Rebeka nammba hot Isaahha, a ruhussa. <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />A meekissa ñaama ne : « Moo, ƴaara na hee cohe na ɓoo ŋ nduuf-nduufa yen, e ɓa ? » Ñaama woosa ɗe ne : « A kilifaaniŋ ngo. » Rebeka muurukka.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Wa ɓa coh, ñaama naandsukka Isaahha findi wa kaɗoh jen. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Isaahha ɓayya Rebeka ɓitiɓ, a waaɗta ɗe lool. A ɓekka ɗe ŋ <char style="w" lemma="ɗiip">ɗiipaŋ</char> yaay ɓa, Saarata. Ineem weɗ giifiɗ Isaahha ŋ kakaan kaŋ yaay ɓa.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Ibrahiima kurkiɗ nga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Ibrahiima nameen tok ɓitiɓ wiiriis teeku Ketura. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />A raakeen na ɗe kuɓu ƴaar yasna-yino : Simraan na Yoksan, Medaan, Majaan, Yisbak na Suwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yoksan, a yi baab ɓi Sabaa na Deedaan ; Deedaan nikka caaciŋ Asuur ci na Letuus ci na Lewuum ci. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Majaan, a yi baabiŋ Eefa na Eefer, Hanook, Abida na Elda'ah. Ɓii jen ɓa kuɓuuciŋ Ketura na set ciŋ ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Ibrahiima eɗeen Isaahha raak-raak kaŋ ɗe ne a lama. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kuɓuucaŋ ɓitiɓ caŋ ɗe ɓinooɓa, a nameen ɓa on ŋ raak-raaka wa a na pese, a cootiɗta ɓa ŋ kur, ŋ ɓak pulohaaɗ-noh po, ɓa ussa Isaahha, kuɓkiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Ibrahiima pesiɗ kiis teemet na ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak na kiis yatuus (175) nde a kurukka nga. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />A kaan ŋ kiyaɓko neɓiɗ, ŋ finho kipes hutiɗ, a haadda Jaanim. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Kuɓuuciŋ ɗe Isaahha na Ismaayla uummba ɗe ŋ huraŋ atoh fa nik Makpela, wa ŋ fiki Mamre ŋ yohon Efron, kuɓkaŋ Sohar, ya ɓaahe ŋ Hit ca. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Yohneem weɗ Ibrahiima romee ŋ Hit ca. A yi na ɓitiice Saarata, ɓa uumbu nga. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Ŋ finho kakaan kaŋ Ibrahiima, Kooh barke'iɗta Isaahha. A yi Isaahha, a genee ŋ sero laaha teeku Lahay-Roy.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi rimkoh ŋ Ismaayla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Inii weɗ naandsuku ŋ Ismaayla na ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe, kuɓki Ibrahiima raakee na Haajara, yi pulohee <char style="w">Misra</char>, <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamaŋ</char> Saarata. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Tiik ciŋ ɓa ceɗi cii : Nebayot a yi saawi, taammba nga Kedaar, taambissa nga Aadabel, na Mipsam, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Misma, Duma, Maasa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadad, Teema, Yeetur, Nafis po gannga ŋ Keedama. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Ɓii ɓeɗ kuɓuuciŋ Ismaayla ƴaar ci, tiik ciŋ ɓa ceɗi ceem. Ɓa nikka kilifa ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12) ɓi fu inah ne kur ca na ndut ca ɓa adgohee teeksee nga ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ismaayla pesiɗ kiis teemet na ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay na kiis yasna-kanak (137), a kurukka nga, a haadda Jaanim. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe genee ŋ harmban Hawiilaa na Suur, ŋ pulohaaɗ-nohaŋ Misra, ŋ waas Assuur. Ɓa genoh ɗaa, saɓsukohiɗ na ɓaah caŋ ɓa.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Raakuukaŋ siis ca : Esaaw na Yaŋhooɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Inii weɗ naandsuku ŋ Isaahha na kahan ce ; Isaahha nikee kuɓu Ibrahiima. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Wa a raak kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40), a ɓayya Rebeka ɓitiɓ, taambɗoh Laban. Rebeka namee nik kuɓu Betuwel ; ɓeɗ ɓeem, ɓa ɓaahee ŋ cuuɓaŋ Aram ca, ɓa genee Paddan-Aram. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Waaye Rebeka mineeɗi raak kuɓu, a ineem tah po, Isaahha kiimmba Nikiɗi ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ɓitiice, Nikiɗi teyɗukiɗta ɗe ; Rebeka ammba rook.<verse eid="GEN 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Wa a amb rook, kuɓu kanak hiñoheeɗa ŋ ɗooƴ rookiŋ ɗe, a woosa ne : « Wa ye tah wa kaɗohha an nga so ? » A kaɗta meeksa Nikiɗi. <verse eid="GEN 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Nikiɗi woosa ɗe ne : «</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Ca cuuɓ kanak nik ŋ rookiŋ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">cuuɓ kanak ɗalohiɗ hey rimkohe nga ɗa ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">winoori hey uupɗe wi tas hatil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">te yi ƴini hey yilfe yi yakki. »<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Wa noha a joyee ɓasloh ree, laam-laam raakɗi nga, ɓa nikangannga siis. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Ya ɗeɓ raaku nikka ruumind coy, a riiffa na find haa a ɓeku kulɓa, ɓa teekka ɗe Esaaw. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Ya taamb nga, raaku na yaahiŋ ɗe ambiɗ ŋ patangiŋ kotiŋ Esaaw, ɓa teekka ɗe Yaŋhooɓa. Wa komaakceem na raakse, wa tel Isaahha raakiɗ kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino (60).<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esaaw tooniɗ kisaawiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Wa komaakca yak, Esaaw nikka kaalsukoh keeh-keeh, a uupee waaɗ nik ŋ bilaf fa. Yaŋhooɓa nak, a nikee ɓo' yeeɓkiɗ, a nikangee ŋ <char style="w">ɗiip</char> ca. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Ŋ ineem Isaahha uupee waaɗ Esaaw laam a waaɗeen sepet kaalsukuuɗ lool, waaye Rebeka uupee waaɗ Yaŋhooɓa.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Wa raakka mbeh, Yaŋhooɓa tikeeɗa suppa, wa hennda Esaaw pulohha kaala yaaɓiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />A woosa Yaŋhooɓa ne : « Faɗ to ŋ on suppaani ruumndii, laam ŋ minisɗi in. » Ineem weɗ tah a tapuusa tiikiŋ Edom (ruumind). <verse eid="GEN 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yaŋhooɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Mbaa ɗah, toon ndo waɗiŋ ɗa paaɗ, wiŋ saawi fu nikoh. » <verse eid="GEN 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esaaw woosa ne : « Mi yi aɗuk po ŋ minisɗi, waɗ saaw raakiɗ to winde etoh ? » <verse eid="GEN 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yaŋhooɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Giñiɗ to ineem paaɗ. » Weɗ Esaaw giñohha, a toonnda ɗe wa. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Yaŋhooɓa eɗta ɗe mbuuru na suppa iraak, a ñammba, a annda po ƴutta, a cootta waas ce. Esaaw sagankohoh waɗiŋ saawiŋ ɗe ɗaa.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Isaahha na Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Wa raakka jamano, aɗ raakka ŋ kur ka, aɗ ɗalohiɗ na wa raakee ŋ jamanoonaŋ Ibrahiima ; tahha po Isaahha kaɗta Gerar ɗiskaŋ Abimelek buuraŋ Filistiica. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Ŋ ndaam, Nikiɗi teeɓukka ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Kana kaɗ <char style="w">Misra</char> waaye tasa ŋ kur ka maa hee ɗa teeɓe. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Nikohaaha nga, ŋ hey ɗa ambohe, ŋ barke'iɗ ɗa, laam maa hee ɗa eɗe keheƴ cii jen, fu na ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa ; ŋ hey tume ini ŋ gapee baab ɗu Ibrahiima te ŋ ginnjaa. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Ŋ hey ɓaate ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa po ɓa hend na hor ci laay te ŋ hey ɓa eɗe keheƴ cii jen. Cuuɓ ciŋ kehƴi jen hey raake barke sagu ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa, <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />laam Ibrahiima kerhiɗeen ndo, a teyɗukeen in ci ŋ nakohe te a taambɗeen waasiŋ ngo. »<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Weɗ tah Isaahha tassa ŋ Gerar. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />A nikee ŋ ndaam po ɓooɓaŋ kur ka meekissa ɗe ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ɓitiice. A loffa ɓa ne a taambɗoh ce laam a neƴƴoheen woo ne a ɓitiice, bala ɓa apan ɗe sagu moɗa Rebeka moɗe.<verse eid="GEN 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Wa ɓa nik nga po wa maannja, wa raakka mbeh, Abimelek buuraŋ Filistiica nikka ŋ palaŋteeraŋ ɗe, a hotta Isaahha hoñeeɗa ɓitiice Rebeka. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />A nakohha ɗe ɓeeɗkiɗu, a woosa ɗe ne : « Kon ɓoyii, a ɓitiifu ! Fu min woyoh na ne a taambɗoh fu ? » Isaahha loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ woyiɗa laam ŋ sangee ne ŋ apu saguuce. » <verse eid="GEN 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Abimelek woyissa ɗe ne : « Fu inhiɗ ini fu haɓiɗ ɓoo e ? Ƴaar ŋ ɓooɓiŋ ngo mineen ɗe ɓitiɓkoh ; mbaa ɗah, fu heen ɓoo ɓeke tooñ. » <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Abimelek nakohha ɓooɓaŋ ɗe jen woyu ne : « Ɓo' nu reɓ ƴaarii mbaa ɓitiice ɗah, a hey apse. »<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Ŋ kiis ka, Isaahha sokka ŋ kur ka, a raakka ini ree waas teemet ŋ ina a soke, laam Nikiɗi barke'ɗeen ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />A uupeeɗa nga raak, a raakka po a nikka heɗ alal, <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />a raakeen ɓi pe', mbaal na inoh na <char style="w">ñaam</char> laayiɗ po Filistiica siiseeɗa ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Siisa Filistiica siisee ɗe tahha po ɓa uummba naac ca ñaam caŋ baab ɓa Ibrahiima acee jen, ŋ jamanoonaŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Abimelek woosa ɗe ne : « Pula kur ki, fu kaɗ, laam fu uupɗiɗ ɓoo hatil. »<verse eid="GEN 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Weɗ Isaahha kurkoh ndaam, a kaɗta yipa ŋ oonaŋ Gerar, a nikka nga. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />A uumbissa naac ca baab ɓa acee wa a na pese, te Filistiica uummba ca wa a kuruk nga. Isaahha teekissa ca ŋ tiik ca baab ɓa ferɗee ca.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Wa raakka mbeh, ñaam caŋ ɗe aceeɗa naac ŋ oona po ɓa pulla ŋ cul masuɓ. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Waaye niiɗoh caŋ Gerar nookoheeɗa na ɓaŋ Isaahha an : « Masmii, a ɓoo raaka. » Isaahha teekka naacaam Esek (ñaɗoh) laam ɓa waakee ɗe ñaɗoh. <verse eid="GEN 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Ñaam caŋ ɗe acissa naac, lahtoh raakissa nga, a teekkaa Sitna (lahtoh). <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Isaahha pulohha ndaam, ñaam caŋ ɗe acissa naac, ali woo raakɗi nga, a teekkaa Rehobot (ɗisik angiɗ), laam a woo ne : « Nikiɗi oniɗ ɓoo po, ɓoo raakiɗ ɗisik angiɗ, ɓoo hey mine raak in ŋ kur kii. »<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Wa a puloh ndeem, Isaahha kaɗta Beerseba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Ŋ weka mbaɗi, Nikiɗi teeɓukka ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : « E mi Koohiŋ baab ɗu Ibrahiima, ka neƴƴoh ali in laam mi yii na ɗa ; ŋ hey ɗa barke'ɗe, ŋ ɓaat ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa sagu ñaamiŋ ngo Ibrahiima. » <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Isaahha haɓiɗta <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkoha</char> ndaam, a ɓeeɗkohha Kooh ŋ tiikiŋ Nikiɗi. A yippa <char style="w" lemma="ɗiip">ɗiipaŋ</char> ɗe ndaam, ñaam caŋ ɗe acissa naac ŋ ɗiska.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Isaahha, a yi nikoh ŋ Beerseba po, Abimelek pulohha Gerar, a hunnda na Ahusat nawleece, na Pikol, ƴaara adgohee hiñohoh caŋ ɗe, ɓa hayya ɗe raake. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Isaahha meekissa ɓa ne : « Wa ye tah po ɗu hayya ndii, te sang ngo weɗ tahee ɗu puliɗta so kur ɗu ? » <verse eid="GEN 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo hotiɗ hooliɗ ne Nikiɗi huniɗ na ɗa, weɗ tah ɓoo woosa ne ɓoo joyiɗ kerhiɗoh te ɓoo tufkiɗ ambtiɗoh, wa giñu ŋ harmban ɓoo na ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />Giña ne fu heyɗi ɓoo tume in moɗaaɗi laam ɓoo torhiɗɗi ɗa, ɓoo tumɗangee ɗa in baahiɗ, ɓoo faɗ ɗa faɗ, fu cootta moɗoɗ. Ŋ ɗiski wa nik ndii, Nikiɗi oniɗ ɗa barke. » <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Isaahha haɓɗiɗta ɓa kañam baahiɗ ɓa ñammba, ɓa annda. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Wa Kooh wiis, ɓa kurukka na ɓaaɓa teel, ɓa ginnja ŋ harmban ɓa, Isaahha askohha na ɓa, ƴutta ɓa cootta moɗoɗ. <verse eid="GEN 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Mbaɗi, ñaam caŋ Isaahha hayya nga ɗe, ɓa woosa ɗe ne, naaca ɓa acee nguliɗ. <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Isaahha teekka naacaam Siba (giñ). Weɗ tah po woti kur ka teeku Beerseba (naaciŋ giñi).<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Wa Esaaw raak kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40), a ɓayya ɓitiɓ kanak ŋ cuuɓaŋ Hit ca, Yehudit, kuɓu Be'eri, na Baasmat, kuɓu Eloon. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Ɓitiɓ caam mirndohha nik aay-keeñ ŋ Isaahha na Rebeka.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Yaŋhooɓa kociɗ Esaaw ŋ barkeena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Wa Isaahha yaɓko, has caŋ ɗe neɓisɗi, kaɗta po a minisɗi sah hot, wa raakka mbeh a ɓeeɗukka saawaŋ ɗe an : « Esaaw ! » Yeem loffa ɗe ne : « Ee ñam yii ! » <verse eid="GEN 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Isaahha woosa ɗe ne : « Fu hot nga, ɗiski wa nik ndii ŋ mand na kurkiɗ nga. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Mbaa ɗah, ɓaya halliiniŋ ɗa na ɓis ciŋ ɗa fu kaɗ kaalsuka, fu kom mbo, <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />fu tikiɗ to tik neɓiɗ findi ŋ waaɗoha, ŋ ñam, ŋ eɗ ɗa barkeeni ndo ŋ kaanan ɗah. »<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Wa Isaahha woyee na Esaaw, Rebeka kerhee nga. Esaaw ɓayya halliina na ɓis caŋ ɗe, a cootta kaala. <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Weɗ Rebeka ɓeeɗkoh Yaŋhooɓa a woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ kerhiɗ baab ɗu woyeeɗa taambɗoh fu Esaaw ne, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />a kaalsukɗaat ɗe, a tikiɗ ɗe tik neɓiɗ, a ñam, a eɗ ɗe barkeeni ŋ fiki Nikiɗi ndo a kaanan ɗah. <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Sikɗuk ko, te fu tum ini maa hee ɗa woye. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Kaɗa gat ca fu kom mbo koteng kanak baahiɗ nga, ŋ tikiɗ baab ɗu tik neɓiɗ findi a waaɗoha ; <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />fu eɗ ɗe a ñam, a eɗ ɗa barkeeni ndo a kurkan nga ɗah. »<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Yaŋhooɓa loffa yaay ɓa Rebeka ne : « Moo, Esaaw paariɗ te ŋ paarɗi ; <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />baab ɓoo laal lo ŋ yaah ɗah, a hey inhe ne maa ñaañohee ɗe, te ŋ kooɗohan alku nga waaye barke haa. » <verse eid="GEN 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Yaay ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Alkeem hay ɗah, wa ambaat to, tuma ɗaa rek, kom mbo in ci ŋ woo ɗa. » <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Yaŋhooɓa kaɗta ɓaya koteng ca, a eɗta yaay ɓa ca, yeem tikka ca findi baab ɓa waaɗoh. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Ƴutta, Rebeka ɓayya kulɓaacaŋ saawaŋ ɗe Esaaw, ca uupee moɗ, raak ca na ɗe ŋ kahna, a ɓekiɗta Yaŋhooɓa ca. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />A ɓayya ŋ und caŋ koteng ca a muurra yaah ciŋ Yaŋhooɓa na ɓaki raakeeɗi find ŋ mbooh kiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Ƴutta a eɗta ɗe mbuuru na kañam ka a tike.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa ɓay kañam ka, a kaɗta ŋ baab ɓa a woosa ɗe ne : « Baab ! » Isaahha loffa ne : « Ee, ñam yii. A fu ɓa ? » <verse eid="GEN 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yaŋhooɓa woosa ne : « Ñam Esaaw saawiŋ ɗa, ŋ haɓɗiɗ ini fu nakee so, ɓoofa fu ñam, ƴut ɗah, fu eɗ to barkeeni. » <verse eid="GEN 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Isaahha woosa ɗe ne : « Moo fu tumoh na po fu arra malu ? » Yaŋhooɓa loffa ɗe ne : « E Koohiŋ ɗa Nikiɗi, tum po ŋ arra malu. »<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Isaahha woosa ɗe ne : « Reɓa ndii ŋ saaɓiɗ ɗa, ŋ marak andi a fu Esaaw. » <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Yaŋhooɓa reɓpa, baab ɓa saaɓiɗta ɗe a woosa ne : « Hoosoori, a wiŋ Yaŋhooɓa waaye yaah ci, e ciŋ Esaaw. » <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />A inhiseeɗi Yaŋhooɓa laam, yaah ciŋ ɗe muurkeen na find findi ciŋ Esaaw. Tahha po a eɗta ɗe barkeeni. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Waaye ndo a eɗan ɗe wa ɗah, a meekissa ɗe an : « Wa hooliɗ ne a fu Esaaw e ? » Yaŋhooɓa loffa ɗe : « Ee, a ñam. »<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Isaahha woosa ɗe ne : « Deƴiɗ to ŋ ñam po ŋ min ɗa eɗ barkeeni. » Yaŋhooɓa deƴiɗta ɗe, a ñammba ; a nammba ɗe eɗ biiñ, a annda. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Ƴutta, Isaahha woosa ɗe ne : « Haya fu morgiɗuk ko. » <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Yaŋhooɓa reɓpa, a morgiɗukka ɗe. Wa Isaahha amb hetaŋ kulɓaaca, a eɗohha ɗe barkeeni an : « Aah ! Hetiŋ kuɓkiŋ ngo mand na wiŋ bilaf fi Nikiɗi barke'iɗ.<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Kooh ruhsiɗaat maar ŋ yohon ciŋ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">te a baahiɗ merhey miŋ ca,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">fu laayiɗ pees na biiñ.<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Ɓi cuuɓ ñaamkaat ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">ɓi heet ƴekɗaat ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">fu adgoh ɓaah ciŋ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">kuɓuuciŋ yaay ɗu ƴekiɗ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">ɓo' nu waaɗiɗ ɗa moɗaaɗi ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">a alku'aat,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">ɓo' nu waaɗiɗ ɗa moɗiɗ ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">a raakaat barke. »<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Wa a ƴut eɗ Yaŋhooɓa barkeeni, yeem cootee coot rek, Esaaw pulohha kaala. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />A nammba tik tik neɓiɗ, a kommbaa baabiŋ ɗe. Wa a ree a woosa ɗe ne : « Baab, ɓoofa fu ñam, fu eɗ to barkeeni. » <verse eid="GEN 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Isaahha meekissa ɗe ne : « A fu ɓa ? » A loffa ne : « Ñam Esaaw, saawiŋ ɗa. » <verse eid="GEN 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Isaahha feyuusa po a saakɗoheeɗa ; a woosa ne : « Moo, a ɓa kee kaala po a hayya a eɗta so ŋ ñammba raak ɗa hayɗi ? Yeem a yi ŋ eɗ barkeeni te wa hey nike na ɗe. »<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Wa Esaaw kerah woo keem, keeñiŋ ɗe aayya, a leehkeeɗa ŋ ɗafka. A woosa baab ɓa ne : « Na so ! Nam mbo eɗ barke. » <verse eid="GEN 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Isaahha loffa ɗe ne : « Taambɗoh fu hayiɗ ndii a ñaañohha so po ŋ eɗta ɗe barkeeni ŋ joyee ɗa eɗ. » <verse eid="GEN 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esaaw woosa ne : « A ɗalɗi tiikiŋ ɗe Yaŋhooɓa (ñaañohoh), a ñaañohiɗ to waas kanak, a adug ɓay waɗiŋ saawi ŋ nikoh, a yi a ɓayissiɗ barkeeni fu joyee so barke'iɗ. » A woosa baab ɓa ne : « Moo fu tasiɗɗi barkeeni fu min ndo eɗ e ? » <verse eid="GEN 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Baab ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ tumiɗ ɗe kilifaaniŋ ɗa po ƴutiɗ, ŋ kiimɗiɗ ɗe pees na biiñ laayiɗ te a hey nike kilifaaniŋ ɓaah ciŋ ɗe, ŋ min ɗa ye tumiɗ ? » <verse eid="GEN 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esaaw ɓaatta ndengɗuk nga an : « Fu min barke'ɗoh waas yino dong e ? Nam mbo eɗ barke, baab. » A ammba ŋ muhun ca a fuɗeeɗa. <verse eid="GEN 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Baab ɓa woosa ɗe ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">« Fu hey use merhey mi baahɗi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">na maari na pulohe ŋ ɗafki.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Fu na hee pesohe hiñoh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">te a taambɗoh fu yilfan ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">waaye mbeha fu ndengɗukohan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">fu hey kaambsuke ini a raan ɗa. »<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Barkeeni Yaŋhooɓa ɓayoh ŋ baab ɓa, weɗ tah po Esaaw ambiɗta ɗe aay-keeñ. A woosa ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne : « Baab mand na kaaniɗ, ruyiŋ ɗe reeh ɗah, ŋ ap Yaŋhooɓa. » <verse eid="GEN 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Wa Rebeka inah ina saawiŋ ɗe Esaaw nar tum, a nakohha ɓeeɗkiɗu Yaŋhooɓa, kuɓkiŋ ɗe ƴini, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ ɗiski wa nik ndii, taambɗoh fu waaɗ ɗa ap ne a wirnduk. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Mbaa fu na hee tume an : Ara saandoh ɗiskaŋ taambɗoh ho Laban ŋ Haaraan, <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />fu ɓoofohaah nga po Esaaw giif ngaŋ ayrukiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Aay-keeñiŋ ɗe reeh po a alkoh ini fu haɓiɗ ɗe ɗah, ŋ hey woose ɓo' a kaɗ ɗa ɓaya ; ŋ waaɗɗi ɗu ñak kanak ŋ noh yino. »<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saandohaŋ Yaŋhooɓa ŋ Paddan-Aram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Wa Rebeka woo na Yaŋhooɓa po ƴutta, a woosa Isaahha ne : « Ɗiski ŋ nik kipes neɓisɗi so sagu ɓitiɓ ciŋ Esaaw ɓii, na cuuɓiŋ Hiti ɓa nikoh. Yaŋhooɓa nam ɓay ɓitiɓ nga ɓa ɗah, wa carissanɗi ŋ pese. »<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Weɗ Isaahha ɓeeɗkoh Yaŋhooɓa a kiimiɗta ɗe barke, a dennga ɗe an : « Kana ɓay ɓitiɓ muk ŋ cafaƴ ci gen ndii, Kanaan, <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />kaɗa Paddan-Aram, ŋ Betuwel yi rim yaay ɗu, fu ɓay ɓitiɓ ngaŋ kuɓuucaŋ taanum fu Laban yi taambɗoh yaay ɗu. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Koohi Min onaat ɗa barke, a tum ɗa ɓasil po fu nik caaciŋ ɓi cuuɓi cuuɓ. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Kooh onaat ɗa barkeeni a onee Ibrahiima, fu na ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa po fu raak kur ki fu nikoh jaambur wii, wi a gapee Ibrahiima. » <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Isaahha tuuƴca Yaŋhooɓa a kaɗta Paddan-Aram ŋ taanum ce Laban, kuɓu Betuwel yi ɓaah ŋ cuuɓiŋ Aram ci, a nikka taambɗoh Rebeka, yaay ɓi Yaŋhooɓa na Esaaw.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Esaaw, a kerhiɗ ne Isaahha kiimɗiɗ Yaŋhooɓa barke po a tuuƴiɗ ɗe Paddan-Aram ne a waak ɓitiɓ nga te a dengiɗ ɗe ne a kanaat ɓay ɓitiɓ ŋ cafaƴ ciŋ Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />A kerhissa ne Yaŋhooɓa teyɗukɗiɗ baab ɓa na yaay ɓa po a cootiɗ Paddan-Aram. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Weɗ Esaaw inhoh ne cafaƴ ciŋ Kanaan neɓɗi baab ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Wa tahha po a kaɗta ɓayya ɓitiɓ ŋ kuɓuuciŋ Ismaayla yi kuɓkiŋ Ibrahiima. A ɓayya Mahalat taambɗoh Nebayot, a ɓaatta ngaŋ ɓa a raake.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yaŋhooɓa, ŋ pulohaŋ ɗe Beerseba, a yurah Haaraan. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />A kaɗoh kaɗoh po ɗiska noha muyoh ɗe, a parahha ŋ atoh ca ŋ ɗiska, a tiknukkaa, a neehha nga. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />A heeƴca inaa feyohiɗ : Seel yipohha kehƴi po wa maannga ŋ eel ca, malaakaaciŋ Kooh rapeeɗa nga, ruhseeɗa. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />An ŋ heeƴi, Nikiɗi nikee ŋ serooce a woosa ɗe ne : « Ñam Nikiɗi, Koohiŋ caac ɗu Ibrahiima na baab ɗu Isaahha. Kehƴi fu faankoh wii, ŋ hey ɗa wa one, fu na ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa hey laaye po ɓa mand na merhey. Ɗu hey ɓaatke ŋ ɓak ci jen : pulohaaɗ-noh na muyohaaɗ-noh, yaah-sing na yaah-ñaahum. Cuuɓ ciŋ kehƴi jen hey raake barke saguufu, fu na ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Mi yii na ɗa te ŋ hey ɗa niiɗe ɗisik nu fu kaɗ ɗah. Ŋ hey ɗa dokne ŋ kehƴii laam ŋ hey ɗa tumɗe in ci ŋ gap ɗa te ŋ moosanɗi ɗa faɗoh. »<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa yunuk a woosa ne : « Ndekete yoo, Nikiɗi yii ŋ ɗiski te ŋ inheeɗaa. » <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />A neƴƴohha, a woyissa ne : « Ndii deey wa kaañaah haa, wa nikɗi ɗisik wiiriis ɗal kahan Kooh te weɗ yahndeeriŋ eel ci. »<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Wa Kooh wiis na ɓaaɓa Yaŋhooɓa kurukka teel, a ɓayya atoh fa a tiknukohe, a yippaa, a ɓayya diwliin a yiiffaa ŋ ɗafuk wa. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />A teekka ɗiska Betel (kahan Kooh). Waaye kur ka teeksee Luus ŋ ɗeɓgaan. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Ƴutta, a gapukka an : « Kooh hun na so, a tufkoh ho ŋ ɓaaɓiŋ ngo, a on ndo kañam na ɓekkaah, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />te a amboh ho po ŋ dokuk kahan baab ɓoo moɗoɗ ɗah, ŋ ineem a yi Nikiɗi, a yi nikan Koohiŋ ngo. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Te atoh fi ŋ yip inhisoha wii, wa hey nike kahan Kooh. Ndaŋkiyaah nu a tumiɗ to ɗah, ŋ hey ɗe eɗe yinooriŋ wa. »<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Cohaŋ Yaŋhooɓa na Rasel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa puloh ndaam, a yurahha ɓak kur kaŋ ɓi pulohaaɗ-noh. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />A kaɗoh kaɗoh po, wa raakka mbeh, a pulla ŋ naac ŋ bilaf fa, gat kaahay pe' na mbaal ambsukohiɗ goorra ŋ seroowa, laam, ɓa meeɗee anɗoh ndaam. Naaca meeɗ rangohu atoh yakak. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Ɓaa faɗe faɗ po gat ci jen cohha ɗah, ɓa pilngin atoh fa, ɓa ƴut aniɗ ɗah, ɓa dokina. <verse eid="GEN 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yaŋhooɓa meekissa niiɗoh ca ne : « Ƴaaɓi, ɗu puloh nde ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo puloh Haaraan. » <verse eid="GEN 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu inhiɗ Laban, setiŋ Nahor e ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ee, ɓoo inhiɗ ɗe. » <verse eid="GEN 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />A woosa ɓa ne : « A tum na ? » Ɓa loffa ne : « A yaa ŋ jam ; cafƴa na haye na gateen a kuɓkiŋ ɗe, Rasel. » <verse eid="GEN 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yaŋhooɓa woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu goorɗoh ɗoopaat ci ye, te ŋ hot nohi ris ŋ ɗafki ? Anɗaat ca, ɗu kaɗ ca niiɗa book ! » <verse eid="GEN 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo minɗaa paaɗ ; ɓoo na sekee sek po gat ci jen hayya ɗah, ɓoo han min pilngin atoh fi rang naaci, ɓoo aniɗ. »<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa woyee na ɓa, weɗi cafƴa reyoh na gataŋ baab ɓa, laam a yi Rasel a nikee niiɗoh. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Wa a hot Rasel, kuɓkiŋ Laban yi taambɗoh yaayiŋ ɗe, na pe' ca na mbaal ca, Yaŋhooɓa reɓpa ŋ naaca, a pilnginnda atoh fa, a aniɗta gataŋ taanum ce. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Ƴutta a kañiɗta Rasel na morgiɗuk, a fuɗeeɗa. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />A woosa Rasel ne : « Mi na baab ɗu, e ɓoo ɓaah, laam, ŋ kuɓu Rebeka. » Rasel nuppa, woosa baab ɓa wa.<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Wa Laban kerah ne Yaŋhooɓa kuɓkiŋ Rebeka yi taambɗoh ce hiiɗ, a arra kaɗ coha na ɗe, a morgiɗukka ɗe, a ɓayya ɗe kahna. Yaŋhooɓa naandsukka ɗe ini raak jen. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Laban woosa ɗe ne : « Fu kay, e ɓoo ɓaah ñif yino. » Yaŋhooɓa ɓooffa ŋ kahan ce ina ree caɓin.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilook caŋ Yaŋhooɓa kanak ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa tum nga caɓin, Laban woosa ɗe ne : « Ini fu ɓaah na so tahanɗi po, fu pangkiɗee so ɓarang ɓarang ; fu na hee so hey woye ini fu na hee wirndasse. »<verse eid="GEN 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Waam raak Laban raakiɗ komaaki kanak cafƴiɗ, saawa teeksee Leya, taambɗoh ce teekuusa Rasel. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Has ciŋ Leya moɗeen waaye Rasel nikee cafaƴ moɗiɗ lool. <verse eid="GEN 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Ŋ ineem Yaŋhooɓa waaɗee Rasel, a woosa Laban ne : « Ŋ hey ɗa pangkiɗe kiis yasna-kanak, ƴut ɗah, fu on ndo Rasel, kuɓkiŋ ɗa ƴini. »<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Laban loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ on ɗa ɗe, weɗ ngisohiɗ to fuuf, ŋ kee ona ɓo' wiiriis ɗe, kon, ɓoo tum ɗaa, fu miniɗ tas ŋ kahan ndo. »<verse eid="GEN 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Wa ɓa kerhiɗoh ŋ woo, Yaŋhooɓa pangkiɗta Laban kiis yasna-kanak, waaye ca mannda nga ɗe na ɓi neeh dong sagu waaɗa a waaɗee Rasel. <verse eid="GEN 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Ƴutta a woosa Laban ne : « Eɗ to ɓitiiso ŋ neeh na ɗe, laam kiis ci ɓoo woytiɗkohee reehiɗ. »<verse eid="GEN 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Weɗi Laban ɓeeɗkoh ɓooɓa genee na ɓa jen, a haɓiɗta ceeke. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Waaye, na weka, joy ne a ɓay Rasel, a ɓayya saawiŋ ɗe Leya, a eɗta Yaŋhooɓa ɗe, yeem neehha na ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Raak, Laban eɗeen Leya <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamaŋ</char> ɗe ɓitiɓ teeksee Silpa ne a amboh ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Wa Kooh wiis na ɓaaɓa Yaŋhooɓa hotta ne, a neeh na Leya. A woosa Laban ne : « Fu haɓiɗ to ye wii, ŋ woytiɗkohee na ɗa Rasel weɗi tahee ŋ pangkiɗta ɗa, wa ye tah fu worra so ? » <verse eid="GEN 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Laban loffa ɗe ne : « Ineem na tumseeɗi ŋ ndii, ali ɓo' na adgeeɗi kilooku yakak ce. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Waaye, ɗiindoha neeh ci yasna-kanak ciŋ kilooki na Leya, ƴut ɗah, ŋ eɗ ɗa Rasel ne fu tey pangkis kiis yasna-kanak ndii ɗah. »<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yaŋhooɓa teyɗukkaa a ɗiindohha neeh ca yasna-kanak ca na Leya. Ƴutta Laban eɗta ɗe Rasel ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />A nammba eɗndoh Rasel ñaamaŋ ɗe ɓitɓa teeksee Bilha. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Yaŋhooɓa neehha na Rasel, a waaɗta ɗe waaɗi uup wa a waaɗee Leya, a pangkiɗissa Laban kiis yasna-kanak.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuɓuuciŋ Yaŋhooɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Wa Nikiɗi hot ne Leya waaɗuuɗi, a tummba ɗe ɓasil waaye Rasel mineeɗi raak kuɓu. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Leya ammba rook, a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, a woosa ne : « Nikiɗi hotiɗ miskiɗiŋ ngo, ƴaar ro hey yo waaɗe kotii. » A teekka kuɓka Ruben (a hotiɗ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Toksiŋ tiik ci ndii, cum ɗah, ca tokis ini tiiki nik, cum ɗah, ca tokis ini reɓ mand na tiiki.</char></note>). <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />A ambissa rook, a raakissa kuɓu ƴaar, a woyissa ne : « Nikiɗi kerhiɗ to. A inhiɗ ne ŋ waaɗuuɗi, a onissiɗ to kuɓu wiiriis. » A teekka ɗe Simeyong (a kerhiɗ). <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />A ambissa rook, a raakissa kuɓu ƴaar, a woosa ne : « Koti-kotii, ƴaar ro hey ŋoɗe nga so, laam ŋ raakɗiɗ ɗe kuɓu ƴaar kaahay. » Ineem tahha po kuɓkeem teekuusa Lewi (ŋoɗ). <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Leya ambissa rook, a raakissa kuɓu ƴaar, a woyissa ne : « Waasii, ŋ hey gidme Nikiɗi. » Weɗ tah a teekka yeem Yudaa (ŋ hey gidme). A raakisɗi kuɓu, a tufukka.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Wa Rasel hot ne a minɗi raak na Yaŋhooɓa kuɓu, a ayrukka taambɗoh ce Leya ŋ raaki aa raake kuɓu ; a woosa Yaŋhooɓa ne : « Ɓoo raakaat kuɓu, ŋ kaaniɗ waay ! » <verse eid="GEN 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yaŋhooɓa ayrukka ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ñam Kooh yi hondoh ɗa raak kuɓu e ? » <verse eid="GEN 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Rasel loffa ne : « Huna na Bilha <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> ngo, a raakiɗ to kuɓu koɗaah, po ŋ min nik ɓasil. » <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Rasel eɗta Yaŋhooɓa ñaamiŋ ɗe ɓitiɓ, a hunnda na ɗe ; <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />yeem ammba rook, a raakiɗta Yaŋhooɓa kuɓu ƴaar. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Rasel woosa ne : « Kooh atte'iɗ, a eɗiɗ to keeh, a namiɗ to kerah po a oniɗ to kuɓu ƴaar. » Weɗ tah, Rasel teekka ɗe Daan (a atte'iɗ). <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Bilha ambissa rook, a raakɗissa Yaŋhooɓa kuɓu ƴaar. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Rasel woosa ne : « Ŋ leberiɗ na taambɗoh ho leber miskiɗ po ŋ saahiɗ. » A teekka kuɓka Naftaali (ŋ leberiɗ).<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Wa Leya hot ne a tufkiɗ, a minisɗi raak kuɓu, a ɓayya ñaamiŋ ɗe Silpa a eɗta Yaŋhooɓa ɗe ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Silpa raakiɗta Yaŋhooɓa kuɓu ƴaar, <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Leya woosa ne : « Wii deey, wa muuɗ. » A teekka kuɓka Gaad (muuɗ). <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Silpa raakɗissa Yaŋhooɓa kuɓu ƴaar, <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Leya woosa ne : « Ŋ sumiɗ po ɓitiɓ ci hey wee ne ŋ sumiɗ. » A teekka kuɓka Aser (sum).<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Wa raakka mbeh, ŋ jamanoona ɓaa nguɗohe bele, Ruben hotta kidig ci na paƴe ɓitiɓ minaaɗi raak kuɓu, na woyse mandargoor, a kommba yaay ɓa Leya ca. Rasel hotta ca, a woosa Leya ne : « On ndo ŋ mandargoor ciŋ kuɓkiŋ ɗa, ne wa neɓ ɗa ɗah. » <verse eid="GEN 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Leya loffa ɗe ne : « Naafi fu naaf ƴaar ro doyɗi ɗa e ? Po fu waaɗis ɓay mandargoor ciŋ kuɓkiŋ ngo. » Rasel woosa ɗe ne : « Mbaa Yaŋhooɓa neehaat na ɗa woti te fu eɗ to kidig ci. »<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa puloh yohon ca na niina, Leya kaɗta coha na ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : « Woti, fu na hee neehe na so laam, ŋ romiɗ mbari na mandargoor ciŋ kuɓkiŋ ngo. » Mbaɗi, Yaŋhooɓa neehha na Leya. <verse eid="GEN 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Kooh teyɗukiɗta Leya, a ammba rook, a raakissa kuɓu ƴaar, yi yatuusɗoh. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Leya woosa ne : « Kooh wirndiɗ to ŋ eɗi ŋ eɗ ƴaar ro ñaamiŋ ngo. » A teekka kuɓka Issaakar (wirndiŋ ngo). <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Leya ambissa rook, a raakissa kuɓu ƴaar, yi yasna-yino'ɗoh. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />A woosa ne : « Kooh tumɗiɗ to in yakak, kotii ƴaar ro hey yo meeɓle, laam ŋ raakɗiɗ ɗe kuɓu ƴaar yasna-yino. » A teekka kuɓka Sabuloon (a hey yo meeɓle). <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Ŋ mirndaani a raakissa kuɓu ɓitiɓ a teekka ɗe Dinaa.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Rasel, wa Kooh tufuk ŋ in ciŋ ɗe, a teyɗukiɗta ɗe, a onnda ɗe, a minnda raak kuɓu. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Rasel ammba rook, a raakka kuɓu ƴaar. A woosa ne : « Kooh pulɗohiɗ to ŋ kaciikiŋ ngo. » <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />A teekka kuɓka Yuusufa (a ɓaataat), a kiimmba Nikiɗi ne a ɓaat ɗe kuɓu ƴaar.<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Findi Yaŋhooɓa raakoh gatiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Ŋ finho raakuukaŋ Yuusufa, Yaŋhooɓa woosa Laban ne : « On ndo ŋ haad kur ɓoo. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Fu eɗ to ɓitiɓ ciŋ ngo na kuɓuuciŋ ngo ŋ coot, laam, ɓeɗ tahee so pangkiɗeeɗa ɗa ; fu ŋ haf fu, fu inhiɗ ini ŋ haɓɗiɗ ɗa. »<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Laban woosa ɗe ne : « On ndo wa on ! Laam, ŋ markiskiɗ po ŋ hotiɗ ne, Nikiɗi barke'ɗiɗ to saguufu, <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />woya ini fu waaɗ wirndu, ŋ eɗ ɗa wa. »<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yaŋhooɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Fu ŋ haf fu, fu inhiɗ findi ŋ pangkiɗoh ɗa, na findi gatiŋ ɗa mirndoh mand saguuso. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Ini ƴissuuti fu raakee bala ŋ hayan ɗah, wa ɓaatkiɗ baahiɗ. Laam ina ŋ aasoh kahan fu poyi, Nikiɗi barke'ɗiɗ ɗa saguuso. Mbaa wa reyiɗ kotii nak ne ŋ pangkiɗ haf fo. »<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Laban meekissa ɗe ne : « Mi na hee ɗa eɗe hend na ? » Yaŋhooɓa woosa ne : « Fu heyɗi so eɗe ali in, waaye fu teyɗuk ini maa hee ɗa woye ɗah, ŋ hey taalndiɗe, ŋ niiɗɗissee ɗa gatiŋ ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Ŋ woo ne, woti, ŋ hey aase ŋ gat ciŋ ɗa, ŋ puliɗ pe' ci na mbaal ci jen, ci nik njeenje nga na mbaal ci suusus ci, ca nik wirndiŋ ngo. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Kim fu hey marke wirndiŋ ngo ɗah, fu hey hote kiyurhiŋ ngo, laam fu hot mbaal ci nikɗi suusus mbaa pe' ci nikɗi njeenje nga ɗah, fu inah ne ca roku roku. » <verse eid="GEN 30:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Laban woosa ɗe ne : « Ee ŋ huniɗ nga. »<verse eid="GEN 30:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Waaye mbaɗi, Laban ɓayya suket ca na pe' ca njeenjeeca raak in yaanow jen, na mbaal ca suusus ca, a degga ca ŋ yaah kuɓuuciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />A cootta na ɓa, ɓa ussa Yaŋhooɓa ini ree tiindu neeh kaahay, waaye Yaŋhooɓa taambkoheeɗa ini tas ŋ gataŋ Laban.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Weɗ a waakoh ɓi ndooɗ iiri ngaŋ kidig kaahay ɓaahaaɗi, ndooɗ "<char style="tl">poopaalye</char>" na ndooɗ "<char style="tl">gerte-tuɓaaɓ</char>" na ndooɗ "<char style="tl">palatan</char>" ; a ŋeeƴ-ŋeeƴiɗta ca po ndooɗ nu nga ɗah, raakka yaanow yaanow. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />A ɓekka ca ŋ ɗooƴ hongla na anɗohse, ne ɗoopaat ca hay ane ɗah, ca hot ca laam, ɗoopaat ca meeɗ rapkoh ŋ ndaam ne ca hayya ane ɗah. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Ca rapkohha ŋ fiki ndooɗ ceem ɗah, ca na rime buul njeenje. <verse eid="GEN 30:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Yaŋhooɓa saɓsohha buul ceem, a yurhiɗta haf ciŋ ca ngaŋ njeenjeeca na suusus ca nikee ngaŋ gataŋ Laban. A waakoh gat haf ce ɗaa, ɓaahaaɗi na waŋ Laban<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ini Yaŋhooɓa haɓiɗ ndii na pe' ci na mbaal ci, wa tasiɗ ñiin ngaŋ peɗeem heber.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 30:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Ɗoopaat ca kapiɗ ca heesa rapkohe ɗah, a ɓekiɗ ca ndooɗ ca ne ca rapkee ɗah, ca yurhiɗkoh na ca, <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />waaye ca nikka ɗoopaat ca ñiiɓiɗ ca ɗah, a ɓekɗuu ca ali in. A tumee ɗaa po ca kapiɗ ca nikka caŋ ɗe, ca ñiiɓiɗ ca nikka caŋ Laban. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Ŋ mirndaani a nikka heɗ raak-raak yakak, a raakeen ɓi gat pe' na mbaal na ɓi ñaam ƴaar na ɓitiɓ na ɓi ngeelemb na ɓi mbaam.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Yaŋhooɓa moondiɗ ne a haad Kanaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Kaɗta po Yaŋhooɓa kerahha ini kuɓuuciŋ Laban meeɗ woo, an : « Yaŋhooɓa ɓayiɗ raak-raakiŋ baabiŋ ɓoo jen po wa tahiɗ ɗe raak. » <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Ŋ ɗooƴ ineem Yaŋhooɓa nammba hot ne findi Laban mandee na ɗe, a mandisɗi ɗaa. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Nikiɗi woosa Yaŋhooɓa ne : « Gurda fu haad kur ɗu, nga ɓi kahan baab ɗu, ŋ hey rise na ɗa. »<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Waam raak Yaŋhooɓa na gat ca ŋ yohon ca, a nakohha ɓeeɗkiɗu ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɗe Rasel na Leya ; <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />a woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ markiɗ po ŋ hotiɗ ne baab ɗu mandisɗi nga so findi a mande. Waaye Koohiŋ baab ɓoo yii na so. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Ɗu inhiɗ ne ŋ pangkiɗiɗ ɗe findi ŋ minoh, <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />hondohɗi a worra so, a ɓoƴsohha wirndiŋ ngo waas ndaŋkiyaah, waaye Kooh faɗɗi ɗe ne a tum mbo miskiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />A woosa so ne ɗoopaat ci tap-tap ci ceɗ wirndiŋ ngo ɗah, ndaamuuci jen na rime raakiɗ tap-tap. A woosa ne ci fiis-fiis ci ceɗ wirndiŋ ngo ɗah, ndaamuuci jen na rime raakiɗ fiis-fiis. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />E Kooh naaf gatiŋ baabiŋ ɗu, a eɗta so wa.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />Ŋ jamanooni ɗoopaat ci na rapke, ŋ hotta ŋ ɗooƴ heeƴ ne suket ci na rape jen nikee njeenje raakiɗ tap-tap mbaa fiis-fiis. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Weɗ malaakaaniŋ Kooh woyoh ne : “ Yaŋhooɓa ! ” Ŋ woosa ɗe ne : “ Ee mi yi kerah ɗa. ” <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />A woosa so ne : “ Marka, ɗoopaat ci na rape jen ca njeenje, raakiɗ tap-tap mbaa fiis-fiis, laam ŋ hotiɗ findi Laban na tumohe na ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Ñam Koohi teeɓkee ɗa ŋ Betel ŋ ɗiska fu yipee atoh fa, fu yiiffa diwliin nga, te fu gappa so mbaɗi. Ŋ ɗiski wa nik ndii, faɗa kur kii, fu haad kur ɗu. ” »<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa woo woo keem, Rasel na Leya loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo raakisɗi ɓak na in lamaah ŋ kahan baabiŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Ɓoo mand na jaambur nga ɗe ; laam a tooniɗ ɓoo po a ñamiɗ candoomi. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Mbaa, in nu Kooh naafoh nga ɗe ɗah, a wiŋ ɓoo na kuɓuuciŋ ɓoo ; tuma ini Kooh nak ɗa. »<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Weɗi Yaŋhooɓa kooɗkoh, a rapiɗta ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɗe na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ŋ ngeelemb ca, <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />a nammba ɓay ɗoopaat caŋ ɗe na in ca a raakoh Paddan-Aram jen ne a dokuk kahan baab ɓa Isaahha ŋ Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Waam raak Laban kaɗiɗ hufa find caŋ mbaal caŋ ɗe. Rasel tondukka nga, a rokka in ca pestuuɗ ca baab ɓa ambee ne ceɗ kooh ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Yaŋhooɓa nammba inah ne Laban yi ɓaah ŋ cuuɓiŋ Aram ci nikɗi nga, a moonnda ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />A saandohha na ina a raakoot jen, a huussa kala na woyse Ewfaraat po a pullaa, a yurahha ŋ ɓak tangooca nik ŋ Galaad.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Yaŋhooɓa cootiɗ po wa raakka neeh kaahay, Laban hanndaa woyu. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />A jaarra hun na ɓooɓaŋ ɗe, ɓa taambɗeeɗa Yaŋhooɓa ini ree neeh yasna-kanak, ɓa hannda ɗe rahas ŋ tangoocaŋ Galaad. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Waaye ŋ weka, Kooh teeɓukka Laban ngaŋ heeƴ, a woosa ɗe ne : « Wortuka woo Yaŋhooɓa in. »<verse eid="GEN 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Wa Laban rahas Yaŋhooɓa, raak ɗe yipiɗ ŋ tangoocaŋ Galaad ; Laban nammba yip <char style="w">ɗiip</char> caŋ ɗe nga, a yi na ɓooɓaŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />A kaɗta ŋ Yaŋhooɓa, a woosa ɗe ne : « Fu haɓiɗ ye cii, fu na ɗembohee so ye fu coote ? Fu ɓayndoh kuɓuuciŋ ngo ɓitiɓ ci po haa ɓooɓi ambohu ŋ hiñoh. <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Wee tah fu moonnda so, fu kaɗe te fu asukɗi so ? Fu woyeen ndo ɗah, ŋ heen ɗa faɗe fu kaɗ moɗoɗ, ŋ ɓend ɗa na ɓi ƴeek na haan na koora. <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Fu onɗi so sah, ŋ askoh na set ciŋ ngo na kuɓuuciŋ ngo ; fu tum naandoha kat ! <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Ŋ miniɗ ɗa tum in sepƴiɗ, waaye Koohiŋ baab ɗu teeɓkiɗ to niinma, a woosa so ne : “ Wortuka woo Yaŋhooɓa in. ” <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Fu seesuk haad kahan baab ɗu ɗah, fu miniɗ kaɗ sah, waaye fu rokoh kooh ciŋ ngo ye ? » <verse eid="GEN 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yaŋhooɓa loffa Laban ne : « Ŋ neƴƴohee ne fu naaf kuɓuuciŋ ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Waaye ɓo' nu fu hot na kooh ciŋ ɗa ɗah, a pesissanɗi. Ŋ fiki ɓooɓiŋ ngo na ɓiŋ ɗa, marka, in nu fu hot na so te nik ne ya fu raaka ɗah, ɓayaa. » Waam raak Yaŋhooɓa inahɗi ne a Rasel rok ca.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Weɗi Laban aasoh ŋ ɗiipaŋ Yaŋhooɓa na waŋ Leya na caŋ <char style="w">ñaam</char> ca kanak ca, a hotɗi in. A pulohha waŋ Leya, a aassa waŋ Rasel. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Raak Rasel ɓayiɗ kooh ca, a ɓekka ca ŋ teg ngeelemb, a ɓooffa nga. Laban marakka ɗiipa jen, a hotɗi in. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Rasel woosa ɗe ne : « Baab deey, fu na hee so hey ɗaase, ŋ minɗi kuruk laam ŋ hot naaw. » Ndaa a markoh po a yaaɓpa, a hotɗi ali in.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Weɗi Yaŋhooɓa ayrukoh, a ngasukka Laban an : « Ŋ tum ɗa ye, ŋ haɓiɗ winde ro' po fu taambɗee so mand an ? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Wi fu waak ŋ in ciŋ ngo po fu ƴutta, pulɗa ini fu hot ndii te fu raakkaa, degaa ndii ŋ fiki ɓooɓiŋ ngo na ɓiŋ ɗa, ɓa atte ɓoo. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Ŋ tumiɗ kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kanak (20) ŋ kahan fu ; ali ɗoopaat moosɗi waanoh nga te ŋ moosɗi ɗa ñamɗoh kuy yino. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Yaa nu apseen nga ɗah, ŋ meeɗɗi ɗa ɗe kom, ñam meeɗa deguk, te ɗoopaat nu rokseen nga, wa nik na wek mbaa na noh, fu meeɗ to ɗe meeɗ wirndiɗuk. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Dohɗiŋ nohi meeɗ reeh nga so. Wek ree ɗah, soosi hee so ape ; ŋ minuu sah gind pani.<verse eid="GEN 31:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kanak (20) ceɗɗi, ŋ nikka ca ŋ kahan fu, ŋ pangkiɗiɗ ɗa kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis nikiis (14) ne fu on ndo kuɓuuciŋ ɗa kanak cii. Ŋ pangkiɗissa ɗa kiis yasna-yino ne ŋ raak gat, waaye hondohɗi, fu ɓoƴsohiɗ wirndiŋ ngo waas ndaŋkiyaah. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Koohiŋ Ibrahiima, a nammba nik Yi baab ɓoo Isaahha nupe, a amboheeɗi so ɗah, fu heen ndo aañe yaah ɓarang. Waaye a hotiɗ findi ŋ yaaɓoh na ini ŋ op po tahha niinma, a atteesa. »<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Wa a woo ineem, Laban loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓitiɓ cii, ɓa kuɓuuciŋ ngo, komaakcii, ɓa ɓiŋ ngo te gat cii, ñam raak ca. In nu fu hot ndii ɗah, wa ɓaah nga so ; ɗiski wa nik ndii fu liiɓiɗ moos ne ŋ hey tume kuɓuuciŋ ngo in, na komaakciŋ ɓa e ? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Mi yi kiim ɗa ɓoo tufkiɗ ambtiɗoh ndii mi na ɗa te wa raak ini seede'ana. »<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Yaŋhooɓa parahha atoh, a yippaa, <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />a woosa ƴaaɓaŋ ɗe ne ɓa parhaat atoh ; ɓa parahha, ɓa juukka ca ɗisik yino. Ƴutta, ɓa ɓooffa nga jen, ɓa ñameeɗa. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Laban teekka ɗiska Yegaar-Sahaduta (juuk atoh seede ŋ peɗmiŋ ɗe), Yaŋhooɓa nammbaa teek Galeed (juuk atoh seede ŋ peɗmiŋ ɗe).<verse eid="GEN 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Laban woyeen ne : « Juukiŋ atoh fii weɗi ini na hee nike seedeeni ŋ harmban mi na ɗa woti. » Weɗ tah wa teekuusa Galeed. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Wa teekissuuɗ Mispa (ɗisik markoha), laam Laban woyisseen ne : « Nikiɗi markaat ɓoo kanak baahiɗ ne ɓoo hotohisɗi ɗah. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Fu torhiɗ kuɓuuciŋ ngo, mbaa fu ɓay ɓitiɓ wiiriis fu deg nga ɓa ɗah, inha ne ali ɓo' nikɗi ŋ harmban mi na ɗa, a Kooh nikan seedeeni ŋ harmban ɓoo. »<verse eid="GEN 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Laban woyissa Yaŋhooɓa ne : « Juukiŋ atoh fii na atoh fi ŋ yip, <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />ceɗ ŋ harmban ɓoo, weɗ teeɓoh ne ŋ joyɗi ca cootuk ne ŋ yurhiɗ in moɗaaɗi nga ɗa te fu joyɗaa nam tum. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Koohiŋ Ibrahiima na yiŋ Nahor<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nahor kosee in wiiriis ɓaahɗi na Kooh Nikiɗi.</char></note>, kooh ciŋ baab ciŋ ɓa, nikaat seedeeciŋ ɓoo. » Yaŋhooɓa ginnja ŋ Kooh yi baab ɓa Isaahha nupe. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Ƴutta a puliɗta <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkaah</char> wuu Kooh, a ɓeeɗukka ƴaaɓa jen, ɓa ñammba, ɓa neehha nga, ŋ tangoora.<verse eid="GEN 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Wa Kooh wiis, Laban kurukka na ɓaaɓa teel, a morgiɗkohha na set caŋ ɗe na kuɓuucaŋ ɗe, a askohha na ɓa, a haadeeɗa. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Yaŋhooɓa taalndiɗta waasaŋ ɗe. A yi kaɗoh kaɗoh po, ɓi malaaka teeɓukka ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Wa a hot ɓa, Yaŋhooɓa woosa ne : « Wii deey, wa daliŋ Kooh. » Weɗ tah a teekka ɗiska Mahanayim (dal ci kanak ci).<verse eid="GEN 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaŋhooɓa neƴƴohiɗ cohiŋ ɗe na Esaaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Wa ineem coot, Yaŋhooɓa woossa ɓi ɓo' ne ɓa adug ɗe ŋ taambɗoh ce Esaaw, ŋ kur ka na woyse Seyiir ŋ Edom. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu kaɗ ɗah, ɗu na wee kilifaaniŋ ngo Esaaw ne : “ <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">Ñaamiŋ</char> ɗa Yaŋhooɓa a yi woos ɓoo. A woo ne a ɓaaɓee ɗiskaŋ Laban, a nikka nga po woti. <verse eid="GEN 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />A raakiɗ ɓi inoh na mbaam, na ɓi pe' na mbaal na ɓi ñaam ƴaar na ɓitiɓ. A yii kiim ɗa ne fu teyɗuk ɗe moɗoɗ. ” »<verse eid="GEN 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Wa ɓooɓa Yaŋhooɓa woosee hay, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo deey, ɓoo kaɗiɗ ŋ taambɗoh fu Esaaw. A yii ŋ waas, na haye na ƴaar teemet-nikiis (400). » <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa kerah ineem a neƴƴohha lool. A paysohha ɓooɓaŋ ɗe dal kanak, na mbaal ca na pe' ca na inoh ca na ngeelemb ca. <verse eid="GEN 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Laam a woo ne : « Esaaw keen winoori ɗah, wi tas hey mine fus. » <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Yaŋhooɓa kiimmba Kooh an : « Nikiɗi, Koohiŋ caac Ibrahiima, yi nam nik Koohiŋ baab Isaahha, a fu woyee so ne ŋ dokkaat kur ɓoo, nga ɓi kahan baab ɓoo te fu hey yo ambohe. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Mi yi ñaamiŋ ɗa deey, ŋ carɗi baahohi fu baahoh ho na ambi fu amb mbo ; laam, wa maa huuse ŋ kalaŋ Yurdan, ŋ ambee ndooɗ dong ŋ yaah ciŋ ngo te ŋ raakiɗ dal kanak kotii. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Mi yii kiim ɗa fu muciɗ to ŋ yaah ciŋ taambɗoh ho Esaaw laam, ŋ neƴƴohiɗ ne a raak ko ndii, a ap po, a apndoh ndaamu na kuɓu. <verse eid="GEN 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />A fu woyee so ne : “ Ŋ hey ɗa ambohe, ŋ ɓaat ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa, po ɓa hend na merhey mi ŋ yaah-cookmi. Ali ɓo' minanɗi ɓa kind. ” »<verse eid="GEN 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />Yaŋhooɓa neeh ndaam, a nihsiɗta taambɗoh ce Esaaw ŋ raak-raakaŋ ɗe ne a eɗ ɗe ; <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />ca nikka pe' teemet-kanak (200) na suket ndaŋkiyaah-kanak (20), na mbaal riɓ teemet-kanak (200) na kuy ndaŋkiyaah-kanak (20), <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />na ngeelemb ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30) ɓapɗoh na buul caŋ ca, na inoh riɓ ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40) na naar ndaŋkiyaah na mbaam riɓ ndaŋkiyaah-kanak (20) na mbaam naar ndaŋkiyaah. <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Gat nu nga ɗah, a eɗtaa ñaam. A woosa ɓa ne : « Adgiɗohaat, ɗu kaɗ te ɗu usoh, ŋ taambee nga ɗu. »<verse eid="GEN 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />A woosa ñaama adug ne : « Fu coh na taambɗoh ho Esaaw ɗah, a meekis ɗa ne : “ Ya ɓa kilifaaniŋ ɗa ? Fu na kee nde ? Ya ɓa raak gati fu ɓay wii ? ” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Woyaa ɗe ne : “ A ñaamiŋ ɗa Yaŋhooɓa na ɗaasnukohee ɗa wa, te a yii hay ŋ finho ɓoo. ” » <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />A nammba woo ya kanakɗoh ɗaa, na ya kaahayɗoh, na ɓa ñaakee ŋ gat ca jen. A dennga ɓa ne : « Ɗu coh na Esaaw ɗah, woyaat ɗe ineem, <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />te kanaat alkoh ɓaat nga ne ñaamiŋ ɗe Yaŋhooɓa yii hay ŋ finhooɗu. » Yaŋhooɓa woosa ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne : « Mi na hee ɗe giifɗe na in ci ŋ on ɗe ; ƴut, ŋ coh na ɗe ɗah, ŋ liiɓiɗ ne a hey yo teyɗuke moɗoɗ. » <verse eid="GEN 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Gat ca onohu cootta, waaye a yi Yaŋhooɓa, a neehha ɗiska.<verse eid="GEN 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lebraŋ Yaŋhooɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Na weka, Yaŋhooɓa ɓayya ɓitiɓ caŋ ɗe kanak ca, na ɓaŋ ɗe ñaam ca kanak ca na kuɓuucaŋ ɗe ndaŋkiyaah na yinooca (11), a huusiɗta ɓa kalaŋ Yabbok. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />A koc ɓa ƴakaandkiɗ, po ƴutta a degga raak-raakaŋ ɗe nga.<verse eid="GEN 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />A tassa ŋ ɗiska kiik ce ; a nikka nga po ƴaar pulla nga ɗe, ɓa neehha leber po ŋ wiisaaɗiina. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Wa ƴaara kaɗ po, a inahha ne a miniɗɗi Yaŋhooɓa in ŋ lebera, a laɓpa ɗe ŋ rangaƴ ; rangƴiŋ Yaŋhooɓa mukuƴca. <verse eid="GEN 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Ƴaara woosa ɗe ne : « Faɗ to ŋ coot bala nohi pulan ɗah. » Waaye Yaŋhooɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ heyɗi ɗa faɗe fu coot ne fu barke'iɗɗi so ɗah. »<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Ƴaara meekissa ɗe ne : « Fu teeku na ? » A woosa ne : « Ŋ teeku Yaŋhooɓa. » <verse eid="GEN 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Ƴaara woyissa ɗe ne : « Fu teekissuuɗi Yaŋhooɓa. Tiikiŋ ɗa kotii wa Israayel, laam fu hiñohiɗ na Kooh, fu hiñohha na ɓo' te ya fu min. » <verse eid="GEN 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Yaŋhooɓa nammba ɗe meekis : « Fu miniɗ to woo findi fu teeku e ? » A woosa ne : « Wee tah fu meeksee so tiikiŋ ngo ? » Ŋ ineem, a barke'iɗta Yaŋhooɓa.<verse eid="GEN 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Yaŋhooɓa teekka ɗiska Peni'eel (fikiiriŋ Kooh) laam, a woo ne : « Ŋ hotiɗ Kooh jahran te ŋ ris pes. » <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Wa noha pul, raak Yaŋhooɓa kurkohiɗ Peni'eel, a yiiɓeeɗa sagu rangƴiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 32:33" />Ineem weɗ tah po woti, raakiɗ ɓaki nik ŋ rangaƴ Israayel ci na ñameeɗi wa, laam, Yaŋhooɓa laɓsee nga.<verse eid="GEN 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Cohaŋ Esaaw na Yaŋhooɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa puloh Peni'eel, ɗekka po a hotta Esaaw hayeeɗa na ƴaar teemet-nikiis (400). A paysohha komaakca ŋ harmban Leya na Rasel na <char style="w">ñaam</char> ca kanak ca. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />A adgiɗ ñaam ca kanak ca na kuɓuuca a raak na ɓa, a degga Leya nga na ɓaŋ ɗe, a mirndohiɗta Rasel na Yuusufa. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Ƴutta, a hannda adug ŋ fikiira a kaɗeeɗa, a ƴekɗeeɗa taambɗoh ce Esaaw poo a raakka waas yasna-kanak bala a reyan nga ɗe ɗah. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Esaaw nuppa, a kaɗta coha na ɗe. Wa a ree, a morgiɗukka ɗe, ɓa ambsukohha kanak, ɓa fuɗeeɗa.<verse eid="GEN 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Wa Esaaw hot ɓitiɓ ca na komaakca, a meekissa Yaŋhooɓa ne : « Ɓooɓi fu hun na ɓa ɓii, ɓa ye nga ɗa ? » Yaŋhooɓa loffa ɗe ne : « E kuɓuuci Kooh baahoh ho, kilifaani. » <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Ñaam ca na kuɓuucaŋ ɓa reɓpa, ɓa ƴekiɗta Esaaw. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Leya na ɓaŋ ɗe nammba reɓ, ɓa tummba ɗaa. Ƴutta, Yuusufa na Rasel nammba tum ɗaa.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Esaaw meekissa ɗe ne : « An wa ye tah ɗa woosoh gat ci ŋ coh na ca jen ? » Yaŋhooɓa loffa ɗe an : « Ne fu teyɗuk ko moɗoɗ kilifaani. » <verse eid="GEN 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Esaaw woosa ɗe ne : « Ƴaariŋ ngo, ŋ raakiɗ po ŋ doyɗiɗ, fu miniɗ amb ini fu raak. » <verse eid="GEN 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yaŋhooɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Muk ŋ kiim ɗa wa kiim ne fu ambɗisɗi so aay-keeñ ɗah, teya in ci ŋ on ɗa ; laam wi ŋ coh na ɗa fu teyɗukiɗ to moɗoɗ po haa ŋ coh na Kooh jahran. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Mbaa teya in ci ŋ on ɗa, laam Kooh oniɗ to po ŋ raakiɗ lool. » Yaŋhooɓa ñaakiɗta ɗe na ca po Esaaw mirndohha ca ɓay.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Esaaw woosa ɗe ne : « Haya ɓoo kaɗ, ŋ ɓend ɗa. » <verse eid="GEN 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Yaŋhooɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, fu inhiɗ ne komaakci ndengɗi te ŋ waaɗ seeskiɗ ɗoopaat ci na ɓapɗe ɗah, noh yino dong ca kaan jen. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Kon kilifaani, fu na hee so hey adge, ŋ hun na komaakci na gat ci, ŋ taambee nga ɗa ƴin-ƴin po mbaɗna ŋ raakan ɗa ŋ Seyiir. »<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Esaaw woosa ɗe ne : « Mbaa, faɗa ŋ haawsiɗ ɗa ngaŋ ɓooɓiŋ ngo. » Yaŋhooɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Wa carɗaa, ŋ waaɗee rek ne fu teyɗuk ko moɗoɗ. »<verse eid="GEN 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Mbaɗi, Esaaw kooɗissa waas, a gurdeeɗa Seyiir, <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />waaye Yaŋhooɓa yurahha kur ka na woyse Sukkoot. A haɓiɗta kahan nga, a nammba ɗiipiɗ ɗoopaat caŋ ɗe nga ; weɗ tah ɗiska teekuusa Sukkoot (ɗiip).<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Yaŋhooɓa reyiɗ Kanaan moɗoɗ kotii ŋ pulohaŋ ɗe Paddan-Aram, a yipee ŋ fiki kur ka na woyse Sisem. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />A romohee yohna a yipohee <char style="w">ɗiip</char> caŋ ɗe ngaŋ kuɓuucaŋ Hamor, baabiŋ Sisem. Candoomaŋ wa nikee <char style="w">ƴel haalis</char> teemet (100). <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />A haɓiɗta <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkoha</char> nga ; a teekkaa El-Elohe-Israayel (Koohiŋ Israayel a yi Kooh).<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Taambɗoh caŋ Dinaa wirndukɗiɗ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Wa raakka mbeh, Dinaa, kuɓka cafƴa Yaŋhooɓa raakee na Leya, kaɗta marka ɓitiɓ caŋ kur ka, <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />raak Hamor, ya ɓaah ŋ cuuɓaŋ Hiw ca a yi adgohee wa ; a raakeen kuɓu ƴaar teeku Sisem. Sisem yeem hotta Dinaa, a ammba ɗe, a siiffa ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />A waaɗta ɗe po a jeemeeɗa ɗe nook ŋ haf ce ne yeem waaɗ ɗe ; <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />a woosa baab ɓa Hamor ne : « Baab, ɓayiɗ to cafƴii ɓitiɓ. »<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa kerah ne Sisem yahiɗ kuɓkaŋ ɗe Dinaa, a wooɗi in nga laam wa raak kuɓuucaŋ ɗe ƴaar ca ŋ yohon ca na gat ca ; a sek sek po ɓa hayya.<verse eid="GEN 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Ŋ neeh ceem, Hamor, baab ɓi Sisem kaɗta ŋ Yaŋhooɓa ne a woo na ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Wa hennda kuɓuucaŋ Yaŋhooɓa pulohha yohon ca, ɓa kerahha ina raak, wa mannda na ɓaseeh nga ɓa. Wa ayrukiɗta ɓa lool laam Sisem haɓiɗ in moɗaaɗi'iɗ ; faanka a faanuk kuɓkaŋ Yaŋhooɓa, ini joyɗi tumu ŋ Israayel. <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Hamor woosa ɓa ne : « Sisem, kuɓkiŋ ngo waaɗiɗ Dinaa lool ; mi yii kiim ɗu ne ɗu on ɗe ɗe ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Te, ɓoo kilooktiɗohaat, ɗu ɓayee ɓitiɓ ŋ kuɓuuciŋ ɓoo, ɓoo namee kilook ŋ cafaƴ ciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Kur ki weɗi wii, genaat na ɓoo, ɗu toontukee nga, ɗu waak merhey nga. »<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Sisem nammba woo Yaŋhooɓa na taambɗoh caŋ Dinaa ne : « Ɗu teyɗukiɗ to ɗah, in nu ɗu meekis so ɗah, ŋ hey ɗu wa eɗe. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Meeksaat to <char style="w">cakiim</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">cakiim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ini ƴaar na koce eɗoh ne a kiimee ɓitiɓ ɗah.</char></note> ɓitiɗ, ŋ hey wa eɗohe. Meeksaat to in laayiɗ, ŋ hey ɗu wa one ; teyɗukaat to on kuɓkiŋ ɗu ɓitiɓ rek. »<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Sagu yahi taambɗoh ɓa Dinaa yahu, kuɓuuciŋ Yaŋhooɓa ñaañohha Sisem na Hamor, yi baabiŋ ɗe ; <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />ɓa woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓoo minɗi on taambɗoh ɓoo ƴaari <char style="w" lemma="nguɗuk">nguɗukɗi</char> laam ineem, mand na ɓaseeh nga ɓoo. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Ɓoo min ɗu teyɗukiɗ ŋ in yino, weɗ ne ƴaar ciŋ kur ki jen nguɗuk findi ɓoo. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Ŋ ineem ɗu hey mine ɓay ɓitiɓ ŋ cafaƴ ciŋ ɓoo, ɓoo min ɓay ngaŋ ɓiŋ ɗu ; ɓoo gen na ɗu, ɓoo nik yino. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Waaye ɗu hunɗi ŋ ineem ɗah, ɓoo hey ɓaye taambɗoh ɓoo te ɓoo coot na ɗe. »<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Weɗ Hamor na kuɓkiŋ ɗe teyɗukoh ineem. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />A yi Sisem, a arra tum ina a woyu sagu waaɗa a waaɗee kuɓkaŋ Yaŋhooɓa. A nikee ɓoya uupee kerhiɗu ŋ kahan baab ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Hamor na Sisem kaɗta ŋ teembohaara, ŋ <char style="w" lemma="aasoha kur">aasohaanaŋ kur ka</char>, ɓa woosa ɓooɓaŋ ɓa ne : <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />« Ɓooɓii deey, ɓa raakiɗ jam na ɓoo, ɓoo faɗaat ɓa, ɓa gen ŋ kur ki laam wa angiɗ ; ɓa toontukee nga, ɓoo minee ɓay ɓitiɓ ŋ kuɓuuciŋ ɓa, ɓa namee ɓay ɓitiɓ ŋ ɓiŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Ɓa hey teyɗuke gen na ɓoo, ɓoo nik yino, waaye, bala ineem minan nik ɗah, ƴaar ciŋ kur ki jen hey nguɗke findiiɓa. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Ɓoo teyɗukaat tum ini ɓa woo, ɓa min gen na ɓoo. Wa nik ɗah, gat ciŋ ɓa na raak-raakiŋ ɓa jen jaaran nik cuu ɓoo. » <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Ƴaar ca nikee ŋ aasohaanaŋ kur ka jen, kerhiɗta Hamor na kuɓkiŋ ɗe Sisem, ɓa nguɗukka.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Wa ɓa nguɗuk po wa degga neeh kanak, miskiɗa nikka na ƴaar ca, kanak ŋ kuɓuucaŋ Yaŋhooɓa, Simeyong na Lewi, taambɗoh caŋ Dinaa, ɓayya ndang caŋ ɓa ; ɓa aassa kur ka moɗoɗ, ɓa appa ɓa jen. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Ɓa apndohha Hamor na Sisem, ɓa naaffa Dinaa, ɓa cootta na ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Weɗi kuɓuucaŋ Yaŋhooɓa ɓinooɓa rokoh in ca nikee ŋ fiɗaaf ca, ɓa ɓayya ina nikee raak-raak ŋ kur ka jen sagu njoofa taambɗoh ɓa Dinaa ɓeku. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Ɓa ɓayya ɗoopaat caŋ ɓa na in ca nikee ŋ ɗooƴ kur ka na yohon ca jen. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Ɓa ɓayndohha raak-raakaŋ ɓa jen na komaakca ƴin ca na ɓitiɓ ca, ɓa faɗɗi ali in ŋ kahan ca.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Wa ɓa puloh ndeem, Yaŋhooɓa woosa Simeyong na Lewi ne : « Ɗu deey, ɗu tefɗiɗ to ro', ɗu tahiɗ po ɓi Kanaan na ɓi Peris, ɓi gen kur cii, hey yo sange. Ɓa hey ambsukohe, ɓa keen ndo, ɓa apndoh ho na ɓi kahan ndo, laam ɓooɓiŋ ngo laayɗi. » <verse eid="GEN 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ƴaari joyiɗ tum taambɗoh ɓoo findi toonkoh e ? »<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Yaŋhooɓa ŋ Betel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Wa raakka mbeh, Kooh woosa Yaŋhooɓa ne : « Kaɗa Betel, te fu nik nga ; haɓɗa <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkoha</char> nga wuu so, mi yi Koohi teeɓkee ɗa nga, wa fu nupee taambɗoh fu Esaaw. » <verse eid="GEN 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Yaŋhooɓa woosa ɓi kahan ce na ɓooɓa hunee na ɗe jen ne : « Saɓsukohaat na kooh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kooh ci </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: marka saar 31, aaya 19.</char></note> ciŋ jaambur ci, ci nik na ɗu, ɓoktukaat te ɗu ɓekuk kulɓa wiiriis, <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />ɓoo kaɗ Betel, ŋ haɓɗiɗa Kooh seeƴkoha nga. A yi hirpee so wa ŋ feyu te a ɓaatɗohha so ŋ ɗisik ci ŋ taamb jen. » <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Ɓa ɓayya kooh ca nikee na ɓa jen, na long-long ca ɓa ɓekkee ŋ nof caŋ ɓa, ɓa eɗta Yaŋhooɓa ca ; a acca ca ŋ tasaŋ kidga yakka nik ŋ sero Sisem. <verse eid="GEN 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Ƴutta, ɓa cooteeɗa. Kooh tummba, ɓooɓaŋ kur ca wilee ɓa neƴƴohha po, ɓa kaañɗi taambiɗ kuɓuucaŋ Yaŋhooɓa. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Yaŋhooɓa na ɓooɓa hunee na ɗe kaɗta po ɓa reesa Luus, weɗ Betel, ŋ kur kaŋ Kanaan poyi. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />A haɓiɗta seeƴkoha nga, a teekka ɗiska El-Betel (Koohiŋ Betel) laam, Kooh teeɓkohee ɗe ndaam wa a nupee taambɗoh ce.<verse eid="GEN 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Ɓitfa meeɗee ɓapiɗ Rebeka na woyse Debora hunee na ɓa. A yaa kaanohha ndaam. Ɓa acca ɗe ŋ tasaŋ kidga yakka nik ŋ sero Betel ; ɓa teekkaa Kidgiŋ-Fuɗ-ci.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Ŋ pulohaŋ Yaŋhooɓa Paddan-Aram po a reesa Betel, Kooh teeɓkissa ɗe nga, a barke'iɗta ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />A woosa ɗe ne : « Tiikiŋ ɗa wa Yaŋhooɓa, waaye fu ɓeeɗkissassanɗi Yaŋhooɓa, fu teeku Israayel kotii. » Kooh teekka ɗe Israayel. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />A woyissa ɗe ne : « Ñam Koohi Min. Rimaatɗoha, fu ɓaatuk laam cuuɓ angiɗ na heet laayiɗ hey pulohe nga ɗa ; ɓi buur sah hey raake nga. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Kur ki ŋ onee Ibrahiima, ŋ onndaa Isaahha, ŋ hey ɗa wa one, ŋ ona ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa. » <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Wa a woo po ƴutta, Kooh faɗta Yaŋhooɓa ŋ ndaam, a cootta ɗafka. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Yaŋhooɓa ɓayya atoh, a yippaa ŋ ɗiska. A seeƴkohhaa anaah, a yiiffa diwliin ŋ ɗafuk wa. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />A teekka ɗiska Kooh woyohee na ɗe Betel (kahan Kooh).<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Raakuukaŋ Benyaamin na kakaan kaŋ Rasel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa na ɓooɓa hunee na ɗe puloh Betel, ɓa kaɗ kaɗ po ɓa tassa ree Efraata, raak Rasel nikee rook, a miskasseeɗa ; raakaŋ ɗe kuɓu misikka lool. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Ŋ ɗooƴ miskiɗeem, dooñoha nikee na ɗe woosa ɗe ne : « Kana neƴƴoh, fu raakis kuɓu ƴaar. » <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Waam raak Rasel kaaneeɗa, bala a nguɗan ɗah, a teekka kuɓka Benooni (kuɓkiŋ miskiɗiŋ ngo). Waaye baab ɓa teekka ɗe Benyaamin (kuɓkiŋ yaah-ñaahmi). <verse eid="GEN 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Rasel kurukka nga, a acuusa ŋ waas Efraata, weɗ Betlehem. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yaŋhooɓa yippa atoh inhisoha ŋ ruy-ruyaŋ ɗe ; atoh faam wa ɗaa nga po ɗiski maa woyohe na ɗu ndii.<verse eid="GEN 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Wa Israayel (yi Yaŋhooɓa) puloh ndaam, a kaɗta, a yippa <char style="w">ɗiip</char> caŋ ɗe ŋ finho Migdal-Eder. <verse eid="GEN 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Ŋ nikaŋ Israayel ndaam, Ruben faanukka na Bilha <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaama</char> baab ɓa ɓayee ɓitiɓ ; Israayel yeggaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yaŋhooɓa raakeen kuɓu ƴaar ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12). <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Ɓi a raakee na Leya nikee Ruben saawiŋ ɗe, na Simeyong, na Lewi na Yudaa na Issaakar na Sabuloon. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Ɓi a raakee na Rasel nikka Yuusufa na Benyaamin. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Ɓi a raakee na Bilha, ñaamaŋ Rasel nikee Daan na Naftaali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Ɓi a raakee na Silpa, ñaamaŋ Leya nikee Gaad na Aser. Ɓeem, ɓeɗ kuɓuuci ƴaar ci Yaŋhooɓa raakoh Paddan-Aram.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakaan kaŋ Isaahha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Wa raakka mbeh, Yaŋhooɓa dokukka ɗiskaŋ baab ɓa Isaahha ŋ Mamre ŋ sero Kiriyat-Arba wa na woyse Hebron kotii. Ibrahiima nameen gen nga. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Isaahha kaan wa a raak kiis teemet na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kaahay (180). <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />A kaan ŋ finho kipes hutiɗ, a haadda Jaanim. Kuɓuuciŋ ɗe Yaŋhooɓa na Esaaw uummba ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Ɓi rimkoh ŋ Esaaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Inii weɗ naandsuku ŋ Esaaw, yi teeku Edom, na ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esaaw ɓayeen ɓitiɓ ŋ cafaƴ caŋ Kanaan ; ɓeem ɓa nikee Aada na Ohlibaama. Aada nikee kuɓu Eloon ya ɓaahee ŋ cuuɓiŋ Hit ci. Ohlibaama nikee kuɓu Aana, Aana nikka kuɓu Sibeyon ya ɓaahee ŋ cuuɓiŋ Hiw ci. <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />Taambɗoh Nebayot, Baasmat yi kuɓu Ismaayla namee ɓaah ŋ ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Aada a yi rim Elifaas, Baasmat rimmba Rewyel, <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Ohlibaama rimmba Yewus na Yalaam na Koorah. Ɓii ɓeɗ kuɓuuci ƴaar ci Esaaw raakoh Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Wa raakka mbeh, Esaaw ɓayya ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɗe na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe, ƴaar na ɓitiɓ, na ɓooɓaŋ ɗe, a ɓayndohha ɗoopaat caŋ ɗe na in ca a raakoh Kanaan jen, a yongsukka kur wiiriis, a ussa taambɗoh ce Yaŋhooɓa. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Raak-raakaŋ ɓa laayee laay po ɓa haɓisseeɗi ŋ kur ka sagu ɗoopaat caŋ ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Esaaw yi teeku Edom, kaɗoh yipa ɗaa ŋ tangoocaŋ Seyiir.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Inii weɗ naandsuku ŋ Esaaw na ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe. A yi caaciŋ Edom ca genee ŋ tangoocaŋ Seyiir. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Tiik ciŋ kuɓuuciŋ Esaaw ƴaar ci ceɗi cii : Elifaas yi a raak na ɓitiice Aada, na Rewyel yi a raak na Baasmat.<verse eid="GEN 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Kuɓuuciŋ Elifaas ƴaar ci nikka Teemaan, Omaar, Sefoo, Gataam na Kenas. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Elifaas raakeen ɓitiɓ <char style="w">ñaam</char> na woyse Timna ; a raakeen na ɗe kuɓu teeku Amalek. Ɓeem ɓeɗ set ciŋ Aada, ɓiti Esaaw.<verse eid="GEN 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Kuɓuuciŋ Rewyel ƴaar ci nikee Nahat, Seerah, Samaa na Misaa. Ɓeem ɓeɗ set ciŋ Baasmat, ɓiti Esaaw.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Kuɓuuci ƴaar ciŋ ɓiti Esaaw yi na woyse Ohlibaama, kuɓkiŋ Aana yiŋ Sibeyon, ɓeɗ Yewus, Yalaam na Koorah.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Kilifaaciŋ ɓi rimkoh ŋ Esaaw ɓa ɗi ɓii : Ɓi rimkoh ŋ saawiŋ ɗe Elifaas nikee Teemaan, Omaar, Sefoo, Kenas, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Koorah, Gataam na Amalek ; ɓeem ɓeɗ nikee kilifa ŋ kur kaŋ Edom ɓi rimkoh ŋ Elifaas kuɓkiŋ Aada. <verse eid="GEN 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Ɓi rimkoh ŋ Rewyel, kuɓu Esaaw, nikee Nahat, Seerah, Samaa na Misaa ; ɓeem ɓeɗ nikee kilifa ŋ kur kaŋ Edom ɓi rimkoh ŋ Rewyel kuɓu Baasmat, ɓiti Esaaw. <verse eid="GEN 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Ɓi rimkoh ŋ Ohlibaama nikee Yewus, Yalaam na Koorah ; ɓeem ɓeɗ kilifaaca rimkoh ŋ kuɓkiŋ Aana, Ohlibaama yi ɓiti Esaaw. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Ɓeem ɓeɗ rimkoh ŋ Esaaw, ɓa nikka kilifa ŋ Edom.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi rimkoh ŋ Seyiir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20-21" />Ɓii ɓeɗ rimkoh ŋ Seyiir yi ɓaah ŋ cuuɓaŋ Hoor ca te ɓi Edom raakka ɓa geniɗ nga : Lootaan, Sobaal, Sibeyon, Aana, Disoon, Eeser na Disaan. Ɓeem ɓeɗ nikee ɓi rimkoh ŋ Seyiir, kilifaacaŋ cuuɓaŋ Hoor ca genee ngaŋ kur kaŋ Edom.<verse eid="GEN 36:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Kuɓuuciŋ Lootaan ƴaar ci nikka Hoori na Hemaam ; taambɗoh ce ɓitiɓ teeksee Timna.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Kuɓuuciŋ Sobaal ƴaar ci nikka Alwaan, Manahat, Eebal, Sefoo na Onaam.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Kuɓuuciŋ Sibeyon ƴaar ci nikee Ayaa na Aana. Aana yeem a yi koc hot masma dohɗa balɗee ŋ kehƴi ngaŋ bilaf fa, waam raak ɗe niiɗee mbaam caŋ baab ɓa Sibeyon.<verse eid="GEN 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Kuɓuuciŋ Aana nikee Disoon na taambɗoh ce ɓitiɓ Ohlibaama.<verse eid="GEN 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Kuɓuuci ƴaar ciŋ Disoon nikee Hemdaan, Esbaan, Yitraan na Keraan.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Kuɓuuci ƴaar ciŋ Eeser nikka Bilhaan, Sawaan na Akaan.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Ɓiŋ Disaan nikka Uus na Araan.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29-30" />Kon, ɓii ɓeɗ nikee kilifaacaŋ cuuɓaŋ Hoor ca ŋ kur kaŋ Seyiir : Lootaan, Sobaal, Sibeyon, Aana, Disoon, Eeser na Disaan.<verse eid="GEN 36:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buur ca nikee ŋ Edom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Bala buur raakan ŋ Israayel ɗah, ɓii ɓeɗ nikee buur caŋ kur kaŋ Edom :<verse eid="GEN 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Bela kuɓu Beyoor, a yi nikee ŋ Dinaaba.<verse eid="GEN 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Wa Bela kaan, Yoobaab kuɓu Seerah, ya nikee ŋ Bosra a yi namsiɗ ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 36:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Wa Yoobaab kaan, Husaam ya ŋ kur kaŋ Teemaan-Teemaan ca, a yi namsiɗ ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Wa Husaam kaan, Hadad, ya nikee ŋ Awit, kuɓu Bedad, namsiɗta ɗe ; a yi laɓee Majaan-Majaan ca ŋ kur kaŋ Mowab.<verse eid="GEN 36:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Wa Hadad kaan, Samla ya ŋ Masreeka namsiɗta ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Wa Samla kaan, Sawul ya ŋ Rehobot-Hanahar namsiɗta ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 36:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Wa Sawul kaan, Ba'al-Hanan kuɓkiŋ Akboor namsiɗta ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 36:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Wa Ba'al-Hanan kuɓkiŋ Akboor kaan, Hadar ya ŋ Pawu namsiɗta ɗe. Ɓitiice teeksee Mehtabeel kuɓu Matareed yi kuɓkiŋ Mesaahab.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40-43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40-43" />Ɓii ɓeɗ nikee kilifaacaŋ cuuɓiŋ Edom ci puloh ŋ Esaaw, yaa nu nga ɗah, na kur kaŋ ɗa : Timna, Alwaah, Yetet, Ohlibaama, Eela, Pinoon, Kenas, Teemaan, Mibsaar, Magdiyel na Iraam.<verse eid="GEN 36:40-43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Heeƴ ciŋ Yuusufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yaŋhooɓa, a nikee ŋ Kanaan ŋ kur ka baab ɓa genohaahe. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Inii weɗ naandsuku ŋ Yaŋhooɓa na kahan ce. Wa kuɓkiŋ ɗe Yuusufa raak kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis yasna-kanak (17), a meeɗee hun na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe, ɓa niiɗee mbaal ca na pe' caŋ baab ɓa. A nikee komaaki, a meeɗta hun na kuɓuuciŋ Bilha na ɓiŋ Silpa, ɓitiɓ ciŋ baab ɓa. Taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe tummba in moɗaaɗi ɗah, a woo baab ɓa wa. <verse eid="GEN 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Israayel raakee ɗe ŋ kiyaɓkookaŋ ɗe, tahha po a yi a uupee waaɗ ŋ kuɓuuciŋ ɗe jen. A haɓɗiɗta ɗe kulɓa moɗoh na moɗoh. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe hotta ne baab ɓa uupee ɗe waaɗ, weɗi tahee ɓa sang ɗe po, ɓa mineeɗi woo na ɗe sah, woo moɗoɗ.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Wa kaɗeeɗa po, Yuusufa heeƴca, a naandsukka taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe wa, ɓa uuppa ɗe nga sang. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />A woo ɓa ne : « Sikɗukaat ini ŋ heeƴ. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />An ɓoo nikee ŋ yohon ca, ɓoo tokeeɗa bele, ɗekka po ɗufiŋ ngo tufukka, ciŋ ɗu willaa, ca ƴekɗeeɗaa. » <verse eid="GEN 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe woosa ɗe ne : « Fu waaɗ woo ne a fu na hee nike buuriŋ ɓoo e ? Fu yilif ɓoo e ? » Tahha po ɓa uuppa ɗe sang, sagu heeƴ caŋ ɗe na in ca a woyee nga.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Wa Yuusufa heeƴis, a naandsukissaa taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe an : « Hee ! Ŋ heeƴissiɗ nohi na caɓni na hor ndaŋkiyaah na yino ƴekɗeeɗa so. » <verse eid="GEN 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />A nammbaa naandsuk baab ɓa, yeem ngassa ɗe an : « Fu heeƴ ye weem ? Fu liiɓiɗ ne mi na yaay ɗu na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa, ɓoo hey ɗa ƴekɗe e ? » <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Taambɗoh ciŋ Yuusufa ayrukka ɗe, Yaŋhooɓa ɗaakohha heeƴ ceem nof.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taambɗoh ciŋ Yuusufa tooniɗ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Wa raakeen jamano, taambɗoh ciŋ Yuusufa kaɗta mangaana na gataŋ baab ɓa ŋ ɓak kur ka na woyse Sisem. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13-14" />Mbeh, Israayel woosa kuɓkiŋ ɗe Yuusufa ne : « Haya ŋ woos ɗa, fu marka taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa ŋ Sisem, ndah ɓa ɗaa ŋ jam na ɗoopaat ca. In nu raak nga ɗah, fu woo so. » Yuusufa woosa ɗe ne : « Ee. » A tuuƴca Yuusufa, yeem pulohha Oonaŋ-Hebron, a rappa ŋ ɓak Sisem. <verse eid="GEN 37:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Ƴaar cohha na ɗe wiltiɗoheeɗa ŋ bilaf fa, a meekissa ɗe ne : « Fu na waake ye ? » <verse eid="GEN 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Yuusufa woosa ɗe ne : « Mi na marke taambɗoh ciŋ ngo, fu miniɗ to woo ɗiski ɓa na niiɗohe e ? » <verse eid="GEN 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Ƴaara loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓa kurkiɗ ndii, ŋ kerhiɗ ɓa woyeeɗa ne ɓaa kee Dotan. » Yuusufa kaɗta ɓa raaka ŋ Dotan.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Wa taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ƴok ɗe hayeeɗa, bala a reyan nga ɓa ɗah, ɓa waakohha ɗe ap. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Ɓa woytiɗohha ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Heɗ heeƴ ci a yoon na haye. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Ɓoo apaat ɗe, ɓoo ɓek ɗe ŋ ngurtut. Hey ɗah, ɓoo woo ne a ɗoopaat saahiɗ ap ɗe ; ɓoo marak findi heeƴ ciŋ ɗe na hee mirndohe. »<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Wa Ruben kerah ineem, a waaɗta muciɗ Yuusufa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓoo kanaat ɗe ap. » <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />A degga nga ne : « Kanaat aam ñif, ɓekaat ɗe ŋ ngurtuta ŋ bilaf fa ween, yaah ciŋ ɓoo degkuu ɗe. » A woosa ɓa ineem ne a min ɗe muciɗ po a wik ɗe baab ɓa.<verse eid="GEN 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Wa Yuusufa ree, ɓa ammba ɗe, ɓa wolissa kulɓaakaŋ ɗe moɗohngaana, <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />ɓa njaffa ɗe ŋ ɗooƴ ngurtuta. <verse eid="GEN 37:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Ƴutta ɓa ɓooffa ne ɓa ñam. Ɗekka po ɓa hotta Ismaayla-Ismaaylaaca huniɗ, pulohiɗ Galaad na ngeelemb caŋ ɓa sifiɗ ɓi toon findi cuuraay, daakaande na diw faan, ɓa kaɗeeɗa <char style="w">Misra</char>. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Yudaa woosa taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ne : « Wa raakiɗ ɓoo winde etoh, ɓoo ap taambɗoh ɓoo po ƴut, ɓoo ɗasɗohee wa ? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Ismaayla-Ismaaylaaca ɓeɗɗeen na haye, ɓoo toonaat ɓa ɗe, ɓoo apuu ɗe laam, e ɓoo ɓaah ñif, a taambɗoh ɓoo. » Ɓa hunnda nga.<verse eid="GEN 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Wa toonoh ca ree, tel ɓa puloh kur ka na woyse Majaan, ɓa puliɗta Yuusufa ŋ ngurtuta, ɓa toonohha ɓa ɗe <char style="w">ƴel haalis</char> ndaŋkiyaah-kanak (20) ; Ismaayla-Ismaaylaaca cootta na ɗe Misra.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Wa Ruben wiiruk ngurtuta, a hotta ne Yuusufa nikisɗi nga, keeñaŋ ɗe reehha, a faarra kulɓaacaŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />A kaɗta ŋ taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɓa ne : « Cooy, Yuusufa nikisɗi ndaam ! Ŋ tuman na ? » <verse eid="GEN 37:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Ɓa hoossa suket, ɓa tahha'iɗta kulɓaakaŋ Yuusufa na ñif ma. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Ƴutta ɓa kommba baab ɓa wa, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Inii, ɓoo paraha parah, wa kulɓaakiŋ kuɓkiŋ ɗa haa e ? » <verse eid="GEN 37:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Yaŋhooɓa inhissaa, a woosa ne : « Marka ! A ɗoopaat saahiɗ sifiñsoh ɗe, cooy, Yuusufa sifiñsohuuɗ ! »<verse eid="GEN 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa inhis kulɓaaka, weɗi a faaroh kulɓaacaŋ ɗe, a ɓekukka daah, a ruyiɗta kuɓkiŋ ɗe neeh laayiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Kuɓuuciŋ ɗe jen, ƴaar na ɓitiɓ giifɗeeɗa ɗe, waaye a sannga, a woosa ne : « Ŋ nikan ŋ ruy po mbaɗna maa hee ɗe raake ŋ Jaanim. » A taalndiɗta, a fuɗeeɗa kuɓkiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Majaan-Majaan ca ɓayee Yuusufa Misra, ɓa toon ɗe Potifaar, ƴaara adgohee dag caŋ <char style="w" lemma="Firawna">Firawnaana</char>.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Yudaa na Tamaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Ŋ jamanoonaam, Yudaa faɗta taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe, a kaɗta nika na Hiraa, ya gen kur ka na woyse Adulaam. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />A hotta cafaƴ nga, kuɓu Suwa ya genee Kanaan, a ɓayya ɗe ɓitiɓ, a hunnda na ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Yeem ammba rook, a raakka kuɓu ƴaar, Yudaa teekka ɗe Eer. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Ɓitɓa ambissa rook, a raakissa kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Onaan. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />A raakissa kuɓu ƴaar, a teekka ɗe Seela. Wa Seela na raakse, raak Yudaa ŋ Kesiib.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Wa saawiŋ ɗe Eer kaɗ po reesa ɗaak ɓitiɓ, Yudaa kilookiɗta ɗe cafƴa na woyse Tamaar ; <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Nikiɗi hotta ne Eer yi saawiŋ Yudaa yurahɗi, a appa ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Yudaa woosa Onaan taambɗoh Eer ne : « Fu inhiɗ ini fu joy haɓiɗ, lama ɓitɓii, fu waakiɗ yakak fu kuɓu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋ ina ɓa mbaahkohe, ƴaar kaan, raak ɗe raakɗi kuɓu na ɓitiice ɗah, e taambɗoh ce a yi na ɓaye ɓitɓi. Kuɓki ƴaari na koce rimu ŋ tuuƴeem, a na nike yiŋ ƴaari kaan ne a min lam raak-raak kiŋ ɗe.</char></note>. » <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Onaan inheen ne kuɓki a na hee raake na ɓiti taambɗoh ce, a nikanɗi yiŋ ɗe ; weɗ tah a hunnda na ɗe poo, a heesa keenɗe ɗah, a keeniɗ ŋ bilaf fi ne a sang raakiɗ taambɗoh ce kuɓu. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Nikiɗi neɓaaɗi'uusa ŋ ini Onaan na tume weem, a nammba ɗe ap. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Yudaa woosa payum ce Tamaar ne : « Haada kahan baab ɗu, fu muurka ƴaar fu nga. Fu ɓoof nga po Seela kuɓkiŋ ngo yak. » A neƴƴohee ne Seela nam kaan findi yakak ciŋ ɗe. Tamaar haadda kahan baab ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Wa tummba in maañiɗ, ɓiti Yudaa kaannda, kuɓkiŋ Suwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:12">Wa ruya coot Yudaa hunnda na nawleece Hiraa, ƴaaraŋ Adulaam ca, a kaɗta marka ɓooɓa nguɗɗee ɗe find caŋ mbaal caŋ ɗe ŋ Timnaa. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Tamaar woyuusa ne : « Payum fu yaa kaɗ hufɗuka find caŋ mbaal caŋ ɗe ŋ Timnaa. » <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />A inheen ne Seela yakiɗ, te a tokɗuuɗi ɗe, tahha po a ɓekukka kulɓa wiiriis kotii, a muurukka findi toonkoh, a kaɗta, a ɓooffa ŋ waas Timnaa ne fu aasee Enayim ɗah.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Wa Yudaa hot ɗe, a liiɓpa ne a toonkoh laam a muurkee muuruk. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />A reɓpa nga ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne a waaɗ hun na ɗe. Raak ɗe inhisɗi payum ce. Tamaar loffa ɗe ne : « Fu na hee so ye eɗe ŋ ineem ? » <verse eid="GEN 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />A woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ hey ɓaye koteng ŋ gataŋ ngo, ŋ woosoh ɗe nga ɗa. » A loffa ɗe ne : « Ee. Waaye fu na hee wa <char style="tl">tayle'ohe</char> ye ? » <verse eid="GEN 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Yudaa loffa ɗe ne : « Fu waaɗ ne ŋ <char style="tl">tayle'oha</char> ye ? » Tamaar woosa ɗe ne « Eɗ to jaarndi inhisohaaniŋ ɗa fu tokuk ŋ mbooh na ndooɗiŋ yaah fu. » Yudaa eɗta ɗe ca, a hunnda na ɗe, yeem taambohha nga, ammba rook. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />A haadda, a nihissa muura, a ɓekkissa kulɓaaca a muurkohe.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yudaa, a woos nawleece ƴaaraŋ Adulaam ca ne a kaɗ ɗe wikɗa koteng ka, a haytoh in ca <char style="tl">tayle'ohse</char>. Yeem reesa, a hotɗi ɓitɓa. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />A meekissa ɓooɓa genee Enayim ne : « A nde toonkohi na nike ŋ waasi ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Toonkoh moosɗi raakoh ndii. » <verse eid="GEN 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />A dokukka ŋ Yudaa, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ kaɗiɗ po nga, ŋ hotɗi ɗe te ɓi kur ka woo ne, toonkoh moosɗi raakoh ŋ ndaam. » <verse eid="GEN 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yudaa loffa ne : « A tasaat na in caam, ɓoo kanaat ƴenɗuk haf ɓoo, ŋ woosiɗ ɗa, fu kaɗiɗ na koteng ki po ndaam, fu hotɗi ɗe. »<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Wa deg caɓin kaahay, Yudaa woyuusa ne : « Payum fu Tamaar deey, a toonkee toonuk po, a waliɗ amb rook nga. » Yudaa woosa ne : « A pulɗassaat, a dohu kaanaaɗi. » <verse eid="GEN 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Wa Tamaar ɓayse, a woosohha ŋ payum ce Yudaa ne a markaat baahiɗ jaarndi inhisohaani hun na niyiŋ wa, na ndooɗi, andi a hey inhise ɓoyi raak ca ? Laam heɗ ca a yi rookiɗ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yudaa inhissa ca, a woosa ne : « A yi uup po nik ŋ keeh laam, ñam joyee ɗe on kuɓkiŋ ngo Seela, waaye ŋ tumɗaa. » Ŋ ineem a faankisɗi na ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Wa noha Tamaar joyee ɓasloh ree, wa nikka ne a hee siise. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />A ɓasleeɗa, yino ŋ siis ca puliɗta yaah, dooñoha ammbaa, a tokkaa ooy ruumind ; a woosa ne : « Yii, a yi adug raaku. » <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Waaye kuɓka dokinnda yaahaŋ ɗe, taambɗoh ce kocca ɗe pul. Dooñoha woosa ɗe ne : « Waaw, fu mbolit nde ? » Ɓa teekka ɗe Peeres (mbolit). <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Ƴutta, taambɗoh ce hannda raaku na ooya ruumnda ŋ yaahaŋ ɗe, ɓa teekka ɗe Seerah.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Yuusufa ŋ kahan Potifaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yuusufa, wa Ismaayla-Ismaaylaaca ree na Yuusufa <char style="w">Misra</char>, ɓa toon ɗe Potifaar ; a yi daga adgohee ƴaaɓa niiɗe kahan <char style="w" lemma="Firawna">Firawnaana</char>. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Nikiɗi huneen na Yuusufa te in nu a haɓɗeen ɗah, wa baah ; a nikka ŋ kahan kilifaanaŋ ɗe Potifaar. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Kilifaanaŋ ɗe hotta ne Nikiɗi huniɗ na Yuusufa te in nu a haɓiɗ ɗah, Nikiɗi baahiɗa. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Kilifaanaŋ ɗe baahohha ɗe, a degga ɗe ŋ serooce, Yuusufa adgohha kahan ce na raak-raakaŋ ɗe jen. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Wa Potifaar haɓiɗ ineem, Nikiɗi barke'iɗta kahan ce, in ca nikee nga na ca ŋ yohon caŋ ɗe jen, sagu Yuusufa. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Wa tahha po Potifaar faɗta in caŋ kahan ce jen ŋ yaah Yuusufa ; a taambkohisseeɗi ali in, nikɗi kañam kaŋ ɗe ɗah.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 39:6">Yuusufa na ɓiti Potifaar</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yuusufa nikee moɗoh fiir. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Kaɗta po, ɓiti kilifaanaŋ ɗe hememmba ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : « Haya fu faanuk na so ! » <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Yuusufa sannga, a woosa ɗe ne : « Fu hot nga, kilifaaniŋ ngo oolkiɗ to po a haɓɗisɗi tus ŋ kahni, a faɗiɗ in ciŋ ɗe jen ŋ yaah ciŋ ngo. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />A mi na ɗe hend ŋ kahni ; a sangiɗɗi so tus nikɗi fu ɗah, laam fu ɓitiice ; mbaa ŋ min na tumoh ini moɗaaɗiineem, ŋ tooñ Kooh ? » <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />A gennda gen ñaakiɗ Yuusufa na ineem, waaye tahɗi po a teyɗukka faanuk na ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Wa raakka mbeh, Yuusufa aassa ŋ kahna ne a panguk, raak surgaaca nikeeɗi ŋ ɗiska ; <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />ɓiti Potifaar ammba ɗe ŋ kulɓa, a woosa ɗe ne : « Haya ɓoo faanuk ! » Yuusufa nookukka, kulɓaaka tassa ŋ yaah caŋ ɗe ; Yuusufa saandohha ŋ hara. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Ɓitɓa inahha ne Yuusufa saandohiɗ te a faɗiɗ ɗe na kulɓaaka ŋ yaah caŋ ɗe, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />a ɓeeɗukka surgaaca, a woosa ɓa ne : « Markaat ! Ɓoo komu kuɓu Heber ne a ɓasɗuk ɓoo ; a hayiɗ nga so ne a faanuk na so waaye ŋ leehukka ŋ ɗafka. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Wi ŋ leehuk, a saandohha, a faɗta kulɓaakiŋ ɗe ndii. » <verse eid="GEN 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />A ɗaakka kulɓaakaŋ Yuusufa, a sekeeɗa hayiŋ ƴaar ce.<verse eid="GEN 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Wa ƴaar ce hay, a naandsukohha ɗe wa ɗaa, a woosa ɗe ne : « <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">Ñaami</char> Heberi fu ɓayiɗ ɓoo, a hayiɗ nga so ne a kelsukoh ho, <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />ŋ leehukka ŋ ɗafka, a saandohha, a faɗta kulɓaakiŋ ɗe ndii. » <verse eid="GEN 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Wa Potifaar kerah ina ɓitiice naandsuk ɗe ne weɗ Yuusufa haɓiɗ, a ayrukka. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />A ambɗukka Yuusufa ne a taƴ ɗe ŋ kasoona ɓi kahan Firawnaana na ɗaakohse. Yuusufa nikka nga.<verse eid="GEN 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuusufa ŋ kasoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Nikiɗi huneen na Yuusufa, a tummba po ƴaara adgohee kasoona baahohha ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Ƴaara faɗta ɓooɓa ambsee jen ŋ yaah Yuusufa, a adgohha pangkaŋ ɓa jen. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Ƴaara haɓɗisɗi ali in ŋ ina a nakee ɗe laam, a hoteen ne Nikiɗi huneen na Yuusufa te in nu a haɓiɗ ɗah, Nikiɗi baahiɗa.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Yuusufa toksiɗ heeƴ caŋ ƴaaɓa kanak ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Weɗ kaɗoh po wa raakka mbeh, dag kanak, toonnja buuraŋ <char style="w">Misra</char>. Ɓa nikee ƴaara adgohee ɓooɓa meeɗ taambkoh anaah caŋ ɗe, na ya adgohee utoh mbuuruuca. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />A ayrukka ɓa lool. <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />A ɗaakɗukka ɓa ŋ kasoonaŋ daga adgohee ƴaaɓa niiɗee kahan ce, ŋ ɗiska Yuusufa taƴu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Ƴaara degga ɓa ŋ yaah Yuusufa, a taambkoheeɗa ɓa. Ɓa nikka nga po, <verse eid="GEN 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />wa raakka wek, ɓa kanak, ɓa heeƴca ; heeƴ nu nga ɗah, raakka ini wa tokis.<verse eid="GEN 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Wa Kooh wiis na ɓaaɓa, Yuusufa kaɗta ɓa marka, a raakka ɓa feyuuɗ. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu soos ye an woti ? » <verse eid="GEN 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo heeƴ heeƴ yaa nu nga ɗah, te ɓoo raakɗi ɓoyi joy ɓoo ca toksiɗ ŋ ndii. » Yuusufa woosa ɓa ne : « Hanaa a Kooh na tokse heeƴ haa ? Naandsukaat to ca ŋ hot. »<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Weɗi ƴaara adgohee ɓooɓa meeɗ taambkoh anaah caŋ <char style="w" lemma="Firawna">Firawnaana</char> naandsukoh waŋ ɗe an : « Ŋ heeƴ tas kidig reseñ ŋ fikiiso, <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />wa raakka naak kaahay ; wa kifissa, wa possa, wa rimmba, ca ruunnda ŋ ɗiski ɗiski. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Raak ko na kaasiŋ Firawnaani ŋ yaah, ŋ ɓeennda ŋ rim ci, ŋ pooƴca masmiŋ ca ŋ kaasi, ŋ eɗta ɗe wa ŋ yaah. » <verse eid="GEN 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yuusufa woosa ɗe ne : « Heeƴi tokis inii : Naak ci kaahay ci, ca neeh kaahay. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Ndii na neeh kaahay, Firawnaani hey ɗa rapɗe po ɗiskaŋ ɗe, ƴut ɗa, a dokin ɗa ŋ pangkiŋ ɗa. Fu eɗissee ɗe kaasiŋ ɗe findi fu meeɗ tumoh. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Waaye, in ciŋ ɗa baah ɗah, kanaa so alkoh. Amboh ho, fu woo Firawnaani ini kaɗ nga so ne fu puliɗ to ŋ kasoonii. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Ŋ uupu hatil ŋ kur kaŋ Heber ca, ŋ ɓayuusa kur kii. Te ndii, ŋ namɗi tum ini joy yo tah taƴu. »<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Wa ƴaara adgohee utoh mbuuruuca hot ne toksaŋ Yuusufa na heeƴa neɓiɗ, a nammba woo ne : « Na so, ŋ heeƴiŋ ngo, ŋ raan waah kaahay tumiɗ mbuuru. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Wi nikee ŋ ɗafki riifee na mbuuru nu nik ne Firawnaani na haɓɗiɗasse wa ɗah, waaye sel ci ñameeɗa ca ŋ waahi, ŋ hafiŋ ngo. » <verse eid="GEN 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yuusufa woosa ɗe ne : « Heeƴi tokis inii : Waah ci kaahay ci, ca neeh kaahay. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Ndii na neeh kaahay, Firawnaani hey ɗa rapɗe po ɗiskaŋ ɗe, ƴut ɗah, a ap ɗa, a keɗ ɗa ŋ kidig, sel ci ñamee ɗa. »<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Wa degga neeh kaahay Firawnaana yakɗeeɗa noha a rimohu, a haɓɗiɗta dag caŋ ɗe kañam neɓiɗ. A rapiɗta ƴaaɓa kanak ca taƴsee ŋ kasoona po ŋ ɗiskaŋ ɗe, dag ca hoteeɗa nga. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />A dokinnda ya adgohee taambkohoh anaah ca ŋ ɗiska a nikee ne a eɗissee ɗe kaasiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />A appa ƴaara adgohee utoh mbuuruuca, a keɗta ɗe ŋ kidig ; wa taamboh ɗaa, ina Yuusufa woyee raakka. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Waaye ƴaara adgohee ɓooɓa meeɗ taambkoh anaah caŋ Firawnaana, alkohha Yuusufa jameet.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Yuusufa toksiɗ heeƴ ciŋ Firawnaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Wa degga kiis kanak, <char style="w" lemma="Firawna">Firawnaana</char>, buuraŋ <char style="w">Misra</char> heeƴca. Ŋ heeƴiŋ ɗe, an a nikee ŋ sero kala na woyse Niil. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />A hotta inoh moɗiɗ yasna-kanak, kapiɗ, pulohha nga, ca ñameeɗa ŋ paangfa ŋ sereenda. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />A hotissa ŋak moɗaaɗi'iɗ yasna-kanak nammba puloh ŋ kala, ca nikka na ca. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Ŋak ca ñammba inoh ca kapiɗ ca. Ndeem, Firawnaana yunukka. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />A neehissa, a heeƴissa mbong yasna-kanak moɗiɗ, ɓiɗsiɗ ŋ mbaang yino. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Furus yasna-kanak ca fu inah ne a mbooyooni oñiɗ ca, ɓiɗissa ŋ serooca ; <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />furus ca onnda mbong ca yasna-kanak ca moɗiɗ ca. Firawnaana yunukka, a inahha ne a heeƴ heeƴ.<verse eid="GEN 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Wa Kooh wiis na ɓaaɓa, Firawnaana feyuusa, a cohɗohha naah ca na riifiɗ haf caŋ Misra jen, a naandsukka ɓa heeƴ caŋ ɗe, waaye ali ɓo' nga ɓa minɗi ɗe ca toksiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Ƴaara adgohee ɓa meeɗ taambkoh anaah caŋ Firawnaana woosa ɗe ne : « Mi deey, ŋ hey naandsohe tooñiŋ ngo woti. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Firawna ayrukeen mi na ƴaara adgohee utoh mbuuruuci po a rannga ɓoo ŋ kasooniŋ dagi adgoh ɓi na niiɗe kahan ce. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Ɓoo heeƴandoosa, te heeƴ nu nga ɗah raakeen ini wa tokis. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Komaaki fiir Heber nikeen na ɓoo ŋ ɗooƴ kasoona, a <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> dagi adgoh ɓi na niiɗe kahan buur. Ɓoo naandsukka ɗe yaa nu nga ɗah ini fu heeƴ, a yi toksiɗ ɓoo ca mbaɗi. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Te findi a toksoh ca, ca raakoh ɗaa ; ŋ doknuusa ŋ pangkiŋ ngo, ƴaara tas keɗuusa ŋ kidig. »<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Firawnaana woosa ne ɓa kaɗaat ɓa haya na ɗe. Ɓa arra kaɗ ŋ kasoona, ɓa puliɗta ɗe, a nenukka, a ɓekukka kulɓa wiiriis, ɓa ɓayya ɗe ŋ Firawnaana. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Firawnaana woosa Yuusufa ne : « Ŋ heeƴ heeƴ, te ali ɓo' minɗi wa tokis, waaye ŋ kerah ne fu miniɗ tokis heeƴ nu fu naandsuku ɗah. » <verse eid="GEN 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yuusufa woosa ɗe ne : « A ñam haa, waaye a Kooh na hee eɗohe toksi na hee ɗa doye. »<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Firawnaana woosa Yuusufa ne : « Ŋ heeƴiŋ ngo, ŋ nikee ŋ sero Niil, <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />ŋ hotta inoh moɗiɗ yasna-kanak, kapiɗ, pulohha nga, ca ñameeɗa ŋ paangfa ŋ sereenda. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Ŋak yasna-kanak moɗaaɗi'oh na moɗaaɗi'oh nammba puloh nga, ŋ moosɗi hotoh mand ɗaa moɗaaɗi ŋ Misra. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20-21" />Ca ñammba inoh ca koc, ceɗ ca yasna-kanak ca kapiɗ ca nikka ŋ rook ciŋ ca. Te ɓo' minɗi wa hot nga ca sagu risa ca risee ŋak ; ndeem ŋ yunukka.<verse eid="GEN 41:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Ŋ heeƴissa mbong yasna-kanak moɗiɗ, ɓiɗissa ŋ mbaang yino. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Furus yasna-kanak moɗaaɗi, ca fu inah ne a mbooyooni oñiɗ ca, ɓiɗissa ŋ serooca. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Furus ca onnda mbong ca yasna-kanak ca. Ŋ naandsukiɗ ca naah ci waaye ali ɓo' nga ɓa minɗi so ca toksiɗ. »<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Yuusufa woosa Firawnaana ne : « Heeƴ ciŋ ɗa tokis in yino ; Kooh na teeɓee ɗa ini a na hee tume. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Inoh ci yasna-kanak ci kapiɗ ci ca kiis yasna-kanak findi mbong ci yasna-kanak ci ; kon wa heeƴ yino. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Ŋak ci yasna-kanak ci moɗaaɗiici, ca kiis yasna-kanak findi furus ci yasna-kanak ci mbooyooni oñiɗ ; ca nikan kiis aɗ yasna-kanak. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Weɗ ini ŋ woo ɗa rek Firawna, Kooh na teeɓee ɗa ini a na hee tume.<verse eid="GEN 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Kiis ci yasna-kanak ci na haye, ca na hee nike kiis laaɓɗuk ngaŋ Misra jen. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Kiis yasna-kanak hey taambe nga ca, ci fu inah ne ca na hee nike kiis aɗ, ca hey tahe po kiis ciŋ laaɓɗi alu te ca hey yahrohe kur ki. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Ca hey miske lool, po ɓooɓi alkoh ne kur ki laaɓɗeen. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Ini tah fu heeƴca ca waas kanak Firawna, weɗ ne Kooh tufkiɗ ne ca hey raake, te a hey ca raakɗe findi wa uup gaawoh.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />Ɗiski wa nik ndii Firawna, waaka ɓo' ñaañiɗ, heɗ liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ, yi fu na hee tufkiɗe, a adgoh kur ki. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Fu nam waak ɓi kilifa ɓi fu inah ne, ɓa hey ɓaye ŋ in ci na hee nguɗse ŋ kur ki, yatuus nu nik ɗah, yinooriŋ wa, ŋ kiis ciŋ laaɓɗi jen. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Ŋ kiis ciŋ laaɓɗi na haye, ɓa nangɗoh pesoha ŋ kur ci yakak ci, fu deg ca yaah. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Misra hey ɗaakke po kiis ci yasna-kanak ciŋ aɗi hay ɗah, ca telan ɓi kur ki raakiɗ pesoha po ɓa muc ŋ aɗi. »<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuusufa adgohiɗ Misra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Wa Yuusufa woo po a ƴutta, Firawnaana na dag caŋ ɗe jen hunnda ŋ woo kaŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Firawnaana woosa ɓa ne : « Ƴaari <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:38 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ngaŋ heber na gerek, feruuɗ ci na hotkeeɗi, na puuɗsi, na liiɓ ɓo', ceɗ ɓaah tiik. Ŋ heber wa nikka "<char style="tl">ruwah</char>", ŋ gerek, wa nikka "<char style="tl">pnewma</char>". Kon, ɓa woo "<char style="tl">ruwahiŋ</char> Kooh wala <char style="tl">pnewmaaniŋ</char> Kooh ɗah, wa yooɓɗi tokis. A mand na liiɓi nik ŋ ɗooƴ Kooh, a mand na in ci na hotkeeɗi. Ngaŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 2:2-4">Tum ci 2:2-4</ref></char> "<char style="tl">pnewmaaniŋ</char>" Kooh hayiɗ findi puuɗsi. A yi ɓoo teek "Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani" wala "Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh" ŋ saafi-saafi, waaye in ci kaahay ceem jen, ca ɗii ŋ ɗooƴi.</char></note> nik ŋ ɗooƴ ce yii, andi ɓoo minisiɗ raak mand na ɗe ? » <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />A woosa Yuusufa ne : « Nik ne Kooh teeɓiɗ ɗa in cii jen ɗah, ali ɓo' minɗi mand na ɗa ; fu ñaañiɗ, fu heɗ haf, <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />mbaa ɗah, ŋ hey ɗa adgiɗe, ɓi kur ki jen taambee ŋ woo kiŋ ɗa ; a tiikiŋ buuri ŋ nikoh dong weɗ ŋ uupohan ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Mbaa, ŋ degiɗ Misra jen ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗa. »<verse eid="GEN 41:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Firawnaana nihissa jaarndaŋ ɗe inhisohaana, a ɓekiɗta Yuusufa wa na kulɓa mbaseñ, a nammba ɗe tokiɗ ceen urus ŋ mbooh. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />A rapiɗta ɗe ŋ wotiira uup baah ɗal waŋ ɗe ɗah. Ɓi ɓo' adugka, ɓa weeɗa ne : « Haaƴɗukaat. » Firawnaana degoh Misra jen ɗaa ŋ yaah Yuusufa. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Firawnaana woosa Yuusufa ne : « Ñam Firawnaani, waaye ali ɓo' tumanɗi in ŋ Misra jen, te fu hunɗi nga. »<verse eid="GEN 41:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Firawnaana feriɗta Yuusufa tiik, Safnat-Peneya ; a onnda ɗe ɓitiɓ teeku Asnat, kuɓu Potifera, ɓoyi na <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗohe</char> ŋ kur-taaha na woyse On. Yuusufa taambohha nga, a adgohha Misra jen. <verse eid="GEN 41:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Wa Yuusufa na ɓayse ŋ ɗiskaŋ Firawnaana, buuraŋ Misra, tel ɗe raak kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30). A kurkohha ŋ ndeem, ne a taambiɗ Misra jen.<verse eid="GEN 41:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Wa kiis ca yasna-kanak caŋ laaɓɗa hay, kur ka laaɓiɗta keeh-keeh. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yuusufa nangɗohha pesohaaca a ɓayoh ŋ kiis ca yasna-kanak caŋ laaɓɗa, a ɗaakka ca ŋ kur-taah ca ; waa nu nga ɗa, ini nguɗohu ŋ ɗisik ci wila ɗaakuusa nga. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yuusufa nangɗohha bele po ca laayya findi merhey mi ŋ yaah-cookmi. Kaɗta po ɓa inhisɗi findi ca hend, ɓa faɗta ɓeesa.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Bala kiis caŋ aɗa hayan ɗah, Asnat kuɓu Potifera seeƴkiɗohaŋ kur ka na woyse On, raakeen kuɓu ƴaar kanak na Yuusufa. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />A teekka saawiŋ ɗe Manasse (tah alkoh) laam a woo ne : « Kooh oniɗ to ini na hee so tahe alkoh miskiɗ ciŋ ngo po caŋ kahan baab ɓoo sah. » <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />A teekka taambɗoha Efrayim (ɓasil) laam a woo ne : « Kooh tumiɗ to ɓasil ŋ kur ki ŋ torhiɗohu. »<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Wa kiis ca yasna-kanak caŋ laaɓɗa nikee ŋ Misra coot, <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />caŋ aɗa hayya findi Yuusufa woyohee wa. Kur ci jen nikka ŋ aɗ waaye pesoha raakeen ŋ Misra. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Wa aɗa ree nga ɓi kur ka, ɓa kaɗta ŋ Firawnaana, ɓa meekseeɗa ɗe ñamaah. A woosa ɓa jen ne : « Kaɗaat ŋ Yuusufa, in nu a woo ɗu ɗah, ɗu tum ineem. » <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Misra jen nikka ŋ aɗ. Yuusufa rangissa in ca ɓa ɗaakkohe, a tooneeɗa bele laam aɗa miskeen lool. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Ɓi ɓo' puloheeɗa ŋ kur ci wil Misra jen, ɓa heeɗa rome bele ŋ Yuusufa, laam, aɗa miskeen ŋ kehƴi jen.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Yaŋhooɓa woosiɗ kuɓuuciŋ ɗe Misra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa kerah ne <char style="w">Misra</char> raakiɗ bele, a woosa kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ne : « Ɗu ɓoof ye ? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Ŋ kerhiɗ ne bele raakiɗ ŋ Misra, kaɗaat ɗu roma nga, ɓoo raak pesoha, ɓoo kaanuu ŋ aɗi. » <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Taambɗoh ndaŋkiyaah ŋ ɓaŋ Yuusufa kaɗta roma bele ŋ Misra. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Waaye Yaŋhooɓa faɗeeɗi Benyaamin, yi ɓaah na Yuusufa yaay na baab, ne a kaɗ na ɓa, a neƴƴohee ne in rahas ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Wa kuɓuuciŋ Israayel aasee Misra, ɓa huntiɗkohee na ɓi romoh wiiriis, laam a kur kaŋ Kanaan jen nikee ŋ aɗ.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Waam raak a Yuusufa a yi adgohee kur ka na toonaŋ beleena. Taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe reesa nga ɗe, ɓa ƴekiɗta ɗe po puk ciŋ ɓa reesa kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Wa Yuusufa hot ɓa, a inhissa ɓa, waaye a mannda na ɓoyi inahɗi ɓa, a ngassa ɓa an : « Ɗu puloh nde ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo puloh Kanaan, ɓoo waaɗ rom pesoha. »<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Nikka ne Yuusufa inhisiɗ taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe, waaye, ɓa inhisɗi ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />A naandsukka heeƴ ca a heeƴee ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɓa. A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu espiyoŋ, ɗu hay ne ɗu marak ɗiski ɗu min taamb po ɗu saah kur ki. » <verse eid="GEN 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Muk kilifaani, ɓoo hay ne ɓoo rom pesoha dong. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Te ɓoo jen e ɓoo ɓaah baab yino, ɓoo ɓo' yurhiɗ kilifaani, ɓoo espiyoŋ haa. »<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Yuusufa woosa ɓa ne : « Ineem keeh haa, ɗu hay ne ɗu marak ɗiski ɗu min taamb po ɗu saah kur ki. » <verse eid="GEN 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, e ɓoo jen ɓaah baab yino, ɓoo gen Kanaan ; ɓoo nikee ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12), yinoora sooƴiɗ, ya uup ƴin yaa tassa na baabiŋ ɓoo. »<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Yuusufa woosa ɓa ne : « Ini ŋ woo ɗu weɗ raak, ɗu espiyoŋ, <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />waaye ŋ hey marke ndah ɗu woo keeh ; ŋ giñiɗ ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Firawna">Firawnaani</char> ne ɗu heyɗi kurke ndii feeh taambɗoh ɗu yi uup ƴin hayɗi ndii ɗah. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Woosaat ɓo' yino nga ɗu, a kaɗ ɗe ɓaya, ɓi tas nikohaah ŋ kasooni po ŋ marak ndah ɗu woo keeh ; wa nikɗi ɗah, ŋ giñiɗ ŋ Firawnaani ne ɗu espiyoŋ. »<verse eid="GEN 42:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Ƴutta, Yuusufa rannga ɓa neeh kaahay ŋ kasoona. <verse eid="GEN 42:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Ngaŋ neeha kaahayɗoh, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu hun ŋ ini maa hee ɗu woye ɗah, ɗu hey muce, laam ŋ nupiɗ Kooh. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Nik ne ɗu ɓo' yurhiɗ ɗah, yino nga ɗu tasaat ŋ kasooni, ɓi tas kom ɓi kahan ɗu bele, ɓeɗ ɓa nik ŋ aɗ. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Ƴut ɗah, komaat to taambɗoh ɗu yi ƴini, ŋ hey inhe ne ɗu woo keeh, ɗu min muc ngaŋ kakaan. » Ɓa teyɗukka ineem. <verse eid="GEN 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa an : « Cey ! A ini ɓoo tum taambɗoh ɓoo weɗ hay nga ɓoo, laam, wa a nik ŋ miskiɗ, a nakeeɗa ɓoo yirmu, ɓoo hotee nga te ɓoo sikɗukɗi ɗe. Ineem weɗ tah woti, ɓoo nammba nik ŋ miskiɗ. » <verse eid="GEN 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Ruben degga nga ne : « Ŋ woyeen ɗu ne ɓoo kanaat tum njaanji in, waaye ɗu sikɗukɗi so, weɗ tah, ɓoo deguuɗ miskiɗ woti sagu kiñin kiŋ ɗe ɓoo ɓay. » <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Ɓa liiɓee ne Yuusufa kerahɗi in ci ɓa woye, laam wa ɓa woyee na ɗe, a ƴaar a yi toksiɗee ɓa ; <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Yuusufa eɗta ɓa finho, a usɗukka ɓa, a fuɗeeɗa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:24">Wa Yuusufa fuɗ po ƴutta, a dokkissa woya na ɓa, a ɓayya Simeyong a tokka ɗe ŋ fikiiɓa. <verse eid="GEN 42:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />A nakohha ne saakuucaŋ ɓa soɗu bele po ca riif, ɓa tumɗu haalis caŋ ɓa nga, ɓa nam onu ñamaah ŋ waas ; ineem tumuusa. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Ƴutta taambɗoh caŋ ɗe siffa ca ŋ mbaam caŋ ɓa, ɓa cooteeɗa.<verse eid="GEN 42:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Ɓeɗ kaɗoh kaɗoh po ɓa tufukka ŋ ɗisik ne ɓa neeh nga, raak weka aasiɗ ; yino nga ɓa rangissa saakndaŋ ɗe ne a on mbaamaŋ ɗe ñamaah, a hotta haalsa a romohee ɓekuuɗ nga, ŋ nguɓaŋ wa, a feyuusa. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />A woosa ɓinooɓa ne : « Hee ! Ŋ doknuuɗ haalsiŋ ngo, weɗi wii, ŋ ɗooƴ saakndiŋ ngo. » Ɓa tiitta po ɓa saakɗoheeɗa, ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa an : « Kooh tum ɓoo ye an ? »<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Wa ɓa ree Kanaan ɗiskaŋ baab ɓa, ɓa naandsukka ɗe in ca rahas ɓa jen. <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ƴaara adgoh kur ka ngasee ngas ɓoo ; a amb ne ɓoo espiyoŋ. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Ɓoo lofiɗ ɗe ne ɓoo ɓo' yurhiɗ, ɓoo espiyoŋ haa. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />E ɓoo jen ɓaah baab yino, ɓoo nikee ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12), yinoora sooƴiɗ, ya uup ƴin yaa tassa na baabiŋ ɓoo ŋ Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Ƴaara loffa ɓoo ne a min inhoh ne ɓoo ɓo' yurhiɗ an : Ɓoo na hee faɗe ɓo' yino, a tas ndaam te ɓoo kom ɓi kahan ɓoo pesoha, ɓeɗ ɓi nik ŋ aɗ. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Ƴut ɗah, ɓoo kom ɗe taambɗoh ɓoo yi uup ƴin, ineem weɗ na hee ɗe teeɓe ne ɓoo ɓo' yurhiɗ, ɓoo espiyoŋ haa. Ŋ ineem, a faɗis taambɗoh ɓoo, te ɓoo hey mine wil ŋ kur ka. »<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Wa ɓa yiif saakuucaŋ ɓa, yaa nu nga hotta nafaanaŋ haalsa fu ɓayee ŋ saakndaŋ ɗa, ɓeɗ na baab ɓa jen ɓa jaahiɗta. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />A yi Yaŋhooɓa a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu ɓii reehiɗ kuɓuuciŋ ngo. Yuusufa na Simeyong sooƴiɗ, ɗu waaɗis ɓay Benyaamin, in ceem jen ŋ ɗafuk ko ! » <verse eid="GEN 42:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Ruben woosa ɗe ne : « Baab, degga Benyaamin ŋ yaah ciŋ ngo, ŋ hey ɗa ɗe wike, wa nikɗi ɗah, fu ap kuɓuuciŋ ngo kanak ci. » <verse eid="GEN 42:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Yaŋhooɓa loffa ne : « Muk, ŋ heyɗi faɗe kuɓkiŋ ngo a kaɗ na ɗu. Yakak ce kaaniɗ, a yi dong ŋ tasiɗ, in rahas ɗe ŋ waas ɗah, ŋ kiyaɓkookiŋ ngo wii, ŋ haadan Jaanim na aay-keeñ saguuɗu. »<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Benyaamin huniɗ na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe Misra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Aɗa uupeeɗa uup misik ŋ Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Wa ɓi kahan Yaŋhooɓa reehiɗ ñam beleeca ɓa ɓayohee <char style="w">Misra</char>, a woosa kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ne : « Kaɗissaat, ɗu romɗissa ɓoo pesoha ƴissuut. » <verse eid="GEN 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Yudaa loffa ɗe ne : « Ƴaara adgoh kur ka gapkiɗ ɓoo ne, a kanaat hotis ɓoo ŋ fikiice ne ɓoo hunɗi na taambɗoh ɓoo ɗah. <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Fu teyɗuk ne Benyaamin hun na ɓoo ɗah, ɓoo hey ɗa kee romɗa pesoha. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Waaye fu sang ɗah, ɓoo heyɗi kee laam, ƴaara woyeen ɓoo hooliɗ ne : “ Taambɗoh ɓoo hunɗi na ɓoo ɗah, a kanaat hotis ɓoo ŋ fikiice. ” »<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Israayel woyissa ɓa ne : « Ɗu tooñiɗ to, wa ye tah ɗu woosa ƴaara ne ɗu raakiɗ taambɗoh wiiriis ? » <verse eid="GEN 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ƴaara kat a yi meeksee ɓoo, a meeksisseeɗa ɓoo ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɓoo na ɓi kahni an : “ Ndah baabiŋ ɓoo ris pes ? ” - “ Ndah ɓoo raakiɗ taambɗoh wiiriis ? ” Ɓoo loffa ɗe ŋ in ceem, ɓoo moosɗi liiɓoh ne a hey ɓoo woye ne ɓoo komaat ɗe taambɗoh ɓoo. »<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Yudaa degga nga ne : « Baab faɗa Benyaamin ŋ yaah ciŋ ngo, ɓoo kaɗ, ɓoo min pes, ɓoo na ɗa na kuɓuuciŋ ɓoo, ɓoo kaanuu. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Ñam deguka, fu na hee so ɗe meekse ; ŋ komɗi ɗa ɗe ɗah, ineem taambɗaat to ŋ kipes kiŋ ngo jen. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Ɓoo kaɗee kaɗ ɗah, wii hee raake ɓoo tumiɗ kot kanak. »<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Weɗi Israayel woyoh ɓa ne : « Nik ne wa ɗaa ɗah, tumaat an : Ɓayndohaat ŋ in ciŋ kur ki baahiɗ ci findi diw faan na kuum na cuuraay na daakaande na ɓi saal, pistas na amand ; ɗu tum ca ŋ saakuuciŋ ɗu, ɗu kom ƴaara ca taambil. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Te ɗu ɓayndoh haalsi ɗu raak ŋ ɗooƴ saakuuciŋ ɗu ; wa miniɗ nik ne ɓa ɗaarkohee ɗaarkoh, ɗu nam ɓay haalis wiiriis romoha. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Ɓayaat taambɗoh ɗu te ɗu kaɗ ɗiskaŋ ƴaara. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Koohi Min ambohaat ɗu po ɗu misik ƴaara, a faɗis taambɗoh ɗu Simeyong na Benyaamin ɓa hayis na ɗu. Ŋ ini kaɗ nga so, nik ne maa hee hey ñake kuɓu ɗah, ŋ ñak rek. »<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Ƴaaɓa kooɗukka, ɓa ɓayya taambil ca, ɓa ɓayndohha haalis wiiriis degga ŋ wa ɓa kocee ɓay, ɓa hunnda na Benyaamin, ɓa raakka Yuusufa ŋ Misra. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Wa Yuusufa hot ɓa huniɗ na Benyaamin, a woosa ƴaara adgoh kahan ce ne : « Ɓaya ƴaaɓii kahna, fu ap ɗoopaat, fu haɓiɗ kañam, ɓaa hee ñaktuke na so woti. »<verse eid="GEN 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Ƴaara tummba ina Yuusufa woo ɗe, a ɓayya ƴaaɓa kahna. <verse eid="GEN 43:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Ɓa feyuusa ŋ ɓaya ɓa na ɓayse kahan Yuusufa, ɓa woosa ne : « Kaɗ wii ɗah, haalsi ɓoo raak ŋ saakuuciŋ ɓoo ŋ hayiŋ ɓoo koc, weɗ tah ɓa ɓayee ɓoo, ne ɓa amb ɓoo, ɓa tum ɓoo <char style="w">ñaam</char> ; ɓa nam naaf mbaam ciŋ ɓoo. »<verse eid="GEN 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Wa ɓa kaɗ po ɓa heeɗa aase, ɓa woosa ƴaara adgoh kahan Yuusufa ne : <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />« Kilifaani, ɗaasa ɓoo ƴissuut ; ɓoo kociɗ hay rome pesoha ndii. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Wa ɓoo haadee, e ɓoo kaɗ po ŋ waas, ŋ ɗiska ɓoo tufuk ne ɓoo neeh nga, ɓoo rangissa saakuuciŋ ɓoo, ɓoo hotta haalsi ɓoo romohee, ŋ findi wa hendee ŋ ɗooƴ ca, waaye ɓoo haytohiɗa. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Te ɓoo namiɗ ɓay kopor wiiriis romoha pesoha. Ɓoo inahɗi ɓoyi dokin koporeem ŋ saakuuciŋ ɓoo. »<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Ƴaara loffa ɓa ne : « Kanaat neƴƴohaat, wa jam ; a Koohiŋ ɗu, yiŋ baab ɗu, a yi tumiɗ ɗu alaleem ŋ saakuuciŋ ɗu ; ini kaɗ ŋ haalsiŋ ɗu, ŋ rahsiɗa. » Ŋ ineem ƴaara faɗsiɗta ɓa Simeyong. <verse eid="GEN 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />A ɓekka ɓa ŋ kahan Yuusufa, a onnda ɓa masuɓ ne ɓa naawis kot, a nammba on mbaam caŋ ɓa kañam. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Ɓa haɓiɗta taambil ca, ɓa sekeeɗa hayiŋ Yuusufa na noha laam, ɓa yegeen ne aa hee ñaktuke na ɓa.<verse eid="GEN 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Wa Yuusufa haad kahan ce, ɓa eɗta ɗe taambil ca ɓa ɓaye, ɓa ƴekiɗta ɗe po puk ciŋ ɓa reesa kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Yuusufa kañiɗta ɓa, a meekissa ɓa ne : « Baab ɗu ya ɗu wee so ne a yaɓko'iɗ, a tum na ? A ris pes e ? » <verse eid="GEN 43:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ee, baabiŋ ɓoo, ñaamiŋ ɗa, yaa ŋ jam, a ris pes. » Ɓa hiirra, ɓa ƴekɗissa ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 43:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Yuusufa marakka Benyaamin taambɗoh ce, yi a ɓaah na ɗe yaay na baab, a woosa ɓa ne : « Kon ƴaarii a yi taambɗoh ɗu, yi ƴini ɗu woyee so e ? Kuɓki nee, Kooh barke'ɗaat ɗa. »<verse eid="GEN 43:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Wa a hot taambɗoh ce, faaniŋ Yuusufa nuppa po a minisɗi amb muhun caŋ ɗe, a arra aas ŋ tuuƴ ce ne a fuɗ nga. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Wa a ƴut po a muktukka, a ndengɗukka, a hayissa ŋ taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe, a nakohha ne kañam ka deƴsaat. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Yuusufa deƴƴuusa kiik ce, taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe nammba deƴƴu kiik ɓa, ɓinooɓa genee Misra nammba deƴƴu kiik ɓa, laam, wa nikee in sanguuɗ nga ɓa ne ɓa ɓaah na Heber ca kañam. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Taambɗoh ciŋ Yuusufa ɓoofɗuusa taambtiɗohiɗ ini amboh ŋ saawa po ŋ ya uup ƴin, ɓa yurhiɗkohha na ɗe ; ɓa feyuusa ɓa markoheeɗa. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Yuusufa nakohha ɓa eɗu kañam ca nikee ŋ fikiice. Benyaamin uupiɗta taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe nga waas yatuus. Ɓa ƴutta, ɓa annda biiñ po keeñ ciŋ ɓa soossa.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Yuusufa markiskiɗ taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Wa ɓa ƴut ŋ ñakta, Yuusufa nakka ƴaara adgohee kahan ce ne : « Tumɗa ƴaaɓii pesoha ini saakuuciŋ ɓa min ɓay, yaa nu nga ɗah, fu ɓekiɗ ɗe haalsiŋ ɗe ŋ saakndiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Te fu nam ɓekndoh kaasiŋ ngo haalsi ŋ ɗooƴ saakndiŋ ƴaari uup ƴin nga ɓa. » Ƴaara tummba ina Yuusufa nak ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Wa Kooh wiis na ɓaaɓa teel, ƴaaɓa woyuusa ne ɓa miniɗ coot ; ɓa siffa mbaam caŋ ɓa, ɓa cooteeɗa. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Ɓa pulla kur ka waaye bala ɓa usan ɗah, Yuusufa woosa ƴaara ne : « Daba ƴaaɓa, fu meekis ɓa ne : Wa ye tah ɓa tumɗuusa baahiɗ po ƴut, ɓa wirndohhaa baahaaɗi ? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Kaasi ɓa rok weɗ mi na anohe te weɗ mi na name markiskoh ; ini ɓa tum sepƴiɗ. »<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Ƴaara dabba ɓa, a woosa ɓa ineem. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, fu na yambe ɓoo ye an ? Ɓoo tumanɗi muk in mand ɗaa. <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Fu hot nga, wa ɓoo puloh Kanaan, ɓoo haytoh haytoh haalsi ɓoo raakee ŋ saakuuciŋ ɓoo. Mbaa ɓoo min na rokoh urus wala haalis ŋ kahan kilifaaniŋ ɗa ? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Ɓo' nu fu hot na kaaseem ɗah, a apsaat ; te ɓoo ɓi tas, ɓoo nik <char style="w">ñaam</char> ciŋ ɗa, kilifaani. » <verse eid="GEN 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Ee, ŋ teyɗukiɗ ini ɗu woo, waaye a ƴaari rok dong, a yi ŋ amban ñaam, ɓi tas hool nga. »<verse eid="GEN 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Ɓa arra ruhsiɗ saakuucaŋ ɓa, yaa nu nga ɗa rangissa waŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Ƴaara markeeɗa, a cambohha waŋ yakkaŋ ɓa po waŋ ƴaara uup ƴin. Kaasa hotohuusa ŋ saakndaŋ Benyaamin. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Jaarra jaar, keeñ ciŋ ɓa reehha, tahha po ɓa faarra kulɓaacaŋ ɓa. Ƴutta ɓa degissa saakuuca ŋ mbaam caŋ ɓa, ɓa dokkissa ɗiska na Yuusufa.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Wa Yudaa na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ree kahan Yuusufa, ɓa raak ɗe ris nga, ɓa raɗukka ŋ kehƴi, ŋ fikiice. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Yuusufa woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu haɓiɗ ye wii ? Hanaa, ɗu inahɗi ne ɓo' findiiso na mine min markis ? » <verse eid="GEN 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yudaa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo raakɗi woyaah, kilifaani, ɓoo minɗi taasuk po ɓoo hool ŋ inii, laam a Kooh wiñ ɓoo. Ɓoo na hee hey ambsukohe jen ɓoo nik ñaam ciŋ ɗa, ɓoo na ƴaari hotu na kaasi. » <verse eid="GEN 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />A woosa ɓa ne : « Muk, ŋ supkiɗ tum ineem, a ƴaari hotu na kaasi dong a yi nikan ñaamiŋ ngo ; ɓi tas haad ŋ baabiŋ ɓa moɗoɗ. »<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudaa kiimɗiɗ Benyaamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Weɗi Yudaa reɓoh nga ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani ɗaas so, on ndo ŋ woo na ɗa, te kanaa so ayruk, laam fu na <char style="w" lemma="Firawna">Firawnaani</char>, e ɗu hend. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Wa ɓoo koc hay ndii, kilifaani, fu meekseen ɓoo ne : Ndah baabiŋ ɓoo ris pes ? Ndah ɓoo raakiɗ taambɗoh wiiriis ? <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Ɓoo loffa ɗa ne, kilifaani, baabiŋ ɓoo yaa nga, a yaɓko'iɗ lool te ɓoo raakiɗ taambɗoh ƴin, yi fu inah ne, a raak ɗe ŋ kiyaɓkookiŋ ɗe. Yakak njaanjeem kaaniɗ, a yi dong a tasiɗ ŋ kuɓuuci a raak na yaayiŋ ɓa, a keeñkohiɗ ɗe lool.<verse eid="GEN 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Fu woosa ɓoo ne, ɓoo ɓayɗaat ɗa njaanjeem, fu hotoot ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Ɓoo woosa ɗa ne, kilifaani : Kuɓkeem minɗi saɓsukoh na baab ɓa. A saɓsukoh na ɗe ɗah, baab ɓa hey kaane. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Fu woosa ɓoo ne kilifaani, feeh taambɗoh ɓoo yeem hayɗi ɗah, fu waaɗisɗi hot ɓoo ŋ fikiifu. <verse eid="GEN 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Ɓoo kaɗta ŋ baabiŋ ɓoo, ñaamiŋ ɗa, ɓoo woosa ɗe ini fu woo. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Wa a woyis ɓoo ne, ɓoo hayaat ɓa romɗise pesoha, <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />ɓoo woosa ɗe ne, ɓoo minɗi kaɗ te ɓoo hunɗi na taambɗoh ɓoo, mbaa kilifaanaŋ kur ka teyɗukanɗi ɓoo.<verse eid="GEN 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Baabiŋ ɓoo, ñaamiŋ ɗa, loffa ɓoo ne : “ Ɗu inhiɗ ne ŋ raak kuɓu kanak dong na yaay ɓa, <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />yinoori sooƴiɗ, ŋ amb ne, a sifiñsohuuɗ, ŋ hotisɗi ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Ɗu waaɗis ɓay yi tas ɗah, ŋ kiyaɓkookiŋ ngo wii, in rahas ɗe ɗah, ŋ hey haade Jaanim na aay-keeñ saguuɗu. ”<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />Ɗiski wa nik ndii kilifaani, ŋ haad ŋ baab ɓoo, te ɓoo hunɗi na njaanji a na iikohe ɗah, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />a hey kaane ŋ kiyaɓkookiŋ ɗe, te e ɓoo ɓekan ɗe aay-keeñi ɓayan ɗe Jaanim. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Ɓaatta nga, mi, ŋ haf fo, ñam woyee ɗe ne, a ñam deguka, ne ŋ wikɗi ɗe njaanji ɗah, ahhaaneem taambɗaat to ŋ kipes kiŋ ngo jen. <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Mbaa, mi yii kiim ɗa, kilifaani, ne ŋ tas ndii, ŋ nik ñaamiŋ ɗa, te fu faɗ njaanji, a hun na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe a haad. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Ŋ minɗi dokuk muk ŋ baab ɓoo, te ŋ hunɗi na ɗe. Ŋ minɗi maasoh muk naamooni baab na hee kooɗohe ŋ ineem. »<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Yuusufa teeɓkiɗ taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Wa Yuusufa kerah woo ceem, a minisɗi amb haf ce ŋ fiki ɓooɓa nikee ŋ ɗiska. A woosa <char style="w">ñaam</char> caŋ ɗe ne ɓa pulaat, a tassa nga na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe dong, a hannda ɓa woo ne a yi Yuusufa. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />A fuɗeeɗa ŋ ɗafka, ɓi <char style="w">Misra</char> kerheeɗa ɗe po ɓi kahan <char style="w" lemma="Firawna">Firawnaana</char> sah inahha ini raak. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yuusufa woosa taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ne : « Ñam Yuusufa, ndah baab ɓoo ris pes ? » Waaye ali ɓo' minɗi ɗe lof nga ɓa sagu tiit.<verse eid="GEN 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Yuusufa woosa ɓa ne : « Reɓaat nga so. » Ɓa reɓpa. A woosa ɓa ne : « Ñam Yuusufa taambɗoh ɗu, ya ɗu toonee ne a haytohu Misra. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Tooni ɗu toon ndo kanaat ɗu misik laam, a Kooh tuuƴ co, ŋ adugka ɗu ndii ne ɗu min muc. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Kiis kanak ceɗɗi kur ki weɗi ŋ aɗ, te kiis yatuus ŋ fikiiri guur raakanɗi nga, nguɗ raakanɗi. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Kooh a yi tuuƴ co ndii, ŋ adugka ɗu ne ɗu min raak muc yakiɗ ne cuuɓiŋ ɗu sooƴuu. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />E ɗu ɓay yo ndii haa, a Kooh. A yi tum mbo kilifaani uup reɓ Firawnaani, ŋ adgohha kahan ce na Misra jen.<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />Ɗiski wa nik ndii, araat kaɗ ŋ baab ɓoo ɗu woo ɗe ne, kuɓkiŋ ɗe Yuusufa woo ne, Kooh tumiɗ ɗe kilifaaniŋ Misra jen, a hayaat findi wa uup gaawoh, <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />a hey gene ŋ kur ki na woyse Gosen, a yi na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe, na set ciŋ ɗe, na ɗoopaat ciŋ ɗe, na ini a raak jen ; a nik ŋ serooso. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Ŋ hey ɗe eɗe in ci a etoh jen ne a pes, a yi na ɓooɓiŋ ɗe, na gat ciŋ ɗe ; ɗu ñakanɗi ali in. Kiis ci yatuus ci na haye, ca na hee name nik kiis aɗ. »<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />A woyissa ne : « E ɗu hotoot, na ɗa Benyaamin, ñam na wee na ɗu, mi yi Yuusufa ; <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />naandsukaat baab kiyak ki ŋ raak ŋ Misra na ini ɗu hot jen, te ɗu hay na ɗe ndii findi wa uup gaawoh. » <verse eid="GEN 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />A morgiɗukka taambɗoh ce Benyaamin, yeem morgiɗukka ɗe, ɓa fuɗeeɗa. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />A nammba morgiɗkoh na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ɓinooɓi, ɓa ambsohhaa na fuɗ, ɓa hannda min woo na ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Wa Firawnaana kerah ŋ kahan ce ne taambɗoh ciŋ Yuusufa hayiɗ Misra, a neɓuusa nga, a yi na dag caŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />A woosa Yuusufa ne : « Woya taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa, ɓa sif mbaam ciŋ ɓa, ɓa dokuk Kanaan <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />ne ɓa hay na baab ɓa na ɓooɓaŋ ɓa nik ndaam. Ŋ hey ɓa eɗe merhey mi uup baah ŋ kur ki, ɓa gen nga te ɓa pesohan kañam baahiɗ nga. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Nama woo taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa, ɓa ɓay sareet yakak ndii, haytohoha ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɓa na kuɓuuciŋ ɓa na baab ɗu. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Te in ca ɓaa hee faɗe ndaam kanaat ɓa misik laam, ɓaa hee gene na in ci uup baah ŋ Misra. »<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Kuɓuuciŋ Israayel tumohha ɗaa. Yuusufa eɗta ɓa sareet ca yakak ca findi Firawnaana nakoh ɗe wa, na ñamaah ŋ waas. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />A onnda yaa nu nga ɗah kulɓa, waaye a eɗta Benyaamin <char style="w">ƴel haalis</char> teemet-kaahay (300) na kulɓa yatuus. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />A nammba woosoh baab ɓa hayoha, mbaam naar ndaŋkiyaah, sifuuɗ yaa nu nga ɗah, ŋ in ca uup baah ŋ Misra, na mbaam riɓ ndaŋkiyaah, sifuuɗ bele, mbuuru na pesoha wiiriis. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />A woosa taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ne ɓa kanaat ñaɗoh ŋ waas, ƴutta a faɗta ɓa, ɓa kaɗeeɗa.<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Ɓeɗ pul Misra kotii, ɓa aassa Kanaan. Wa ɓa ree ŋ baab ɓa Yaŋhooɓa, <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Baab, Yuusufa ris pes ! A yi sah adgoh kur kaŋ Misra jen. » Waaye ineem yoondiɗɗi Yaŋhooɓa, laam a koseeɗi ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 45:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Ɓa naandsukka ɗe in ca Yuusufa woo ɓa jen, a nammba hot sareet ca Yuusufa eɗoh ne ca ɓay ɗe, a hannda raak jam. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />A woosa ne : « Woo ki reehiɗ. Kuɓkiŋ ngo Yuusufa ris pes. Ŋ hey ɗe kee hota bala ŋ kaanan ɗah. »<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Kaɗaŋ Yaŋhooɓa Misra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Israayel kurkoh ɗaa, a ɓayya ina a raakee jen a kaɗeeɗa <char style="w">Misra</char>. A reesa Beerseba, a <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴukka</char> ŋ Koohiŋ baab ɓa Isaahha. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Ŋ wek, Kooh ɓeeɗukka ɗe ŋ heeƴ an : « Yaŋhooɓa ! Yaŋhooɓa ! » A loffa ne : « Ee ! Mi yii kerah ɗa. » <verse eid="GEN 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Kooh woosa ɗe ne : « Ñam Kooh, Koohiŋ baab ɗu, kana neƴƴoh kaɗ Misra, ŋ hey pulɗohe cuuɓ angiɗ nga ɗa, ŋ ndaam. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Mi, ŋ haf fo, ŋ hey ɗa ɓende fu kaɗ te ñam na hee ɗa wike. A Yuusufa tufkan kakaan kiŋ ɗa. » <verse eid="GEN 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Yaŋhooɓa kurkohha Beerseba, kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ɓayya ɗe, a yi na ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɓa, na komaakciŋ ɓa, ŋ sareet ca <char style="w" lemma="Firawna">Firawnaana</char> eɗohee ne ca haytoh ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Ɓa ɓayndohha ɗoopaat caŋ ɓa na in ca ɓa raakoh ŋ Kanaan, a kaɗoh Misra ɗaa na ɓi kahan ce jen, <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />a hunnda na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe na set ciŋ ɗe, ƴaar na ɓitiɓ ɓa kaɗeeɗa.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi rimkoh ŋ Yaŋhooɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Ɓii ɓeɗ rimkoh ŋ Israayel te ɓa hayya Misra : Yaŋhooɓa na saawiŋ ɗe Ruben.<verse eid="GEN 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Ruben na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci : Hanook, Pallu, Hesroon na Karmii.<verse eid="GEN 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Simeyong na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci : Yemuwel, Yamiin, Ohad, Yakiin, Sohar na Sawul yi yaay ɓa ɓaah nga ɓi Kanaan.<verse eid="GEN 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Lewi na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci : Geerson, Kehaat na Meraari.<verse eid="GEN 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Yudaa na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci : Seela, Peeres na Seerah. Ɓiŋ ɗe ƴaar ci ɓinooɓi Eer na Onaan, ɓa kaanoh Kanaan.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GEN 46:12">Peeres raakeen kuɓu ƴaar kanak : Hesroon na Haamuul.<verse eid="GEN 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Issaakar na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci : Toola, Puwaa, Yob na Simroon.<verse eid="GEN 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Sabuloon na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci : Sered, Eloon na Yahleel.<verse eid="GEN 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Ɓeem ɓeɗ kuɓuuci Leya na Yaŋhooɓa raakoh Paddan-Aram na kuɓuuciŋ ɓa. Dinaa kuɓkiŋ ɓa ɓitɓi ɓaatu nga ɗah, ɓa nikan ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay na kaahay (33).<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Gaad na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci : Sifon, Haggi, Suuni, Esboon, Eeri, Aroodi na Areeli.<verse eid="GEN 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Aser na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci : Yimna, Yiswa, Yiswi na Beriya. Ɓaatta nga Serah taambɗoh ɓa ɓitiɓ.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GEN 46:17">Beriya nameen raak kuɓu ƴaar kanak : Heber na Malkiyel.<verse eid="GEN 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Ɓeem ɓeɗ kuɓuuci na set ci Yaŋhooɓa raak na Silpa, <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaama</char> Laban eɗee kuɓkiŋ ɗe Leya. Ɓa jen ɓa nikee ndaŋkiyaah na yasna-yino (16).<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Yaŋhooɓa na ɓitiice Rasel raakee kuɓu ƴaar kanak : Yuusufa na Benyaamin.<verse eid="GEN 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Yuusufa raakka kuɓu ƴaar kanak : Manasse na Efrayim. A raakoh ɓa Misra na ɓitiice Asnat kuɓu Potifera, <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗohaŋ</char> kur-taaha na woyse On.<verse eid="GEN 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Benyaamin na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci : Bela, Beker, Asbel, Geera, Naaman, Eehi, Roos, Muppiim, Huppiim na Arde.<verse eid="GEN 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Ɓeem ɓeɗ kuɓuuci na set ci Yaŋhooɓa raak na Rasel. Ɓa jen ɓa nikee ndaŋkiyaah na nikiis (14).<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Daan raakee kuɓu yino teeku Husiim.<verse eid="GEN 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Naftaali na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci : Yahce'eel, Guuni, Yeeser na Sillem.<verse eid="GEN 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Ɓeem ɓeɗ kuɓuuci na set ci Yaŋhooɓa raak na Bilha, ñaama Laban eɗee kuɓkiŋ ɗe Rasel. Ɓa jen, ɓa nikee yasna-kanak.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Ɓi rimkoh ŋ Yaŋhooɓa te ɓa hunnda na ɗe Misra jen ɓa nikee ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-yino na yasna-yino (66), ne ɓitiɓ ciŋ kuɓuuciŋ ɗe kinndohuuɗi nga ɗah. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Kuɓuuci kanak ci Yuusufa raakoh Misra ɓaatu nga ɗah, ɓa jen, ɓa nikan ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak (70). Ɓeem ɓeɗ ɓi rimkoh ŋ Yaŋhooɓa te ɓa nikka na ɗe Misra.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaŋhooɓa hotohiɗ na Yuusufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Yaŋhooɓa tuuƴee Yudaa ŋ Yuusufa ne a adug ɗe ɗiska na woyse Gosen. Wa Yaŋhooɓa na ɓi kahan ce ree Gosen, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yuusufa nakohha wotiiraŋ ɗe tokɗu, a kaɗta raaka baab ɓa nga, yi nam teeku Israayel. A hot ɗe hot rek, a nuppa, a morgiɗukka ɗe, a fuɗeeɗa in maañiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Israayel woosa ɗe ne : « Ɗiski wa nik ndii, ŋ miniɗ kaan kotii, laam ŋ hotisiɗ ɗa, te fu yii pes. »<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Weɗi Yuusufa woyoh taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe na ɓi kahan baab ɓa ne : « Mi yii kaɗ woya Firawnaana ne taambɗoh ciŋ ngo na ɓi kahan baab ɓoo, ɓa nikee ŋ Kanaan, ɓa hayiɗ ɗiskiŋ ngo. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Ŋ hey ɗe woye ne ɗu niiɗoh pe' na mbaal na inoh te ɗu haytohiɗ ca na raak-raakiŋ ɗu jen. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Firawnaani ɓeeɗuk ɗu, a meekis ɗu ini ɗu na pangke ɗah, <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />woyaat ɗe ne ɗu niiɗoh, te ina ɗu nikoh komaaki po wi, ɗu inah weɗi, findi caac ciŋ ɗu. Ŋ ineem ɗu hey mine gen Gosen, laam gen na niiɗoh wa in sanguuɗ nga ɓi Misra. »<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="s">Yaŋhooɓa na ɓi kahan ce ŋ Gosen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Wa Yuusufa ƴut woo na ɓi kahan ɓa, a kaɗta ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Firawna">Firawnaana</char> a woosa ɗe ne : « Baab ɓoo na taambɗoh ciŋ ngo pulohiɗ Kanaan, ɓa ɗaa ŋ Gosen na ɗoopaat caŋ ɓa na raak-raakaŋ ɓa jen. »<verse eid="GEN 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Yuusufa huneen na yatuus ŋ taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe, ne ɓa teekɗukoh na Firawnaana. <verse eid="GEN 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Firawnaana meekissa ɓa ne : « Pangkiŋ ɗu wa ye ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo niiɗoh, kilifaani, findi caacuuciŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Ɓoo hay ne ɓoo nikohaah ŋ kur ki, laam aɗi miskiɗ lool ŋ kur kaŋ Kanaan, po ɓoo raakisɗi ɗiski ɓoo niiɗan ɗoopaat ciŋ ɓoo. Ɓoo na kiimee ɗa ne fu on ɓoo, ɓoo nik ŋ Gosen. » <verse eid="GEN 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Firawnaana woosa Yuusufa ne : « Baab ɗu na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa hayiɗ nga ɗa. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Kur ki weɗi ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗa, ɓayaa ɓa ŋ ɗiski uup baah nga, ɓa nik ŋ Gosen ; te fu hot miniɗ niiɗ nga ɓa ɗah, fu eɗ ɓa ɗoopaat ciŋ ngo. » <verse eid="GEN 47:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Yuusufa nammba ɓay baab ɓa ne a teekɗukoh na Firawnaana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:7">Yaŋhooɓa barke'iɗta ɗe, <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />yeem hannda ɗe meekis ne : « Fu raak kiis hend na ? » <verse eid="GEN 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yaŋhooɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kiis teemet na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (130) ceɗi cii, mi yii wil ŋ kur ci, ca kiis gaawiɗ te ca miskiɗ. Ŋ raakɗi kiis ci caacuuciŋ ngo raakee ndoom te ɓa namee nik tiindoh findiiso. » <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Ƴutta, a barke'iɗta Firawnaana, a cootta.<verse eid="GEN 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Ƴutta, Yuusufa ɓayya baab ɓa na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe, a daliɗta ɓa ŋ Ramses, ŋ ɗiska uup baah ŋ <char style="w">Misra</char>, findi Firawnaana nakoh ɗe wa. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />A nammba ɓa eɗ ñamaah, baab ɓa na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe na ɓi kahan baab ɓa, yaa nu nga ɗah findi kuɓuuciŋ ɗe hend.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Findi ɓi Misra moocoh na aɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Aɗa miskeen lool po ali kañam raakisɗi ŋ Misra na Kanaan, ɓooɓa looffa keeh-keeh sagu aɗuk ; <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yuusufa nangɗohha haalsaŋ Kanaan na waŋ Misra jen, wa ɓa romohe bele, a ɓayyaa kahan Firawnaana.<verse eid="GEN 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Wa kaɗta po ali haalis raakisɗi ŋ Misra na Kanaan, ɓi Misra jen hayya ŋ Yuusufa ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Hanaa fu heyɗi ɓoo markiɗe po ɓoo kaan ŋ aɗi. Eɗa ɓoo pesoha laam ɓoo raakisɗi ali haalis romoha. » <verse eid="GEN 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yuusufa woosa ɓa ne : « Nik ne ɗu raakisɗi haalis ɗah, ɓayaat ɗoopaat ciŋ ɗu, ŋ lofiɗ ɗu ca pesoha. » <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Weɗi ɓa ɓayoh panis caŋ ɓa, mbaal ca, pe' ca, inoh ca na mbaam ca jen, ɓa eɗeeɗa Yuusufa ca, a lofɗeeɗa ɓa ca bele. Ɓa raakka pesoha ŋ kiis kaam.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Wa kiis ka reeh, ɓa hayissa ŋ Yuusufa ɓa woyissa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, fu inhiɗ ne ɓoo raakisɗi haalis te ɗoopaat ciŋ ɓoo ceɗi na ɗa, ɓoo tasɗisɗi ali in romoha, nikɗi faan ciŋ ɓoo na keheƴ ciŋ ɓoo ɗah. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Hanaa fu heyɗi ɓoo markiɗe, po ɓoo kaan na aɗ, yohon ciŋ ɓoo kasaara. Romoha ɓoo pees, ɓoo na yohon ciŋ ɓoo, ɓoo nik <char style="w">ñaam</char> ciŋ Firawnaani. Eɗa ɓoo tisoh, ɓoo min pes, keheƴ ci nikuu ɓarang ɓarang. »<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Weɗi Yuusufa romɗoh Firawnaana kehƴaŋ Misra jen. Yaa nu nik ŋ Misra ɗah, toonnda yohon ce sagu miska aɗa miske. Merhey maŋ kur ka jen nikka wuu Firawnaana kotii, <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Yuusufa tummba ɓa gen nga ñaam ɓak po ɓak ŋ kur ka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Raakiɗ fiis ŋ fiis ci ɗeɓgaan, ci woo ne : "Yuusufa nangɗohha ɓooɓa jen ŋ kur ca yakak ca."</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Keheƴ caŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">seeƴkiɗoh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ɗeɓgaan, ɓooɓa meeɗ meeɗ <char style="w">seeƴuk</char> ne ɓa ñaamuk Kooh. Ngaŋ <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char>, e <char style="w">Aaruna</char>, yakak Musaa, na ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe, ɓeɗ nikee seeƴkiɗoh ci. Ɓa meeɗ seeƴuk wuu Kooh, ŋ tiikiŋ cuuɓi jen. Ɓa meeɗ seeƴuk ne Kooh ɗaas ɓa bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa, wala ɓa corkiɗee ɗe, wala ɓa yakɗee ɗe. Wa ɓooɓa camb ñaamuk kooh ci nikaaɗiici, ɓa namee nam seeƴuk, te ɓooɓi adgohee seeƴkeem, ɓa namee ɓeeɗkohu seeƴkiɗoh. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Seeƴkiɗoh cii, ɓa seeƴkiɗoh wuu Kooh haa, ɓa seeƴkiɗoh ciŋ kooh ciŋ ɓi Misra ŋ jamanoonaam.</char></note> ca dong ceɗ Yuusufa tasee rom laam, ɓa raakeen pesoha sagu ina Firawnaana meeɗ ɓa waɗ ; weɗ tah ɓa tooneeɗi yohon caŋ ɓa.<verse eid="GEN 47:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Yuusufa woosa ɓooɓa ne : « Ɗiski wa nik ndii, ɗu romuuɗ, a Firawnaani raak ɗu na keheƴ ciŋ ɗu. Tisoh ceɗi cii, sokaat yohon ci, <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />waaye yatuus nu pul nga ɗah, a Firawnaani raakan yinoori, ɗu raak nikiis ci tas, ɗu puliɗ tisoh nga, ɗu nam raak pesoha, ɗu na kuɓuuciŋ ɗu na ɓi gen na ɗu jen. » <verse eid="GEN 47:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Ɓa woosa ne : « Kilifaani, ɓoo teyɗukiɗ nik ñaam ciŋ Firawnaani laam fu baahohiɗ ɓoo te fu mucɗiɗ ɓoo. » <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Yuusufa tufkiɗoh ineem ɗaa ŋ Misra ŋ jamanoonaam te wa ris nga po ɗiski maa woyohe na ɗu ndii. Yatuus nu nguɗohu ŋ keheƴ ciŋ Misra ɗah, a Firawnaani na raake yinoori po tas keheƴ ciŋ seeƴkiɗoh ci laam a raakɗi ca.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dengkohaŋ Yaŋhooɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Israayel ci, ɓa risee ŋ Misra, ŋ kur ka na woyse Gosen, ɓa ɓasilla nga lool te ɓa raakka keheƴ nga. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yaŋhooɓa tumiɗ kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis yasna-kanak (17) ŋ Misra. Ini a pes jen wa kiis teemet na kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis na kiis yasna-kanak (147).<verse eid="GEN 47:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Wa Israayel kaɗ po a inahha ne kakaan kiŋ ɗe usisɗi, a ɓeeɗukka kuɓkiŋ ɗe Yuusufa, a woosa ɗe ne : « Nik ne fu kerhiɗiɗ to ɗah, ooɓa yaahiŋ ɗa ŋ rambiŋ ngo, fu giñ ne ŋ kaan ɗah, fu hey yo baahohe po, fu uumbuu so ŋ Misra, <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />waaye fu hey yo ɓaye po ŋ ɗiska caacuucaŋ ngo uumbu, fu uumb mbo nga. » Yuusufa loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ hey ɗa tumɗe findi fu woyoha. » <verse eid="GEN 47:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Israayel woosa ne : « Giñiɗ to ineem. » A ginnjaa. Ndeem Israayel yippa pukiŋ ɗe ŋ haf fiƴaangaŋ ɗe, a ñaamukka Kooh.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Yaŋhooɓa barke'ɗiɗ kuɓuuciŋ Yuusufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Wa in ceem coot, ɓa woosa Yuusufa ne baab ɓa kosaayiɗ. A kaɗta nga na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe kanak ci Manasse na Efrayim. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Yaŋhooɓa woyuusa ne kuɓkiŋ ɗe Yuusufa hayiɗ ɗe marke, a ndengɗukka po a ɓooffa ŋ ɗafuk fiƴaangiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />A woosa Yuusufa ne : « Koohi Min teeɓkeen ndo ŋ Luus ŋ kur kaŋ Kanaan, a barke'iɗta so. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />A woosa so ne : “ Ŋ hey ɗa tume ɓasil po fu nik caaciŋ ɓi cuuɓi cuuɓ te ŋ hey one ɓi na hee rimkohe nga ɗa kur kii, ɓa raakoota po faw. ” <verse eid="GEN 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Ɗiski wa nik ndii, kuɓuuciŋ ɗa kanak ci fu raakoh ŋ <char style="w">Misra</char> bala ŋ hayan ɗah, ɓa na hee nike ɓiŋ ngo ; Manasse na Efrayim nikan kuɓuuciŋ ngo findi Ruben na Simeyong. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Waaye ɓi fu na hee raakisse, ɓa na hee nike ɓiŋ ɗa, ɓa laman ngaŋ waɗiŋ yakak ciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Wa ŋ puloh Paddan-Aram, Rasel kaannda, kaan miskohiɗ ŋ kur kaŋ Kanaan ; a yaa ŋ uummba ndaam, ŋ sereendaŋ waasa bala fu reyan Efraata ɗah. » Efraata, weɗ nam teeku Betlehem.<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Weɗi Israayel hotoh komaakciŋ Yuusufa a meeksohha ne : « E ɓinde ɓii ? » <verse eid="GEN 48:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yuusufa loffa ɗe ne : « E kuɓuuci Kooh onoh ho ndii. » A woosa ɗe ne : « Reɓɗaa ɓa ndii, ŋ barke'iɗ ɓa. » <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Wa raak Israayel yaɓko'iɗ po has ciŋ ɗe neɓisɗi. Yuusufa reɓiɗta komaakca nga ɗe, a morgiɗukka ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />A woosa Yuusufa ne : « Ŋ liiɓeeɗi ne ŋ hey ɗa hotisse, waaye fu hot nga, Kooh teeɓiɗ to sah kuɓuuciŋ ɗa. »<verse eid="GEN 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Yuusufa kurkiɗohha ɓa ŋ kot ciŋ baab ɓa, a ƴekka po pukiŋ ɗe reesa kehƴi. <verse eid="GEN 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Ƴutta, a ammba Efrayim ŋ yaahiŋ ɗe ñaahmi, yeem lahha baab ɓa Israayel yaah-sing, a ammba Manasse ŋ yaahiŋ ɗe singi, yeem nammba lah Israayel ŋ ñaahmiŋ ɗe ; a reɓiɗta ɓa ŋ baab-caaciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Waaye Israayel sufɗohha yaah ciŋ ɗe, a degga wi ñaahmi ŋ hafiŋ Efrayim yi nikee ƴini ; a degga wi singi ŋ hafiŋ Manasse na ina a nikee saawa jen. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />A barke'iɗta Yuusufa an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">« Mi yii kiim Kooh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">yi Ibrahiima na Isaahha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">ñaakɗe ŋ kipes kiŋ ɓa jen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Kooh yi na niiɗee so</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">ina ŋ nikoh po wii,<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />malaakaani muciɗ to</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">ŋ siɓin nu nik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">a barke'ɗaat komaakcii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">po tiikiŋ ngo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">na ciŋ paamuuciŋ ngo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Ibrahiima na Isaahha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">kerhu saguuɓa ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">ɓa rimaatɗohaat laayiɗ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">ŋ kehƴi jen. »<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Wa Yuusufa hot ne baab ɓa deg yaahiŋ ɗe ñaahmi ŋ hafiŋ Efrayim, a neɓuuɗi ; a ammba yaahiŋ baab ɓa ne a yongisa ŋ hafiŋ Manasse, <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />a woosa baab ɓa ne : « Wa ɗaa haa baab, yii a yi saawi, dega yaahiŋ ɗa ñaahmi ŋ hafiŋ ɗe kay ! » <verse eid="GEN 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Waaye baab ɓa sannga, a woosa Yuusufa ne : « Kuɓkiŋ ngo, ineem ŋ inhiɗa, ŋ inhiɗa baahiɗ. Manasse hey name raak cuuɓ angiɗ, waaye a taambɗoh ce na hee ɗe uupe, ɓi cuuɓi cuuɓ hey pulohe nga ɓi na hee rimkohe ŋ Efrayim. » <verse eid="GEN 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Mbaɗi, Yaŋhooɓa barke'iɗta ɓa, a woosa ne : « Israayel ci hey kiimohe barke ŋ tiik ciŋ ɗu an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">Kooh barke'ɗaat ɗa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">findi a barke'ɗoh Efrayim na Manasse. »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="GEN 48:20">Yaŋhooɓa adgiɗoh Efrayim ɗaa, a degga Manasse nga.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Wa a ƴut, a woosa Yuusufa ne : « Kakaan kiŋ ngo usisɗi, waaye Kooh hey rise na ɗu te a hey ɗu dokne ŋ kur kaŋ caacuuciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Ŋ hey ɗa waɗe ini uup wiŋ taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa, ɓaya Sisem, kur ki ŋ naaf na ndangiŋ ngo na ɓis ciŋ ngo ngaŋ cuuɓiŋ Amoor ci. »<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Yaŋhooɓa barke'ɗiɗ kuɓuuciŋ ɗe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa ƴut barke'iɗ kuɓuuciŋ Yuusufa, a nammba ɓeeɗuk kuɓuuciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɓa ne :</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 49:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:1">« Hayaat, ŋ woo ɗu kimiŋ ɗu.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />Nangɗukohaat, ɗu sikɗuk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">ɗu ɓi kuɓuuciŋ Yaŋhooɓa ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">sikɗukaat to mi yi Israayel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">baab ɗu.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Ruben, saawiŋ ngo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">a fu teeɓoh ne ŋ ƴaar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">raak ko na hatil.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">A fu uupiɗ taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">cir na hatil.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Fu mand na masuɓ baliɗ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">waaye fu mirndohanɗi adug,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">fu mbetiɗ ciriŋ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">wa fu sot fiƴaangiŋ baab ɗu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:22">Camba 35:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />Simeyong na Lewi yino.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:5">Ɓeɗ na hune ne ɓa tum aƴaarkoha.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 34:25-31">Camba 34:25-31</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Muk ! Ŋ kanaat hun na ɓa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">ŋ ini ɓaa waakohe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">te ŋ waaɗɗi maasoh coh ciŋ ɓa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">Ŋ ayrukiŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">ɓa apiɗ ɓi ɓo' ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">te ŋ ini neɓ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">ɓa nguɗiɗ sir kot naar inoh.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Wa alku'aat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">ayrukohaaɗiŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">wi hun na hatil weem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">na aay-keeñiŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">wi hunɗi na yeeɓuk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">Ŋ hey ɓa paysohe ŋ kahan Yaŋhooɓa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">ŋ pasaroh ɓa ŋ Israayel.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Yudaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">a fu taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa ƴeekan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">te fu hey tahe ɓi sang ɗa hiir.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">Taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">hey ɗa ƴekɗe.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Yudaa kuɓkiŋ ngo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">fu gaynde cociɗ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">gayndeeni puloh ñama doɓ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">faanukka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">ya ɓa kaañ ɗe kurkiɗ ?<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Salmaari na yilfohse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">saɓsukohanɗi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">na yaah ciŋ ɓi kahan Yudaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">Te inhisoha buur</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">kurkanɗi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">ŋ harmban kot ciŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">po mbaɗna heɗ wa keeh-keeh hayan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">A yi fu inah ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">cuuɓ ci jen hey ɗe kerhiɗe.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />A hey laaye tas reseñ po,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">a layee mbaamiŋ ɗe nga ca</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">te cumbri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">toksan ŋ ci uup baah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">A naawohan kulɓaakiŋ ɗe biiñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">na lipiŋ ɗe ñif reseñ.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Biiñ laayiɗ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:12">hey ruumndiɗe has ciŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:12">te miis laayiɗ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:12">hey yaanwiɗe sis ciŋ ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />Sabuloon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">a genan sereendiŋ cookmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">ɗiski gaal ci na serse.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">Ini amboh ndeem po Sidoon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">wa ɓaahan ŋ kehƴiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />Issaakar mbaam ngooŋka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:14">a na ɗasɗuke ŋ ɗisik</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:14">ne a iɗsiɗuk.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />A hotiɗ ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">ɗiski a nik baahiɗ iɗsiɗkoha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">te kur ki neɓiɗ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">A ƴuugiɗ ne a sifuk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">a yi waɗuk pangki miskiɗiŋ <char style="w">ñaam</char>.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Daan hey raake cuuɓi a adgohan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:16">findi cuuɓ ciŋ Israayel cinooci.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Daan mandan na laɓriifi raɗuk ŋ waas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">hirñi duluuruk ŋ sero waas ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">laɓriif na ɗoɓe panis ŋ kot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">ƴaari rap ɗe keen kaƴaarsukiɗ.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />Eey, Nikiɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:18">ŋ oolkoh ɗa ne fu naaf fo.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />Gaad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">ɓi ɓo' aƴaarkiɗ ɓeɗ keenan ɗe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">waaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">a hey ɓa wiindsuke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">po a ngek ɓa.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Aser,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:20">kehƴiŋ ɗe hey laaɓe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:20">te weɗ eɗohan kañam ci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:20">ci min kaɗ ŋ buur.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Naftaali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:21">a ngaayi raak haf ce,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:21">yi na raake buul moɗiɗ.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Yuusufa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">a naak kidig rimiɗ ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">kidgi paar ŋ sero masuɓ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">te naak ciŋ wa cootukka ɗingi.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Ɓi weesoh ɓis keeniɗ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">ɓa weessa ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">ɓa tummba ɗe sanguuɗ ;<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Waaye a ris ambiɗ haliini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">amb moɗoɗ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">te yaah ciŋ ɗe neɓiɗ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">sagu hatiliŋ Koohiŋ Yaŋhooɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">Kooh yi Niiɗohi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">a nammba nik Atoh fiŋ Israayel.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Koohiŋ baab ɗu hirpaat ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">Koohi Min barke'ɗaat ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">a on ɗa toɓi na pulohe ɗafki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">na masmi na pulohe ŋ kehƴi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">a on ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">ɓitiɓ ci na ɗoopaat ci nik ɓasloh.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Barkeeniŋ baab ɗu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">weɗi uup in ci baahiɗ ciŋ tangooci ɗeɓgaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Raakiɗ fiis, ŋ fiis ci ɗeɓgaan, ci woo ne : "Barkeeni ŋ eɗ ɗu, weɗ uup wi caac ca eɗoh".</char></note> ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">wa cootkiɗ raak-raak ciŋ tangooci maañohngaan ci.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">Barkeeneem ruhsaat nga ɗa Yuusufa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">fu yi kilifaaniŋ taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />Benyaamin a ɓaakoɓ saahiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">a na ɓaaɓe ñam ini a ap,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">niin reesa ɗah, a paysoh ini tas. »<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Woo ceem ceɗ baab ɓa barke'ɗoh ɓa, yaa nu nga ɗah, a eɗta ɗa wa hun na ɗa. Ɓeem, ɓeɗ fer cuuɓ ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12) ciŋ Israayel.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaŋhooɓa kurkiɗ nga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Wa a ƴut barke'iɗ kuɓuuciŋ ɗe, Yaŋhooɓa woosa ɓa ne : « Haadiŋ ngo Jaanim usisɗi, ŋ kuruk nga ɗah, uumbaat to ŋ sero caacuuciŋ ngo, ŋ huraŋ atoh fa nik ŋ ɗooƴ yohon Efron yi ɓaahee ŋ cuuɓiŋ Hit ci, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />ngaŋ Makpela ŋ sero Mamre, ŋ kur kaŋ Kanaan. Yohneem weɗi Ibrahiima romee ŋ Efron ne a tuma ruy-ruy caŋ ɗe. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />A uumbu nga na ɓitiice Saarata, Isaahha nam uumbu nga na ɓitiice Rebeka te ŋ namis uumb Leya nga. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Yohna na huraŋ atoh fa nik nga romohu ŋ cuuɓiŋ Hit ci. » <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Wa Yaŋhooɓa ƴut nak kuɓuuciŋ ɗe in ceem, a faankissa, weɗ a nguɗoh, a haadda Jaanim.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="s">Ruyaŋ Yaŋhooɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Weɗi Yuusufa morgiɗkoh baab ɓa, a fuɗeeɗa fuɗ miskiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />A woosa paƴoh caŋ ɗe ne ɓa haɓɗaat ɗe ; ɓa haɓiɗta fiɗaafaŋ Israayel na diw eeñiɗ. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Ŋ findi ɓa meeɗ tumoh, ɓa raakka neeh ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40) na haɓɗaŋ wa. Ɓi <char style="w">Misra</char> rooyya ɗe ini ree neeh ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak (70).<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Wa neeh caŋ rooy ca coot, Yuusufa woosa dag caŋ <char style="w" lemma="Firawna">Firawnaana</char> ne : « Nik ne ɗu kerhiɗiɗ to ɗah, kaɗaat ŋ Firawnaani ɗu woyiɗ to ɗe ne : <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />Wi baab ɓoo hee kaane, a giñɗukoheen ndo ne a kuruk nga ɗah, ŋ uumbaat ɗe ŋ kur kaŋ Kanaan, ŋ ruy-ruya a haɓɗiɗ haf ce. Weɗi tah ŋ waaɗ ne, a on ndo ŋ kaɗ tuma ineem, ŋ hay. »<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Wa Firawnaana kerah woo keem, a woosa Yuusufa ne : « Fu miniɗ kaɗ uumba baab ɗu findi fu giñɗohee ɗe wa. » <verse eid="GEN 50:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Yuusufa hunnda na dag caŋ Firawnaana jen, na yakak caŋ Misra, <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />na ɓi kahan ce, na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe, na ɓi kahan baab ɓa ; ali ɓo' taseeɗi ŋ Gosen ɗal komaakca ƴin ca na ɗoopaat ca ɗah, a kaɗta uumba baab ɓa ; <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />ɓi wotiir na ɓi panis rapuuɗ darra ɓa, wa nikka mboolo yakoh na yakoh, ɓa kaɗeeɗa.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Ɓeɗ kaɗoh kaɗoh po, ɓa reesa Goren-Ataat, ŋ ɓak Yurdan, ɓa rooyya Yaŋhooɓa ndaam, rooy keeh-keeh. Yuusufa ruyiɗta baab ɓa neeh yasna-kanak. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Wa ɓi Kanaan hot mboolndaŋ ruya, ŋ Goren-Ataat, ɓa woosa ne : « Ruyiŋ ɓi Misra wii deey, wa yakiɗ lool ! » Weɗ tah ndaam ŋ sero Yurdan, ferɗuusa Abel-Misrayim (ruyiŋ ɓi Misra). <verse eid="GEN 50:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Ŋ ineem, kuɓuuciŋ Yaŋhooɓa tumiɗta baab ɓa ina a nakee ɓa : <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Ɓa ɓayya fiɗaafaŋ ɗe kur kaŋ Kanaan, ndaam, ɓa uummba ɗe ŋ huraŋ atoh fa ŋ yohna nik ŋ Makpela, ŋ sero Mamre. Yohneem weɗi Ibrahiima romee ŋ Efron yi ɓaahee ŋ cuuɓiŋ Hit ci ; a tummbaa ruy-ruyiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="GEN 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuusufa ɗaasiɗ taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Wa Yuusufa ɗaak baab ɓa po ƴutta, a dokukka Misra, a yi na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe, na ɓooɓa ɓendee ɗe jen. <verse eid="GEN 50:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe hotta ne baab ɓa kurkiɗ nga, ɓa woosa ne : « Wa miniɗ nik ne Yuusufa ɗaakɗiɗ ɓoo aay-keeñ, ne a wirind ɓoo in ci moɗaaɗiici ɓoo tum ɗe jen. » <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Ɓa woosohha nga ɗe ne bala baab ɓa kaanan ɗah, a woyeen ne : <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />« Woyɗaat to Yuusufa ne a ɗaasɗaat to taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe, ŋ in ci moɗaaɗiici ɓa tum ɗe jen, laam ɓa tooñiɗ ɗe keeh-keeh. Mbaa mi yii kiim ɗe ne a ɗaas ɓa, laam ɓa <char style="w">ñaam</char> ciŋ Koohiŋ baab ɓa. » Wa woo keem ree ŋ Yuusufa, a fuɗeeɗa.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Ŋ ineem taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe hayootta nga ɗe, ɓa raɗukka ŋ fikiice, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo ñaam ciŋ ɗa. » <verse eid="GEN 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Waaye Yuusufa woosa ɓa ne : « Kanaat neƴƴoh, ɗu liiɓ ne e mi Kooh e ? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Wa keeh ne ɗu waaɗee so tum in moɗaaɗi, waaye Kooh ɓoƴsiɗa baahiɗ. Laam, a waaɗee muciɗ kiñin laayiɗ ŋ findi ɗu hotoha an. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Mbaa kanaat neƴƴoh, ŋ hey ɗu taambkohe, ɗu na komaakciŋ ɗu. » Yuusufa giifɗoh taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ɗaa, a ñaahha ɓa ne ɓa ndengɗuk.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mirndaaniŋ kipes kiŋ Yuusufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yuusufa na ɓi kahan baab ɓa genee Misra. Ini a pes jen wa kiis teemet na kiis ndaŋkiyaah (110). <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />A maasohiɗ kuɓuuci na set ciŋ Efrayim ; kuɓuuciŋ setiŋ ɗe Makir yi kuɓkiŋ Manasse, a yi koɗ ɓa.<verse eid="GEN 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Bala a kaanan ɗah, Yuusufa woyeen taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ne : « Ŋ mand na kurkiɗ nga, waaye wa hooliɗ to ne Kooh hey ɗu ambohe ; te a hey ɗu dokne ŋ kur ka a gapee Ibrahiima, Isaahha na Yaŋhooɓa. <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Waaye Kooh tum, ɗu kaɗee ɗah, giñɗaat to ne, ɗu hey ɓayndohe ƴoh ciŋ ngo. » <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Yuusufa kaanoh Misra wa a raak kiis teemet na kiis ndaŋkiyaah (110). Ɓa haɓiɗta fiɗaafaŋ ɗe na diw eeñiɗ, ɓa ɓekkaa ŋ jaat.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>